msgid "A clean, accessible and powerful Drupal administration theme with a strong focus on improving the editorial experience."
msgstr "一个干净、易于访问且功能强大的 Drupal 管理主题，重点关注改善编辑体验。"

msgid "Admin theme with a strong focus on improving the Editorial Experience. Learn more about Gin’s <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/contributed-themes/gin-admin-theme/specific-settings-within-gin\" target=\"_blank\">Settings</a> and how to customize Gin in our <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/contributed-themes/gin-admin-theme/custom-theming\" target=\"_blank\">Custom theming guide</a>."
msgstr "管理主题重点关注改善编辑体验。在我们的 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/contributed-themes/gin-admin-theme/custom-theming\" target=\"_blank\"> 自定义主题指南</a> 中了解有关 Gin 的 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/contributed-themes/gin-admin-theme/specific-settings-within-gin\" target=\"_blank\">Settings</a> 以及如何自定义 Gin 的更多信息。"

msgid "Responsive base theme for Drupal."
msgstr "Drupal 的响应式基本主题。"

msgid "An intentionally plain theme to demonstrate and test default HTML and CSS. Stark should not be used as a base theme. Instead, build a custom theme using the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/develop/theming-drupal\">Theming Guide</a> as a reference."
msgstr "一个故意简单的主题来演示和测试默认的 HTML 和 CSS。 Stark 不应该用作基本主题。相反，请使用 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/develop/theming-drupal\">Theming Guide</a> 作为参考来构建自定义主题。"

msgid "Note that the administration theme is still set to the %admin_theme theme; consequently, the theme on this page remains unchanged. All non-administrative sections of the site, however, will show the selected %selected_theme theme by default."
msgstr "请注意，管理主题仍设置为 %admin_theme 主题；因此，此页面的主题保持不变。但是，站点的所有非管理部分将默认显示所选的 %selected_theme 主题。"

