msgid "Set to %none to disable inheritance of the parent value and prevent the output of this metatag entirely."
msgstr "设置为 %none 可禁用父值的继承并完全阻止此元标记的输出。"

msgid "The text to display in the title bar of a visitor's web browser when they view this page. This meta tag may also be used as the title of the page when a visitor bookmarks or favorites this page, or as the page title in a search engine result. It is common to append '[site:name]' to the end of this, so the site's name is automatically added. It is recommended that the title is no greater than 55 - 65 characters long, including spaces."
msgstr "当访问者查看此页面时，在其 Web 浏览器的标题栏中显示的文本。当访问者为该页面添加书签或收藏夹时，该元标记还可以用作该页面的标题，或者用作搜索引擎结果中的页面标题。通常将“[site:name]”附加到其末尾，因此会自动添加站点名称。建议标题长度不超过 55 - 65 个字符（包括空格）。"

msgid "A brief and concise summary of the page's content that is a maximum of 160 characters in length. The description meta tag may be used by search engines to display a snippet about the page in search results."
msgstr "页面内容的简短摘要，长度最多为 160 个字符。搜索引擎可以使用描述元标签来在搜索结果中显示有关页面的片段。"

msgid "A brief and concise summary of the page's content, preferably 150 characters or less. Where as the description meta tag may be used by search engines to display a snippet about the page in search results, the abstract tag may be used to archive a summary about the page. This meta tag is <em>no longer</em> supported by major search engines."
msgstr "页面内容的简短摘要，最好不超过 150 个字符。搜索引擎可以使用描述元标签来在搜索结果中显示关于页面的片段，而抽象标签可以用于存档关于页面的摘要。这个元标记是<em>，不再是</em>，主要搜索引擎都支持。"

msgid "A comma-separated list of keywords about the page. This meta tag is <em>no longer</em> supported by most search engines."
msgstr "有关页面的以逗号分隔的关键字列表。这个元标记是大多数搜索引擎支持的<em>不再是</em>。"

msgid "A location's two-letter international country code, with an optional two-letter region, e.g. 'US-NH' for New Hampshire in the USA."
msgstr "位置的两字母国际国家/地区代码，带有可选的两字母区域，例如“US-NH”代表美国新罕布什尔州。"

msgid "Geo-spatial information in 'latitude, longitude' format, e.g. '50.167958, -97.133185'; <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>see Wikipedia for details</a>."
msgstr "“纬度，经度”格式的地理空间信息，例如'50.167958，-97.133185'； <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'> 有关详细信息，请参阅维基百科</a>。"

msgid "A location's formal name."
msgstr "地点的正式名称。"

msgid "Geo-spatial information in 'latitude; longitude' format, e.g. '50.167958; -97.133185'; <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate system'>see Wikipedia for details</a>."
msgstr "“纬度”中的地理空间信息；经度' 格式，例如'50.167958； -97.133185'; <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate system'> 有关详细信息，请参阅维基百科</a>。"

msgid "A brief URL, often created by a URL shortening service."
msgstr "简短的 URL，通常由 URL 缩短服务创建。"

msgid "A link to the preferred page location or URL of the content of this page, to help eliminate duplicate content penalties from search engines."
msgstr "指向该页面内容的首选页面位置或 URL 的链接，以帮助消除搜索引擎对重复内容的处罚。"

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='prev' link."
msgstr "通过提供带有 rel='prev' 链接的 URL，用于分页内容。"

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='next' link."
msgstr "通过提供带有 rel='next' 链接的 URL，用于分页内容。"

msgid "Define the author of a page."
msgstr "定义页面的作者。"

msgid "This will be able to extract the URL from an image field if the field is configured properly."
msgstr "如果该字段配置正确，这将能够从图像字段中提取 URL。"

msgid "An image associated with this page, for use as a thumbnail in social networks and other services."
msgstr "与此页面关联的图像，用作社交网络和其他服务中的缩略图。"

msgid "Used to indicate the URL that broke the story, and can link to either an internal URL or an external source. If the full URL is not known it is acceptable to use a partial URL or just the domain name."
msgstr "用于指示爆料的 URL，并且可以链接到内部 URL 或外部源。如果不知道完整的 URL，则可以使用部分 URL 或仅使用域名。"

msgid "Describes the name and version number of the software or publishing tool used to create the page."
msgstr "描述用于创建页面的软件或发布工具的名称和版本号。"

msgid "Details about intellectual property, such as copyright or trademarks; does not automatically protect the site's content or intellectual property."
msgstr "有关知识产权的详细信息，例如版权或商标；不会自动保护网站的内容或知识产权。"

msgid "Used to rate content for audience appropriateness. This tag has little known influence on search engine rankings, but can be used by browsers, browser extensions, and apps. The <a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>most common options</a> are general, mature, restricted, 14 years, safe for kids. If you follow the <a href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>RTA Documentation</a> you should enter RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA"
msgstr "用于对内容的受众适宜性进行评级。此标签对搜索引擎排名的影响鲜为人知，但可以由浏览器、浏览器扩展和应用程序使用。 <a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>最常见的选项</a>是通用的、成熟的、受限的、14年的、对儿童安全的。如果您遵循 <a href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>RTA 文档</a>，则应输入 RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA"

msgid "This meta tag communicates with Google. There are currently two directives supported: 'nositelinkssearchbox' to not to show the sitelinks search box, and 'notranslate' to ask Google not to offer a translation of the page. Both options may be added, just separate them with a comma. See <a href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>meta tags that Google understands</a> for further details."
msgstr "此元标记与 Google 进行通信。目前支持两个指令：“nositelinkssearchbox”不显示附加链接搜索框，“notranslate”要求 Google 不提供页面翻译。两个选项都可以添加，只需用逗号分隔即可。如需了解更多详情，请参阅 <a href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>Google 可以识别的元标记</a>。"

msgid "The number of seconds to wait before refreshing the page. May also force redirect to another page using the format '5; url=https://example.com/', which would be triggered after five seconds."
msgstr "刷新页面之前等待的秒数。还可能使用格式 '5; 强制重定向到另一个页面。 url=https://example.com/'，五秒后触发。"

msgid "<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Sets a cookie</a> on the visitor's browser. Can be in either NAME=VALUE format, or a more verbose format including the path and expiration date; see the link for full details on the syntax."
msgstr "<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'> 在访问者的浏览器上设置 cookie</a>。可以采用 NAME=VALUE 格式，也可以采用更详细的格式，包括路径和到期日期；有关语法的完整详细信息，请参阅链接。"

msgid "Tell search engines when to index the page again. Very few search engines support this tag, it is more useful to use an <a href='https://www.drupal.org/project/xmlsitemap'>XML Sitemap</a> file."
msgstr "告诉搜索引擎何时再次索引该页面。很少有搜索引擎支持此标签，使用 <a href='https://www.drupal.org/project/xmlsitemap'>XML Sitemap</a> 文件更有用。"

msgid "Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Pragma meta tag."
msgstr "用于控制浏览器是否在本地缓存特定页面。不常用。应与 Pragma 元标记结合使用。"

msgid "Control when the browser's internal cache of the current page should expire. The date must to be an <a href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a>-compliant date string that is represented in Greenwich Mean Time (GMT), e.g. 'Thu, 01 Sep 2016 00:12:56 GMT'. Set to '0' to stop the page being cached entirely."
msgstr "控制当前页面的浏览器内部缓存何时到期。日期必须是符合 <a href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a> 的日期字符串，以格林威治标准时间 (GMT) 表示，例如“2016 年 9 月 1 日星期四 00:12:56 GMT”。设置为“0”可完全停止缓存页面。"

msgid "Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Cache-Control meta tag."
msgstr "用于控制浏览器是否在本地缓存特定页面。不常用。应与 Cache-Control 元标记结合使用。"

msgid "The word that appears before the content's title in a sentence. The default ignores this value, the 'Automatic' value should be sufficient if this is actually needed."
msgstr "句子中出现在内容标题之前的单词。默认情况下忽略此值，如果实际需要，“自动”值应该足够了。"

msgid "A human-readable name for the site, e.g., <em>IMDb</em>."
msgstr "站点的人类可读名称，例如 <em>IMDb</em>。"

msgid "The type of the content, e.g., <em>movie</em>."
msgstr "内容的类型，例如 <em>movie</em>。"

msgid "Preferred page location or URL to help eliminate duplicate content for search engines, e.g., <em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."
msgstr "首选页面位置或 URL，以帮助消除搜索引擎的重复内容，例如 <em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>。"

msgid "The title of the content, e.g., <em>The Rock</em>."
msgstr "内容的标题，例如 <em>The Rock</em>。"

msgid "A one to two sentence description of the content."
msgstr "一到两句话的内容描述。"

msgid "Multiple values may be used, separated by `:delimiter`. Note: Tokens that return multiple values will be handled automatically."
msgstr "可以使用多个值，用 `:delimiter` 分隔。注意：返回多个值的令牌将被自动处理。"

msgid "The URL of an image which should represent the content. The image must be at least 200 x 200 pixels in size; 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum size, and for best results use an image least 1200 x 630 pixels in size. Supports PNG, JPEG and GIF formats. Should not be used if og:image:url is used. Note: if multiple images are added many services (e.g. Facebook) will default to the largest image, not specifically the first one."
msgstr "应代表内容的图像的 URL。图片大小必须至少为 200 x 200 像素；建议的最小尺寸为 600 x 316 像素，为获得最佳效果，请使用尺寸至少为 1200 x 630 像素的图像。支持 PNG、JPEG 和 GIF 格式。如果使用 og:image:url，则不应使用。注意：如果添加多个图像，许多服务（例如 Facebook）将默认使用最大的图像，而不是第一个图像。"

msgid "The URL of an video which should represent the content. For best results use a source that is at least 1200 x 630 pixels in size, but at least 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum. Object types supported include video.episode, video.movie, video.other, and video.tv_show."
msgstr "应代表内容的视频的 URL。为了获得最佳效果，请使用尺寸至少为 1200 x 630 像素的源，但建议的最小值至少为 600 x 316 像素。支持的对象类型包括 video.episode、video.movi​​e、video.other 和 video.tv_show。"

msgid "A alternative version of og:image and has exactly the same requirements; only one needs to be used."
msgstr "og:image 的替代版本具有完全相同的要求；只需要使用一个。"

msgid "Any URLs which start with \"http://\" will be converted to \"https://\"."
msgstr "任何以“http://”开头的 URL 都将转换为“https://”。"

msgid "The secure URL (HTTPS) of an video which should represent the content."
msgstr "应代表内容的视频的安全 URL (HTTPS)。"

msgid "The secure URL (HTTPS) of an image which should represent the content. The image must be at least 200 x 200 pixels in size; 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum size, and for best results use an image least 1200 x 630 pixels in size. Supports PNG, JPEG and GIF formats."
msgstr "应代表内容的图像的安全 URL (HTTPS)。图片大小必须至少为 200 x 200 像素；建议的最小尺寸为 600 x 316 像素，为获得最佳效果，请使用尺寸至少为 1200 x 630 像素的图像。支持 PNG、JPEG 和 GIF 格式。"

msgid "The type of video referenced above. Should be either  video.episode, video.movie, video.other, and video.tv_show. Note: there should be one value for each video, and having more than there are videos may cause problems."
msgstr "上面提到的视频类型。应该是 video.episode、video.movi​​e、video.other 和 video.tv_show。注意：每个视频应该有一个值，超过视频数量可能会导致问题。"

msgid "The type of image referenced above. Should be either 'image/gif' for a GIF image, 'image/jpeg' for a JPG/JPEG image, or 'image/png' for a PNG image. Note: there should be one value for each image, and having more than there are images may cause problems."
msgstr "上面引用的图像类型。对于 GIF 图像，应为“image/gif”；对于 JPG/JPEG 图像，应为“image/jpeg”；对于 PNG 图像，应为“image/png”。注意：每个图像应该有一个值，超过图像数量可能会导致问题。"

msgid "The width of the above image(s). Note: if both the unsecured and secured images are provided, they should both be the same size."
msgstr "上面图像的宽度。注意：如果同时提供了不安全和安全图像，则它们的大小应相同。"

msgid "The height of the above video(s). Note: if both the unsecured and secured videos are provided, they should both be the same size."
msgstr "上述视频的高度。注意：如果同时提供不安全和安全视频，则它们的大小应相同。"

msgid "The height of the above image(s). Note: if both the unsecured and secured images are provided, they should both be the same size."
msgstr "上面图像的高度。注意：如果同时提供了不安全和安全图像，则它们的大小应相同。"

msgid "The length of the video in seconds"
msgstr "视频长度（以秒为单位）"

msgid "A description of what is in the image, not a caption. If the page specifies an og:image it should specify og:image:alt."
msgstr "对图像内容的描述，而不是标题。如果页面指定 og:image，则应指定 og:image:alt。"

msgid "The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> format. Can be the same as the 'Article modification date' tag."
msgstr "上次修改此内容的日期，带有可选时间值。需要采用 <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> 格式。可以与“文章修改日期”标签相同。"

msgid "URLs to related content"
msgstr "相关内容的 URL"

msgid "The locale these tags are marked up in, must be in the format language_TERRITORY. Default is 'en_US'."
msgstr "标记这些标签的区域设置必须采用 language_TERRITORY 格式。默认为“en_US”。"

msgid "Other locales this content is available in, must be in the format language_TERRITORY, e.g. 'fr_FR'."
msgstr "此内容可用的其他区域设置必须采用 language_TERRITORY 格式，例如'fr_FR'。"

msgid "The fediverse @username for the content creator / author for this page, including the first @ symbol."
msgstr "此页面的内容创建者/作者的 fediverse @username，包括第一个 @ 符号。"

msgid "Links an article to an author's Facebook profile, should be either URLs to the author's profile page or their Facebook profile IDs."
msgstr "将文章链接到作者的 Facebook 个人资料，应该是作者个人资料页面的 URL 或其 Facebook 个人资料 ID。"

msgid "Links an article to a publisher's Facebook page."
msgstr "将文章链接到发布者的 Facebook 页面。"

msgid "The primary section of this website the content belongs to."
msgstr "该内容所属的本网站的主要部分。"

msgid "Appropriate keywords for this content."
msgstr "此内容的适当关键字。"

msgid "The date this content was published on, with an optional time value. Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> format."
msgstr "此内容的发布日期，带有可选的时间值。需要采用 <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> 格式。"

msgid "The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> format."
msgstr "上次修改此内容的日期，带有可选时间值。需要采用 <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> 格式。"

msgid "The date this content will expire, with an optional time value. Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> format."
msgstr "此内容的过期日期，带有可选的时间值。需要采用 <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> 格式。"

msgid "Links a book to an author's Facebook profile, should be either URLs to the author's profile page or their Facebook profile IDs."
msgstr "将书籍链接到作者的 Facebook 个人资料，应该是作者个人资料页面的 URL 或其 Facebook 个人资料 ID。"

msgid "The Book's ISBN"
msgstr "本书的 ISBN"

msgid "The date the book was released."
msgstr "该书的发行日期。"

msgid "The URL to an audio file that complements this object."
msgstr "补充该对象的音频文件的 URL。"

msgid "The secure URL to an audio file that complements this object. All 'http://' URLs will automatically be converted to 'https://'."
msgstr "补充该对象的音频文件的安全 URL。所有“http://”URL 将自动转换为“https://”。"

msgid "The MIME type of the audio file. Examples include 'application/mp3' for an MP3 file."
msgstr "音频文件的 MIME 类型。示例包括 MP3 文件的“application/mp3”。"

msgid "The first name of the person who's Profile page this is."
msgstr "这是个人资料页面上的人的名字。"

msgid "The person's last name."
msgstr "此人的姓氏。"

msgid "Any of Facebook's gender values should be allowed, the initial two being 'male' and 'female'."
msgstr "Facebook 的任何性别价值观都应该被允许，前两个是“男性”和“女性”。"

msgid "A pseudonym / alias of this person."
msgstr "此人的笔名/别名。"

msgid "Links to the Facebook profiles for actor(s) that appear in the video."
msgstr "视频中出现的演员的 Facebook 个人资料链接。"

msgid "The roles of the actor(s)."
msgstr "演员的角色。"

msgid "Links to the Facebook profiles for director(s) that worked on the video."
msgstr "制作该视频的导演的 Facebook 个人资料链接。"

msgid "The date the video was released."
msgstr "视频发布日期。"

msgid "The TV show this series belongs to."
msgstr "该系列所属的电视剧。"

msgid "Tag words associated with this video."
msgstr "与该视频相关的标签词。"

msgid "Links to the Facebook profiles for scriptwriter(s) for the video."
msgstr "视频编剧的 Facebook 个人资料链接。"

msgid "A description that concisely summarizes the content of the page, as appropriate for presentation within a Tweet. Do not re-use the title text as the description, or use this field to describe the general services provided by the website. The string will be truncated, by Twitter, at the word to 200 characters."
msgstr "简洁总结页面内容的描述，适合在推文中呈现。请勿重复使用标题文本作为描述，或使用该字段来描述网站提供的一般服务。 Twitter 将将该字符串截断为 200 个字符。"

msgid "The @username for the website, which will be displayed in the Card's footer; must include the @ symbol."
msgstr "网站的 @username，将显示在卡的页脚中；必须包含@符号。"

msgid "The page's title, which should be concise; it will be truncated at 70 characters by Twitter. This field is required unless this the 'type' field is set to 'photo'."
msgstr "页面的标题，应该简洁； Twitter 会将其截断为 70 个字符。除非“类型”字段设置为“照片”，否则此字段是必需的。"

msgid "The numerical Twitter account ID for the website, which will be displayed in the Card's footer."
msgstr "网站的数字 Twitter 帐户 ID，将显示在卡片的页脚中。"

msgid "The @username for the content creator / author for this page, including the @ symbol."
msgstr "@username 表示该页面的内容创建者/作者，包括 @ 符号。"

msgid "The numerical Twitter account ID for the content creator / author for this page."
msgstr "此页面的内容创建者/作者的数字 Twitter 帐户 ID。"

msgid "The alternative text of the image being linked to. Limited to 420 characters."
msgstr "链接到的图像的替代文本。限制为 420 个字符。"

msgid "The URL to a unique image representing the content of the page. Do not use a generic image such as your website logo, author photo, or other image that spans multiple pages. Images larger than 120x120px will be resized and cropped square based on longest dimension. Images smaller than 60x60px will not be shown. If the 'type' is set to Photo then the image must be at least 280x150px."
msgstr "代表页面内容的唯一图像的 URL。请勿使用通用图像，例如网站徽标、作者照片或跨多个页面的其他图像。大于 120x120 像素的图像将根据最长尺寸调整大小并裁剪成正方形。小于 60x60px 的图像将不会显示。如果“类型”设置为照片，则图像必须至少为 280x150 像素。"

msgid "If your application is not available in the US App Store, you must set this value to the two-letter country code for the App Store that contains your application."
msgstr "如果您的应用程序在美国 App Store 中不可用，则必须将此值设置为包含您的应用程序的 App Store 的两个字母的国家/地区代码。"

msgid "The name of the iPhone app."
msgstr "iPhone 应用程序的名称。"

msgid "The iPhone app's custom URL scheme (must include \"://\" after the scheme name)."
msgstr "iPhone 应用程序的自定义 URL 方案（方案名称后必须包含“://”）。"

msgid "String value, should be the numeric representation of your iPhone app's ID in the App Store."
msgstr "字符串值，应该是您的 iPhone 应用程序在 App Store 中的 ID 的数字表示形式。"

msgid "The name of the iPad app."
msgstr "iPad 应用程序的名称。"

msgid "String value, should be the numeric representation of your iPad app's ID in the App Store."
msgstr "字符串值，应该是您的 iPad 应用程序在 App Store 中的 ID 的数字表示形式。"

msgid "The iPad app's custom URL scheme (must include \"://\" after the scheme name)."
msgstr "iPad 应用程序的自定义 URL 方案（方案名称后必须包含“://”）。"

msgid "The name of the app in the Google Play app store."
msgstr "Google Play 应用商店中应用的名称。"

msgid "Your app ID in the Google Play Store (i.e. \"com.android.app\")."
msgstr "您在 Google Play 商店中的应用 ID（即“com.android.app”）。"

msgid "The Google Play app's custom URL scheme (must include \"://\" after the scheme name)."
msgstr "Google Play 应用的自定义 URL 方案（方案名称后必须包含“://”）。"

msgid "The full URL for loading a media player, specifically an iframe for an embedded video rather than the URL to a page that contains a player. Required when using the Player Card type."
msgstr "用于加载媒体播放器的完整 URL，特别是用于嵌入视频的 iframe，而不是包含播放器的页面的 URL。使用玩家卡类型时需要。"

msgid "The width of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using the Player Card type."
msgstr "媒体播放器 iframe 的宽度（以像素为单位）。使用玩家卡类型时需要。"

msgid "The height of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using the Player Card type."
msgstr "媒体播放器 iframe 的高度（以像素为单位）。使用玩家卡类型时需要。"

msgid "The full URL for an MP4 video (h.264) or audio (AAC) stream, takes precedence over the other media player field."
msgstr "MP4 视频 (h.264) 或音频 (AAC) 流的完整 URL 优先于其他媒体播放器字段。"

msgid "The MIME type for the media contained in the stream URL, as defined by <a href=':url'>RFC 4337</a>."
msgstr "流 URL 中包含的媒体的 MIME 类型，由 <a href=':url'>RFC 4337</a> 定义。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':baidu'>Baidu</a>."
msgstr "由<a href=':baidu'>Baidu</a>提供的字符串。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':bing'>Bing</a>, full details are available from the <a href=':verify_url'>Bing online help</a>."
msgstr "由 <a href=':bing'>Bing</a> 提供的字符串，完整详细信息可从 <a href=':verify_url'>Bing 在线帮助</a> 获取。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':facebook'>Facebook</a>, full details are available from the <a href=':help'>Facebook online help</a>."
msgstr "由 <a href=':facebook'>Facebook</a> 提供的字符串，完整详细信息可从 <a href=':help'>Facebook 在线帮助</a> 获得。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':google'>Google</a>, full details are available from the <a href=':verify_url'>Google online help</a>."
msgstr "由 <a href=':google'>Google</a> 提供的字符串，完整详细信息可从 <a href=':verify_url'>Google 在线帮助</a> 获得。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':norton'>Norton Safe Web</a>, full details are available from the <a href=':verify_url'>Norton Safe Web online help</a>."
msgstr "由 <a href=':norton'>Norton Safe Web</a> 提供的字符串，完整详细信息可从 <a href=':verify_url'>Norton Safe Web 联机帮助</a>获取。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':pinterest'>Pinterest</a>, full details are available from the <a href=':verify_url'>Pinterest online help</a>."
msgstr "由 <a href=':pinterest'>Pinterest</a> 提供的字符串，完整详细信息可从 <a href=':verify_url'>Pinterest 在线帮助</a> 获得。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':pocket'>Pocket</a>, full details are available from the <a href=':verify_url'>Pocket online help</a>."
msgstr "由 <a href=':pocket'>Pocket</a> 提供的字符串，完整详细信息可从 <a href=':verify_url'>Pocket 在线帮助</a> 获得。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':siwecos'>SIWECOS</a>, the free website security scanner."
msgstr "由免费网站安全扫描器 <a href=':siwecos'>SIWECOS</a> 提供的字符串。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':yandex'>Yandex</a>, full details are available from the <a href=':verify_url'>Yandex online help</a>."
msgstr "由 <a href=':yandex'>Yandex</a> 提供的字符串，完整详细信息可从 <a href=':verify_url'>Yandex 在线帮助</a> 获得。"

msgid "A string provided by <a href=':zoom'>Zoom</a>, full details are available from the <a href=':help'>Zoom online help</a>."
msgstr "由 <a href=':zoom'>Zoom</a> 提供的字符串，完整详细信息可从 <a href=':help'>Zoom 在线帮助</a> 获得。"

msgid "Simple meta tags."
msgstr "简单的元标签。"

msgid "index - Allow search engines to index this page (assumed)."
msgstr "index - 允许搜索引擎索引此页面（假设）。"

msgid "follow - Allow search engines to follow links on this page (assumed)."
msgstr "follow - 允许搜索引擎跟踪此页面上的链接（假设）。"

msgid "noindex - Prevents search engines from indexing this page."
msgstr "noindex - 防止搜索引擎索引此页面。"

msgid "nofollow - Prevents search engines from following links on this page."
msgstr "nofollow - 阻止搜索引擎跟踪此页面上的链接。"

msgid "noarchive - Prevents cached copies of this page from appearing in search results."
msgstr "noarchive - 防止此页面的缓存副本出现在搜索结果中。"

msgid "nosnippet - Prevents descriptions from appearing in search results, and prevents page caching."
msgstr "nosnippet - 防止描述出现在搜索结果中，并防止页面缓存。"

msgid "noimageindex - Prevent search engines from indexing images on this page."
msgstr "noimageindex - 防止搜索引擎索引此页面上的图像。"

msgid "notranslate - Prevent search engines from offering to translate this page in search results."
msgstr "notranslate - 阻止搜索引擎在搜索结果中提供翻译此页面的服务。"

msgid "Provides search engines with specific directions for what to do when this page is indexed."
msgstr "为搜索引擎提供有关此页面被索引时应执行的操作的具体指示。"

msgid "Max Snippet"
msgstr "最大片段"

msgid "Use a number character as a textual snippet for this search result. \"0\" equals \"nosnippet\". \"-1\" will let the search engine decide the most effective length."
msgstr "使用数字字符作为此搜索结果的文本片段。 “0”等于“nosnippet”。 “-1”会让搜索引擎决定最有效的长度。"

msgid "Max Video Preview"
msgstr "最大视频预览"

msgid "Use a maximum of number seconds as a video snippet for videos on this page in search results. \"0\" will use a static a image. \"-1\" means there is no limit."
msgstr "最多使用秒数作为搜索结果中此页面上的视频的视频片段。 “0”将使用静态图像。 “-1”表示没有限制。"

msgid "None - no image preview is to be shown."
msgstr "无 - 不显示图像预览。"

msgid "Standard - a default image preview may be shown."
msgstr "标准 - 可能会显示默认图像预览。"

msgid "Large - a larger image preview, up to the width of the viewport, may be shown."
msgstr "大 - 可能会显示更大的图像预览，最大可达视口的宽度。"

msgid "Max Image Preview"
msgstr "最大图像预览"

msgid "Set the maximum size of an image preview for this page in a search results."
msgstr "设置该页面在搜索结果中的图像预览的最大尺寸。"

msgid "Unavailable after date"
msgstr "日期后不可使用"

msgid "Do not show this page in search results after the specified date"
msgstr "指定日期之后不在搜索结果中显示此页面"

msgid "No Referrer"
msgstr "无推荐人"

msgid "No Referrer When Downgrade"
msgstr "降级时无推荐人"

msgid "Origin"
msgstr "起源"

msgid "Origin When Cross-Origin"
msgstr "跨原点时的原点"

msgid "Same Origin"
msgstr "同源"

msgid "Strict Origin"
msgstr "严格的起源"

msgid "Strict Origin When Cross-Origin"
msgstr "跨源时严格源"

msgid "Unsafe URL"
msgstr "不安全的网址"

msgid "Indicate to search engines and other page scrapers whether or not links should be followed. See <a href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>the W3C specifications</a> for further details. Note: this serves the same purpose as the HTTP header by the same name."
msgstr "向搜索引擎和其他页面抓取工具指示是否应遵循链接。有关更多详细信息，请参阅 <a href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'> W3C 规范</a>。注意：这与同名的 HTTP 标头具有相同的用途。"

msgid "Meta tags that might not be needed by many sites."
msgstr "许多网站可能不需要元标记。"

msgid "The <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are used to control how Facebook, Pinterest, LinkedIn and other social networking sites interpret the site's content.<br><br>The Facebook <a href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr "<a href='https://ogp.me/'>开放图谱元标记</a>用于控制 Facebook、Pinterest、LinkedIn 和其他社交网站解释网站内容的方式。<br><br>Facebook <a href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>共享调试器</a>可让您预览内容共享到 Facebook 时的外观，并调试开放图谱标记的任何问题。"

msgid "Summary Card"
