msgstr "尚无媒体批量上传配置。 <a href=\":url\">添加新的媒体批量上传配置。</a>。"

msgid "Add media bulk upload configuration"
msgstr "添加媒体批量上传配置"

msgid "Label for the media bulk upload settings, for example 'Bulk image upload'"
msgstr "媒体批量上传设置的标签，例如“批量图片上传”"

msgid "Choose the media types that will be\n        used to create new media entities based on matching extensions. Please be\n        aware that if file extensions overlap between the media types that are\n        chosen, that the media entity will be assigned automatically to one of\n        these types."
msgstr "选择将要使用的媒体类型\n        用于根据匹配的扩展创建新的媒体实体。请\n        请注意，如果文件扩展名在媒体类型之间重叠\n        选择后，媒体实体将自动分配给其中之一\n        这些类型。"

msgid "Based on the form mode the upload form\n        can be enriched with fields that are available, improving the speed and\n        usability to add (meta)data to your media entities."
msgstr "基于表单模式上传表单\n        可以丰富可用的字段，提高速度和\n        将（元）数据添加到您的媒体实体的可用性。"

msgid "Temporary upload location"
