msgid "Temporary upload location of the files before they are moved to the determined\n      location in the media types, for example temporary:// or private://upload_folder"
msgstr "文件移动到指定位置之前的临时上传位置\n      媒体类型中的位置，例如 tempor:// 或 private://upload_folder"

