msgid "Controls settings for the module Easy Breadcrumb"
msgstr "控制 Easy Breadcrumb 模块的设置"

msgid "Easy breadcrumb"
msgstr "简单的面包屑"

msgid "Provides configurable path based breadcrumbs."
msgstr "提供基于可配置路径的面包屑。"

msgid "Adds Matomo javascript tracking code to all your site's pages."
msgstr "将 Matomo javascript 跟踪代码添加到您网站的所有页面。"

msgid "Matomo Tag Manager integration."
msgstr "Matomo 标签管理器集成。"

msgid "Configure the settings used to generate your Matomo tracking code."
msgstr "配置用于生成 Matomo 跟踪代码的设置。"

msgid "Matomo Analytics"
msgstr "马托莫分析"

msgid "Enable to track the content shown in colorbox modal windows."
msgstr "启用跟踪颜色框模式窗口中显示的内容。"

msgid "If checked, internal search keywords are tracked."
msgstr "如果选中，则会跟踪内部搜索关键字。"

msgid "Code in this textarea will be added <strong>before</strong> _paq.push([\"trackPageView\"])."
msgstr "此文本区域中的代码将添加 <strong>before</strong> _paq.push([\"trackPageView\"])。"

msgid "Code in this textarea will be added <strong>after</strong> _paq.push([\"trackPageView\"]). This is useful if you'd like to track a site in two accounts."
msgstr "此文本区域中的代码将添加 <strong>after</strong> _paq.push([\"trackPageView\"])。如果您想用两个帐户跟踪一个网站，这非常有用。"

msgid "Matomo site ID"
msgstr "Matomo站点ID"

msgid "The user account number is unique to the websites domain. Click the <strong>Settings</strong> link in your Matomo account, then the <strong>Websites</strong> tab and enter the appropriate site <strong>ID</strong> into this field."
msgstr "用户帐号对于网站域来说是唯一的。单击您的 Matomo 帐户中的 <strong>Settings</strong> 链接，然后单击 <strong>Websites</strong> 选项卡，并在此字段中输入相应的站点 <strong>ID</strong>。"

msgid "Matomo HTTP URL"
msgstr "马托莫 HTTP URL"

msgid "The URL to your Matomo base directory. Example: \"http://www.example.com/matomo/\"."
msgstr "您的 Matomo 基本目录的 URL。示例：“http://www.example.com/matomo/”。"

msgid "Matomo HTTPS URL"
msgstr "Matomo HTTPS URL"

msgid "The URL to your Matomo base directory with SSL certificate installed. Required if you track a SSL enabled website. Example: \"https://www.example.com/matomo/\"."
msgstr "安装了 SSL 证书的 Matomo 基本目录的 URL。如果您跟踪启用 SSL 的网站，则为必需。示例：“https://www.example.com/matomo/”。"

msgid "What are you tracking?"
msgstr "你在追踪什么？"

msgid "Add to every role except the selected ones"
msgstr "添加到除所选角色之外的每个角色"

msgid "If none of the roles are selected, all users will be tracked. If a user has any of the roles checked, that user will be tracked (or excluded, depending on the setting above)."
msgstr "如果未选择任何角色，则将跟踪所有用户。如果用户选中了任何角色，则将跟踪该用户（或排除该用户，具体取决于上述设置）。"

msgid "No customization allowed"
msgstr "不允许定制"

msgid "Tracking on by default, users with %permission permission can opt out"
msgstr "默认开启跟踪，具有 %permission 权限的用户可以选择退出"

msgid "Opt-in or out of tracking"
msgstr "选择加入或退出跟踪"

msgid "Tracking off by default, users with %permission permission can opt in"
msgstr "默认关闭追踪，有%permission权限的用户可以选择开启"

msgid "Allow users to customize tracking on their account page"
msgstr "允许用户在其帐户页面上自定义跟踪"

msgid "Track User ID"
msgstr "追踪用户 ID"

msgid "User ID enables the analysis of groups of sessions, across devices, using a unique, persistent, and non-personally identifiable ID string representing a user. <a href=\":url\">Learn more about the benefits of using User ID</a>."
msgstr "用户 ID 可以使用代表用户的唯一、持久且不可识别个人身份的 ID 字符串来分析跨设备的会话组。 <a href=\":url\">L了解有关使用用户 ID</a> 的优势的更多信息。"

msgid "Show page titles as hierarchy like breadcrumbs"
msgstr "将页面标题显示为像面包屑一样的层次结构"

msgid "By default Matomo tracks the current page title and shows you a flat list of the most popular titles. This enables a breadcrumbs like tree view."
msgstr "默认情况下，Matomo 跟踪当前页面标题并显示最流行标题的平面列表。这可以实现类似树视图的面包屑。"

msgid "Hide home page from hierarchy"
msgstr "从层次结构中隐藏主页"

msgid "If enabled, the \"Home\" item will be removed from the hierarchy to flatten the structure in the Matomo statistics. Hits to the home page will still be counted, but for other pages the hierarchy will start at level Home+1."
msgstr "如果启用，“主页”项将从层次结构中删除，以展平 Matomo 统计数据中的结构。对主页的点击仍将被计算在内，但对于其他页面，层次结构将从级别 Home+1 开始。"

msgid "Page titles hierarchy"
msgstr "页面标题层次结构"

msgid "This functionality enables a dynamically expandable tree view of your site page titles in your Matomo statistics. See in Matomo statistics under <em>Actions</em> > <em>Page titles</em>."
msgstr "此功能可以在 Matomo 统计信息中动态扩展网站页面标题的树视图。请参阅 Matomo 统计信息中的 <em>Actions</em> > <em> 页面标题 </em>。"

msgid "404 - Not found"
msgstr "404 - 未找到"

msgid "403 - Access denied"
msgstr "403 - 访问被拒绝"

msgid "Prevent tracking of pages with given HTTP Status code:"
msgstr "防止跟踪具有给定 HTTP 状态代码的页面："

msgid "Status Codes"
msgstr "状态代码"

msgid "Track clicks on outbound links and downloads (clicks on file links) for the following extensions"
msgstr "跟踪以下扩展程序的出站链接和下载（文件链接点击）点击次数"

msgid "List of download file extensions"
msgstr "下载文件扩展名列表"

msgid "A file extension list separated by the | character that will be tracked as download when clicked. Regular expressions are supported. For example: @extensions"
msgstr "由 | 分隔的文件扩展名列表单击时将被跟踪为下载的字符。支持正则表达式。例如：@extensions"

msgid "Track content in colorbox modal dialogs"
msgstr "跟踪颜色框模式对话框中的内容"

msgid "Track messages of type"
msgstr "跟踪消息类型"

msgid "This will track the selected message types shown to users. Tracking of form validation errors may help you identifying usability issues in your site. Every message is tracked as one individual event. Messages from excluded pages cannot be tracked."
msgstr "这将跟踪向用户显示的选定消息类型。跟踪表单验证错误可以帮助您识别站点中的可用性问题。每条消息都作为一个单独的事件进行跟踪。无法跟踪来自排除页面的消息。"

msgid "Universal web tracking opt-out"
msgstr "通用网络跟踪选择退出"

msgid "If enabled and your Matomo server receives the <a href=\":donottrack\">Do-Not-Track</a> header from the client browser, the Matomo server will not track the user. Compliance with Do Not Track could be purely voluntary, enforced by industry self-regulation, or mandated by state or federal law. Accept your visitors privacy. If they have opt-out from tracking and advertising, you should accept their personal decision."
msgstr "如果启用并且您的 Matomo 服务器从客户端浏览器接收 <a href=\":donottrack\">Do-Not-Track</a> 标头，则 Matomo 服务器将不会跟踪用户。遵守“请勿追踪”可以纯粹是自愿的，可以通过行业自律强制执行，也可以由州或联邦法律强制执行。接受访客的隐私。如果他们选择退出跟踪和广告，您应该接受他们的个人决定。"

msgid "Cookie duration"
msgstr "Cookie 持续时间"

msgid "The duration of the tracking cookie (in seconds). If not set, the default duration from the Matomo server will be used."
msgstr "跟踪 cookie 的持续时间（以秒为单位）。如果未设置，将使用 Matomo 服务器的默认持续时间。"

msgid "Disable cookies"
msgstr "禁用cookie"

msgid "Matomo uses <a href=\":cookie\">cookies</a> to store some information about visitors between visits. Enable to disable all Matomo tracking cookies. When cookies are disabled, some data in Matomo will be <a href=\":disablecookies\">less accurate</a>."
msgstr "Matomo 使用 <a href=\":cookie\">cookie</a> 来存储访问者两次访问之间的一些信息。启用以禁用所有 Matomo 跟踪 cookie。禁用 Cookie 后，Matomo 中的某些数据将<a href=\":disablecookies\">不太准确</a>。"

msgid "Secure cookies"
msgstr "安全 cookie"

msgid "Matomo uses <a href=\":cookie\">cookies</a> to store some information about visitors between visits. Enabling <a href=\":securecookies\">secure cookies</a> makes sure they are only sent over HTTPS."
msgstr "Matomo 使用 <a href=\":cookie\">cookies</a> 来存储访问者两次访问之间的一些信息。启用 <a href=\":securecookies\">secure cookies</a> 确保它们仅通过 HTTPS 发送。"

msgid "Custom variable slot #@slot"
msgstr "自定义变量槽#@slot"

msgid "Visit"
msgstr "访问"

msgid "You can supplement Matomo's basic IP address tracking of visitors by segmenting users based on custom variables. Make sure you will not associate (or permit any third party to associate) any data gathered from your websites (or such third party websites) with any personally identifying information from any source as part of your use (or such third parties' use) of the Matomo's service."
msgstr "您可以根据自定义变量对用户进行细分，以补充 Matomo 对访问者的基本 IP 地址跟踪。确保您不会将从您的网站（或此类第三方网站）收集的任何数据与来自任何来源的任何个人识别信息关联（或允许任何第三方关联），作为您使用（或此类第三方使用）Matomo 服务的一部分。"

msgid "You can add Matomo's <a href=\":custom_var_documentation\">Custom Variables</a> here. These will be added to every page that Matomo tracking code appears on. Custom variable names and values are limited to 200 characters in length. Keep the names and values as short as possible and expect long values to get trimmed. You may use tokens in custom variable names and values. Global and user tokens are always available; on node pages, node tokens are also available."
msgstr "您可以在此处添加 Matomo 的 <a href=\":custom_var_documentation\"> 自定义变量</a>。这些将添加到 Matomo 跟踪代码出现的每个页面。自定义变量名称和值的长度限制为 200 个字符。使名称和值尽可能短，并期望长值被修剪。您可以在自定义变量名称和值中使用标记。全局和用户代币始终可用；在节点页面上，也可以使用节点令牌。"

msgid "Disable tracking"
msgstr "禁用跟踪"

msgid "If checked, the tracking code is disabled generally. This may be useful when using Matomo Tag Manager."
msgstr "如果选中，则跟踪代码通常会被禁用。使用 Matomo 标签管理器时这可能很有用。"

msgid "If checked, the tracking code file is retrieved from your Matomo site and cached locally. It is updated daily to ensure updates to tracking code are reflected in the local copy."
msgstr "如果选中，将从您的 Matomo 站点检索跟踪代码文件并在本地缓存。它每天更新，以确保跟踪代码的更新反映在本地副本中。"

msgid "You can add custom Matomo <a href=\":snippets\">code snippets</a> here. These will be added to every page that Matomo appears on. <strong>Do not include the &lt;script&gt; tags</strong>, and always end your code with a semicolon (;)."
msgstr "您可以在此处添加自定义 Matomo <a href=\":snippets\">代码片段</a>。这些代码会加到每个出现 Matomo 的页面上。<strong>不要包含 script 标签</strong>，并且代码始终以分号（;）结尾。"

msgid "<a href=\":pk_url\">Matomo Analytics</a> is an open source (GPL license) web analytics software. It gives interesting reports on your website visitors, your popular pages, the search engines keywords they used, the language they speak... and so much more. Matomo aims to be an open source alternative to Google Analytics."
msgstr "<a href=\":pk_url\">Matomo Analytics</a> 是一款开源（GPL 许可证）网络分析软件。它提供有关您的网站访问者、您的热门页面、他们使用的搜索引擎关键字、他们所说的语言等等的有趣报告。 Matomo 的目标是成为 Google Analytics 的开源替代品。"

msgid "All pages with exceptions"
msgstr "除例外情况外的所有页面"

msgid "Excepted: @roles"
msgstr "例外：@roles"

