msgstr "示例：1.23、-1.23、0.00、3.1415926542653（圆周率）"

msgid "Administer Easy Breadcrumb settings"
msgstr "管理简易面包屑设置"

msgid "Add JavaScript snippets"
msgstr "添加 JavaScript 片段"

msgid "Administer Matomo"
msgstr "管理马托莫"

msgid "Use PHP for tracking visibility"
msgstr "使用 PHP 跟踪可见性"

msgid "Administer Matomo Tag Manager"
msgstr "管理 Matomo 标签管理器"

msgid "Administer meta tags"
msgstr "管理元标签"

msgid "Administer individual URL redirections"
msgstr "管理单独的 URL 重定向"

msgid "Ignore 404 requests"
msgstr "忽略 404 请求"

msgid "Send data to Matomo when search happens."
msgstr "搜索发生时将数据发送给 Matomo。"

msgid "Matomo"
msgstr "友"

msgid "If checked, multiple values for this field will be shown in the same row. If not checked, each value in this field will create a new row. If using group by, make sure to group by \"Entity ID\" for this setting to have any effect."
msgstr "如果选中，该字段的多个值将显示在同一行中。如果未选中，此字段中的每个值都将创建一个新行。如果使用分组依据，请确保按“实体 ID”分组才能使此设置生效。"

msgid "@count min"
msgid_plural "@count min"
msgstr[0] "@count 分钟"
msgstr[1] "@count 分钟"

msgid "SMTP: PHPMailer library"
msgstr "SMTP：PHPMailer 库"

msgid "SMTP connection"
msgstr "SMTP 连接"

msgid "SMTP module is enabled, turned on, and connection is valid."
msgstr "SMTP 模块已启用、打开且连接有效。"

msgid "Colorbox library"
msgstr "彩盒库"

msgid "Experimental themes installed"
msgstr "安装了实验主题"

msgid "DOMPurify library"
msgstr "DOMPurify 库"

msgid "Toolbar and Navigation modules are both installed"
msgstr "工具栏和导航模块均已安装"

msgid "HTML5 validation"
msgstr "HTML5 验证"

msgid "Password hashing"
msgstr "密码散列"

msgid "The Colorbox library needs to be <a href=\"@url\">downloaded</a> and extracted into the /libraries/colorbox folder in your Drupal installation directory."
msgstr "需要<a href=\"@url\">下载</a> Colorbox 库并将其解压缩到 Drupal 安装目录中的 /libraries/colorbox 文件夹中。"

msgid "The DOMPurify library is not installed. The Colorbox module uses this library to sanitize HTML captions. Without this library, all captions will be treated as plain text. If you intend to have HTML captions in Colorbox content, download the <a href=\"@url\">DOMPurify library</a>, extract it, and copy the dist directory into the /libraries/DOMPurify folder in your Drupal installation directory. Specifically, the system looks for /libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js. <br /><br /> To avoid potential security issues, please only install the dist directory, and not any other files from the archive.<br /><br /> If you do not intend to use HTML captions, you can suppress this warning on the <a href=\"@config\">Colorbox configuration page.</a>"
msgstr "未安装 DOMPurify 库。 Colorbox 模块使用此库来清理 HTML 标题。如果没有这个库，所有标题都将被视为纯文本。如果您打算在 Colorbox 内容中包含 HTML 字幕，请下载 <a href=\"@url\">DOMPurify 库</a>，解压它，然后将 dist 目录复制到 Drupal 安装目录中的 /libraries/DOMPurify 文件夹中。具体来说，系统会查找 /libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js。 <br /><br /> 为了避免潜在的安全问题，请仅安装 dist 目录，而不是存档中的任何其他文件。<br /><br /> 如果您不打算使用 HTML 字幕，可以在 <a href=\"@config\">Colorbox 配置页面</a>上取消此警告。"

msgid "The enable_html5_validation setting is not configured in settings.php. In Drupal 12 this setting will default to FALSE, which means HTML5 validation will be disabled on all forms. Make sure your forms will still work the way you expect before upgrading by setting the value to FALSE in a test environment.  See <a href=\":url\">the change record</a> for more information."
msgstr "未在settings.php 中配置enable_html5_validation 设置。在 Drupal 12 中，此设置默认为 FALSE，这意味着所有表单上都将禁用 HTML5 验证。通过在测试环境中将该值设置为 FALSE，确保您的表单在升级之前仍能按预期方式工作。  请参阅<a href=\":url\">变更记录</a>了解更多信息。"

msgid "Toolbar is disabled when the Navigation replacement module is available to the current user. It is recommended to uninstall Toolbar."
msgstr "当导航替换模块可供当前用户使用时，工具栏将被禁用。建议卸载工具栏。"

msgid "Schema.org Metatag is recommended"
msgstr "推荐使用 Schema.org Metatag"

msgid "The <a href=\"@module\">Schema.org Metatag</a> module is highly recommended to add <a href=\"@jsonld\">JSON-LD</a> -formatted <a href=\"@schema\">schema.org</a> compatible data structures to the site."
msgstr "强烈建议使用 <a href=\"@module\">Schema.org Metatag</a> 模块将 <a href=\"@jsonld\">JSON-LD</a> 格式的 <a href=\"@schema\">schema.org</a> 兼容数据结构添加到站点。"

msgid "Token Or"
msgstr "代币或"

msgid "The <a href=\"@module\">Token OR module</a> is suggested for when the basic content tokens are not flexible enough, e.g. to make a meta tag show the contents of one field if it is filled in or another if the first one is empty."
msgstr "当基本内容令牌不够灵活时，例如，建议使用 <a href=\"@module\">Token 或模块</a>。使元标记显示一个字段的内容（如果已填写）或另一个（如果第一个字段为空）。"

msgid "Passwords are hashed with the bcrypt algorithm. Drupal 12 will use argon2id by default. It is recommended to <a href=\":url\">switch</a> to argon2id."
msgstr "密码使用 bcrypt 算法进行哈希处理。 Drupal 12 默认使用 argon2id。建议将<a href=\":url\">切换至</a>至argon2id。"

msgid "PHPMailer is located at %path"
msgstr "PHPMailer 位于 %path"

msgid "Your server is capable of displaying file upload progress, but does not have the required libraries. It is recommended to install the <a href=\"https://github.com/php/pecl-php-uploadprogress#installation\">PECL uploadprogress library</a>."
msgstr "您的服务器能够显示文件上传进度，但没有所需的库。建议安装<a href=\"https://github.com/php/pecl-php-uploadprogress#installation\">PECL uploadprogress库</a>。"

msgid "Drupal requires databases that support JSON storage."
msgstr "Drupal 需要支持 JSON 存储的数据库。"

msgid "The %field date is invalid. Enter a date in the correct format."
msgstr "%field 日期无效。以正确的格式输入日期。"

msgid "Allows viewing unpublished block content"
msgstr "允许查看未发布的区块内容"

msgid "Select the default, per-module, and per-mailing MailSystemInterface to use for formatting and sending email messages."
msgstr "选择默认的、按模块的和按邮件的 MailSystemInterface 以用于格式化和发送电子邮件。"

msgid "Enter JavaScript code snippets for advanced Matomo functionality."
msgstr "输入 JavaScript 代码片段以获得高级 Matomo 功能。"

msgid "Perform maintenance tasks for Matomo."
msgstr "执行 Matomo 的维护任务。"

msgid "Allow users to decide if tracking code will be added to pages or not."
msgstr "允许用户决定是否将跟踪代码添加到页面。"

msgid "Enter PHP code in the field for tracking visibility settings."
msgstr "在跟踪可见性设置字段中输入 PHP 代码。"

msgid "Control the Metatag settings pages. Does not control access to the Metatag field on content forms, etc, use the Field Permissions module or hook_form_alter()."
msgstr "控制元标记设置页面。不控制对内容表单等元标记字段的访问，请使用字段权限模块或 hook_form_alter()。"

msgid "Edit the published status of a node across all content types."
msgstr "跨所有内容类型编辑节点的发布状态。"

msgid "Trigger a content access permission rebuild. This can be a potentially long and disruptive process."
msgstr "触发内容访问权限重建。这可能是一个可能漫长且具有破坏性的过程。"

msgid "Allows a user to configure pathauto settings, configure patterns for automated aliases, bulk update and delete URL-aliases."
msgstr "允许用户配置 pathauto 设置、配置自动别名模式、批量更新和删除 URL 别名。"

msgid "Allows a user to bulk delete aliases."
msgstr "允许用户批量删除别名。"

msgid "Allows a user to bulk update aliases."
msgstr "允许用户批量更新别名。"

msgid "This allows users without the Administer redirect settings to ignore specific 404 requests, without the ability to customize the 404 exclude patterns."
msgstr "这允许没有管理重定向设置的用户忽略特定的 404 请求，并且无法自定义 404 排除模式。"

msgid "To delete a revision you also need permission to delete the taxonomy term."
msgstr "要删除修订版，您还需要删除分类术语的权限。"

msgid "To revert a revision you also need permission to edit the taxonomy term."
msgstr "要恢复修订，您还需要编辑分类术语的权限。"

msgid "Ensure that site administrators have this permission so that security updates are applied promptly."
msgstr "确保站点管理员拥有此权限，以便及时应用安全更新。"

msgid "Matomo settings"
msgstr "派托设置"

msgid "Created the member profile nickname and bio fields."
msgstr "创建了会员个人资料昵称和个人简介字段。"

msgid "支持 JPG、PNG、GIF、WebP，最大 2MB。"
msgstr "支持JPG、PNG、GIF、WebP，最大2MB。"

msgid "Required if you want to change the <em>Email address</em> or the <em>Password</em> field below. <a href=\":request_new_url\" title=\"Send password reset instructions via email.\">Reset your password</a>."
msgstr "如果您想要更改下面的 <em>电子邮件地址</em> 或 <em>密码</em> 字段，则为必需。 <a href=\":request_new_url\" title=\"Send password reset instructions via email.\">重置您的密码</a>。"

msgid "Configured the XEDC member submission workflow and permissions."
msgstr "配置XEDC成员提交工作流和权限。"

msgid "Uncheck to disable Easy breadcrumb for administration pages and routes like this one."
msgstr "取消选中以禁用管理页面和像这样的路由的简单面包屑导航。"

msgid "Include invalid paths alias as plain-text segments"
msgstr "将无效路径别名包含为纯文本段"

msgid "Include the invalid paths alias as plain-text segments in the breadcrumb."
msgstr "将无效路径别名作为纯文本段包含在面包屑中。"

msgid "Include the current page as a segment in the breadcrumb"
msgstr "将当前页面作为片段包含在面包屑中"

msgid "Include the current page as the last segment in the breadcrumb."
msgstr "将当前页面作为面包屑中的最后一段包含在内。"

msgid "Remove repeated identical segments"
msgstr "删除重复的相同片段"

msgid "Remove segments of the breadcrumb that are identical."
msgstr "删除面包屑中相同的部分。"

msgid "Remove repeated identical segments - only validate on the text"
msgstr "删除重复的相同片段 - 仅在文本上验证"

msgid "When removing identical segments only text is matched upon."
msgstr "删除相同的段时，仅匹配文本。"

msgid "Include the front page as a segment in the breadcrumb"
msgstr "将首页作为面包屑中的一个部分包含在内"

msgid "Include the front page as the first segment in the breadcrumb."
msgstr "将首页作为面包屑中的第一部分。"

msgid "Alternative title field name for breadcrumb"
msgstr "面包屑的替代标题字段名称"

msgid "This field name is to be added in the entity to display the alternative title in the breadcrumb."
msgstr "该字段名称将添加到实体中以在面包屑中显示替代标题。"

msgid "Title for the front page segment in the breadcrumb"
msgstr "面包屑中首页部分的标题"

msgid "Text to be displayed as the front page segment. This field works together with the \"Include the front page as a segment in the breadcrumb\"-option."
msgstr "显示为首页片段的文本。该字段与“将首页作为面包屑中的一部分包括在内”选项一起使用。"

msgid "Use the real page title when available"
msgstr "使用可用的真实页面标题"

msgid "Use the real page title when it is available instead of always deducing it from the URL."
msgstr "当可用时使用真实的页面标题，而不是总是从 URL 中推断出来。"

msgid "Use menu title when available"
msgstr "可用时使用菜单标题"

msgid "Use menu title instead of raw path component. The real page title setting above will take precedence over this setting. So, one or the other, but not both."
msgstr "使用菜单标题而不是原始路径组件。上面的实际页面标题设置将优先于此设置。因此，可以选择其中之一，但不能两者兼而有之。"

msgid "Preferred menu"
msgstr "首选菜单"

msgid "Preferred menu to use as menu title source. Useful if menu links with identical paths exist in multiple menus."
msgstr "用作菜单标题源的首选菜单。如果多个菜单中存在具有相同路径的菜单链接，则很有用。"

msgid "Use page title as fallback for menu title"
msgstr "使用页面标题作为菜单标题的后备"

msgid "Use page title as fallback if menu title cannot be found. This option works when not using \"real page title\" above."
msgstr "如果找不到菜单标题，请使用页面标题作为后备。当不使用上面的“真实页面标题”时，此选项有效。"

msgid "Use site title as the front page segment"
msgstr "使用网站标题作为首页部分"

msgid "Use site title as the front page segment. This field works together with the \"Include the front page as a segment in the breadcrumb\"-option."
msgstr "使用网站标题作为首页部分。该字段与“将首页作为面包屑中的一部分包括在内”选项一起使用。"

msgid "Add current breadcrumb as structured data."
msgstr "添加当前面包屑作为结构化数据。"

msgid "Check to have the current breadcrumb trail added as <a href=\"@href\" target=\"_blank\">structured data</a> in JSON-LD to the HTML <code><head></code>."
msgstr "将当前面包屑作为 JSON-LD <a href=\"@href\" target=\"_blank\">结构化数据</a>写入 HTML 的 head。"

msgid "Follow redirects."
msgstr "遵循重定向。"

msgid "In case the <a href=\"@href\" target=\"_blank\">redirect module</a> is enabled, follow the configured redirects"
msgstr "如果启用了 <a href=\"@href\" target=\"_blank\">redirect 模块</a>，请遵循配置的重定向"

msgid "Limit breadcrumb trail segments"
msgstr "限制面包屑路径段"

msgid "Limit the number of displayed breadcrumb trail segments."
msgstr "限制显示的面包屑路径段的数量。"

msgid "Breadcrumb segment count"
msgstr "面包屑段计数"

msgid "Number of breadcrumb trail segments to display"
msgstr "要显示的面包屑路径段数"

msgid "Breadcrumb segment minimum count"
msgstr "面包屑段最小计数"

msgid "Minimum number of breadcrumb trail segments needed to display the breadcrumbs."
msgstr "显示面包屑所需的最小面包屑路径段数。"

msgid "Paths to be excluded while generating segments"
msgstr "生成线段时要排除的路径"

msgid "Enter a line separated list of paths to be excluded while generating the segments.\n      Slashes must be escaped i.e.: ( foo/bar should be foo\\/bar ) Paths may use simple regex, i.e.: report\\/2[0-9][0-9][0-9]."
msgstr "输入生成线段时要排除的行分隔路径列表。\n      斜杠必须转义，即：（ foo/bar 应该是 foo\\/bar ）路径可以使用简单的正则表达式，即：report\\/2[0-9][0-9][0-9]。"

msgid "Titles to be replaced while generating segments"
msgstr "生成片段时要替换的标题"

msgid "Enter a line separated list of titles with their replacements separated by ::.<br>\n\t\t\tFor example TITLE::DIFFERENT_TITLE<br>This field works together with the option \"Use the real page title when available\" option."
msgstr "输入以行分隔的标题列表，其替换内容以 ::.<br> 分隔\n\t\t\t例如 TITLE::DIFFERENT_TITLE<br> 该字段与“使用可用的真实页面标题”选项一起使用。"

msgid "Paths to replace with custom breadcrumbs"
msgstr "用自定义面包屑替换的路径"

msgid "Enter a line separated list of internal paths followed by breadcrumb pattern. Separate crumbs from their path with a vertical bar (\"|\"). Separate crumbs with double-colon (\"::\"). Omit the URL to display an unlinked crumb. Fields will be trimmed to remove extra start/end spaces, so you can use them to help format your input, if desired. Replaced Titles will not be processed on custom paths. Excluded paths listed here will have breadcrumbs added. Examples (with and without extra spacing):<br><code>/news/archive/site_launched  ::  News | /news  ::  Archive | /news/archive  ::  Site Launched<br>/your/path::LinkedCrumb1|url1::LinkedCrumb2|url2::UnlinkedCrumb3</code><br><p>It is also possible to express the path to be matched as a <a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/book.pcre.php\" target=\"_blank\">regex expression</a>. \"regex!\" must be added to the start of the path to match in order for it to be interpreted as regex:<br><code>regex!/news/archive/\\d{4} ::  News | /news  ::  Archive | /news/archive</code><p>Expressions can even include matching groups which can be referenced in the path of a segment path:<br><code>regex!/groups/([^/]*)/info :: Groups | /groups :: Group | /groups/$1</code></p><p>To use the current page title as a title component, use <code>&lt;title&gt;</code> (Must have <strong>\"Use the real page title when available\"</strong> enabled)</p>"
msgstr "输入内部路径及面包屑模式，每行一条。用竖线（|）分隔路径与面包屑，用双冒号（::）分隔多级面包屑。省略 URL 则显示为不带链接的项。保存时会去掉首尾空格。被替换的标题不会用于自定义路径。此处列出的排除路径仍会生成面包屑。示例：<br><code>/news/archive/site_launched :: News | /news :: Archive</code><br>路径也可以写成<a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/book.pcre.php\" target=\"_blank\">正则表达式</a>，并在开头加上 regex!，例如 <code>regex!/news/archive/\d{4} :: News</code>。匹配组可在片段中引用，例如 <code>regex!/groups/([^/]*)/info :: Groups | /groups/$1</code>。若要用当前页面标题，请使用占位文本 title（需启用“有真实页面标题时使用它”）。"

msgid "Display the front page segment on the front page"
msgstr "在首页上显示首页片段"

msgid "If checked, the Home segment will be displayed on the front page."
msgstr "如果选中，主页部分将显示在首页上。"

msgid "Do not check for path, that is duplicate of home page."
msgstr "不检查路径，该路径与主页重复。"

msgid "If checked, validation for similarity between the breadcrumb element and the home page, will be skipped."
msgstr "如果选中，将跳过面包屑元素和主页之间的相似性验证。"

msgid "Make the current page title segment a link"
msgstr "将当前页面标题段设为链接"

msgid "Prints the page title segment as a link. This option works together with the \"Include the current page as a segment in the breadcrumb\"-option."
msgstr "将页面标题段打印为链接。此选项与“将当前页面作为面包屑中的一段”选项一起使用。"

msgid "Make the language path prefix a segment"
msgstr "使语言路径前缀为一个段"

msgid "On multilingual sites where a path prefix (\"/en\") is used, add this in the breadcrumb."
msgstr "在使用路径前缀（“/en”）的多语言网站上，将其添加到面包屑中。"

msgid "By selecting, absolute paths will be used (default: false) instead of relative."
msgstr "通过选择，将使用绝对路径（默认值： false）而不是相对路径。"

msgid "Add all taxonomy parents in the crumb for current term."
msgstr "将所有分类法父级添加到当前术语的面包屑中。"

msgid "Capitalize the first letter of each word in the segment"
msgstr "将句段中每个单词的第一个字母大写"

msgid "Only capitalize the first letter of each segment"
msgstr "仅将每个段的第一个字母大写"

msgid "Capitalize all the letters of each word in the segment"
msgstr "将句段中每个单词的所有字母大写"

msgid "Capitalize only the words that are set below"
msgstr "仅将下面设置的单词大写"

msgid "Transformation mode for the segments' titles"
msgstr "段标题的转换模式"

msgid "Choose the transformation mode you want to apply to the segments' titles. E.g.: 'blog/once-a-time' -> 'Home >> Blog >> Once a Time'."
msgstr "选择要应用于片段标题的转换模式。例如：“博客/一次一次”->“首页 >> 博客 >> 一次一次”。"

msgid "Words to be ignored by the 'capitalizator'"
msgstr "“大写字母”要忽略的单词"

msgid "Enter a space separated list of words to be ignored by the 'capitalizator'. This will be applied only to the words not at the beginning of each segment. E.g.: of and."
msgstr "输入要被“大写字母”忽略的空格分隔的单词列表。这仅适用于不在每个段开头的单词。例如： 的 和 。"

msgid "Words to be forced to capitalized by the 'capitalizator'"
msgstr "“大写者”强制将单词大写"

msgid "Enter a space separated list of words to be forced by the 'capitalizator'. This will be applied only to the words that are listed. This field is case sensitive. E.g.: if you want to capitalize your brand's name."
msgstr "输入由“大写字母”强制使用的空格分隔的单词列表。这仅适用于列出的单词。该字段区分大小写。例如：如果您想将您的品牌名称大写。"

msgid "Use case sensitivity when matching words to be forced to capitalization."
msgstr "匹配要强制大写的单词时请区分大小写。"

msgid "If checked, it matches drupal with drupal, druPAL with druPAL. Unchecked, it matches drupal with Drupal, drupal with druPAL."
msgstr "如果选中，则会将 drupal 与 drupal、druPAL 与 druPAL 匹配。未经检查，它将 drupal 与 Drupal 匹配，drupal 与 drupal 匹配。"

msgid "Make the first letters of each segment capitalized."
msgstr "将每个段的第一个字母大写。"

msgid "Truncate the page's title to a maximum number."
msgstr "将页面标题截断为最大数量。"

msgid "Example: if you set it to 10, from <em>Long page title</em> will be <em>Long pa...</em>"
msgstr "示例：如果将其设置为 10，则从 <em>Long 页面标题</em> 将变为 <em>Long 页面...</em>"

msgid "Set the limit of truncation"
msgstr "设置截断限制"

msgid "The truncated page's title will have 3 dots in its end."
msgstr "被截断的页面标题末尾有 3 个点。"

msgid "Easy Breadcrumb"
msgstr "简单的面包屑导航"

msgid "Enabled comment moderation for member and anonymous comments."
msgstr "为会员和匿名评论启用评论审核。"

msgid "XEDC member center, favorites, history, profile, comments, and member submissions."
msgstr "XEDC 会员中心，包括收藏、浏览历史、个人资料、评论和投稿。"

msgid "Applied image and video media upload size limits."
msgstr "应用图像和视频媒体上传大小限制。"

msgid "Updated the moderated content view for the XEDC editorial workflow."
msgstr "更新了 XEDC 编辑工作流的审核内容视图。"

msgid "Reapplied the moderated content view filters."
msgstr "重新应用了经过审核的内容视图过滤器。"

msgid "Added the save-draft transition for member submissions."
msgstr "添加了会员提交的保存草稿转换。"

msgid "Generates standard-compliant hreflang XML sitemaps to enhance your site's SEO, notifies search engines of website changes via IndexNow and sitemap ping protocols, and provides a framework for developing other sitemap types."
msgstr "生成符合标准的 hreflang XML 站点地图以增强站点的 SEO，通过 IndexNow 和站点地图 ping 协议向搜索引擎通知网站更改，并提供用于开发其他站点地图类型的框架。"

msgid "Submits sitemaps to search engines and notifies IndexNow compatible engines about changes to entities."
msgstr "向搜索引擎提交站点地图并通知 IndexNow 兼容引擎有关实体的更改。"

msgid "Provides integration of the Simple XML Sitemap module with the Views module."
msgstr "提供简单 XML 站点地图模块与视图模块的集成。"

msgid "In order to generate a verification key for the IndexNow service and choose which sitemaps are to be submitted to search engines, visit <a href=\"@url\">this</a> configuration page."
msgstr "为了生成 IndexNow 服务的验证密钥并选择将哪些站点地图提交给搜索引擎，请访问 <a href=\"@url\">this</a> 配置页面。"

msgid "In order to use the Simple XML Sitemap Views module, the Views URL generator must be <a href=\"@url\">added</a> to a sitemap type."
msgstr "为了使用简单 XML 站点地图视图模块，视图 URL 生成器必须为站点地图类型的 <a href=\"@url\">add</a>。"

msgid "Configure, add content to and generate XML sitemaps."
msgstr "配置、添加内容并生成 XML 站点地图。"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap"
msgstr "简单的 XML 站点地图"

msgid "The default hreflang sitemap - lists URLs to be indexed by modern search engines."
msgstr "默认的 hreflang 站点地图 - 列出由现代搜索引擎索引的 URL。"

msgid "Sitemap Index"
msgstr "网站地图索引"

msgid "The sitemap index listing all other sitemaps - useful if there are at least two other sitemaps. In most cases this sitemap should be last in the generation queue and set as the default sitemap."
msgstr "列出所有其他站点地图的站点地图索引 - 如果至少有两个其他站点地图，则很有用。在大多数情况下，此站点地图应位于生成队列的最后并设置为默认站点地图。"

msgid "Default hreflang"
msgstr "默认hreflang"

msgid "The default hreflang sitemap type. A sitemap of this type is understood by most modern search engines."
msgstr "默认的 hreflang 站点地图类型。大多数现代搜索引擎都可以理解这种类型的站点地图。"

msgid "The sitemap index sitemap type. A sitemap of this type lists sitemaps of all other types."
msgstr "站点地图索引站点地图类型。这种类型的站点地图列出了所有其他类型的站点地图。"

msgid "IndexNow"
msgstr "现在索引"

msgid "Naver"
msgstr "纳维尔"

msgid "Seznam"
msgstr "塞兹南"

msgid "Yep"
msgstr "是的"

msgid "Sitemaps can be regenerated on demand here."
msgstr "可以在此处根据需要重新生成站点地图。"

msgid "There are no items to be indexed."
msgstr "没有要编制索引的项目。"

msgid "Rebuild queue"
msgstr "重建队列"

msgid "Rebuild queue & generate"
msgstr "重建队列并生成"

msgid "Progress of sitemap regeneration"
msgstr "站点地图更新进度"

msgid "Sitemap status"
msgstr "站点地图状态"

msgid "Link count"
msgstr "链接数"

msgid "Add sitemap"
msgstr "添加站点地图"

msgid "Sitemaps"
msgstr "站点地图"

msgid "Initializing..."
msgstr "正在初始化..."

msgid "@indexed out of @total total queue items have been processed."
msgstr "已处理 @total 总数的队列项目中的 @indexed。"

msgid "Otherwise the sitemaps will be regenerated during a future cron run."
msgstr "否则，站点地图将在未来的 cron 运行期间重新生成。"

msgid "This setting will regenerate all sitemaps including the above changes."
msgstr "此设置将重新生成所有站点地图，包括上述更改。"

msgid "Do not index entities of type <em>@bundle</em> in sitemap <em>@sitemap</em>"
msgstr "不要在站点地图 <em>@sitemap</em> 中索引类型为 <em>@bundle</em> 的实体"

msgid "Index entities of type <em>@bundle</em> in sitemap <em>@sitemap</em>"
msgstr "站点地图 <em>@sitemap</em> 中类型为 <em>@bundle</em> 的索引实体"

msgid "The priority entities of this type will have in the eyes of search engine bots."
msgstr "这种类型的优先实体将在搜索引擎机器人的眼中具有优先权。"

msgid "always"
msgstr "总是"

msgid "hourly"
msgstr "每小时"

msgid "The frequency with which entities of this type change. Search engine bots may take this as an indication of how often to index them."
msgstr "该类型实体发生变化的频率。搜索引擎机器人可能会将此视为索引它们的频率的指示。"

msgid "Include images"
msgstr "包含图像"

msgid "Determines if images referenced by entities of this type should be included in the sitemap."
msgstr "确定此类型的实体引用的图像是否应包含在站点地图中。"

msgid "Notify IndexNow search engines of changes <em>by default</em>"
msgstr "通知 IndexNow 搜索引擎更改 <em> 默认情况下 </em>"

msgid "Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after submitting entity forms of this type.<br/>Changes include creating, deleting and updating of an entity. This setting can be overridden on the entity form."
msgstr "提交此类型的实体表单后，立即向兼容 IndexNow 的搜索引擎发送变更通知。<br>变更包括创建、删除和更新。此项可在实体表单上单独覆盖。"

msgid "Regenerate all sitemaps after hitting <em>Save</em>"
msgstr "点击 <em>Save</em> 后重新生成所有站点地图"

msgid "Index this <em>@bundle</em> entity in sitemap <em>@sitemap</em>"
msgstr "在站点地图 <em>@sitemap</em> 中索引此 <em>@bundle</em> 实体"

msgid "Do not index this <em>@bundle</em> entity in sitemap <em>@sitemap</em>"
msgstr "请勿在站点地图 <em>@sitemap</em> 中索引此 <em>@bundle</em> 实体"

msgid "The priority this <em>@bundle</em> entity will have in the eyes of search engine bots."
msgstr "此 <em>@bundle</em> 实体在搜索引擎机器人眼中的优先级。"

msgid "The frequency with which this <em>@bundle</em> entity changes. Search engine bots may take this as an indication of how often to index it."
msgstr "此 <em>@bundle</em> 实体更改的频率。搜索引擎机器人可能会将此视为索引频率的指示。"

msgid "Determines if images referenced by this <em>@bundle</em> entity should be included in the sitemap."
msgstr "确定此 <em>@bundle</em> 实体引用的图像是否应包含在站点地图中。"

msgid "Settings for this entity can be overridden here."
msgstr "可以在此处覆盖该实体的设置。"

msgid "Provides tools for auditing and analyzing Drupal sites."
msgstr "提供用于审核和分析 Drupal 站点的工具。"

msgid "Enables all production-ready audit submodules at once. Excludes code analysis modules (phpcs, phpstan, rector) which require external tools."
msgstr "立即启用所有生产就绪的审核子模块。不包括需要外部工具的代码分析模块（phpcs、phpstan、rector）。"

msgid "Analyzes content volume by entity type, bundle, and language. Detects empty bundles, revision bloat, and translation gaps."
msgstr "按实体类型、捆绑包和语言分析内容量。检测空包、修订膨胀和翻译间隙。"

msgid "Analyzes menu structure, depth, and identifies navigation issues."
msgstr "分析菜单结构、深度并识别导航问题。"

msgid "Analyzes block types, block instances, their placement and cache configuration."
msgstr "分析区块类型、区块实例、它们的放置和缓存配置。"

msgid "Analyzes cron tasks, queue workers, and cron execution status."
msgstr "分析 cron 任务、队列工作人员和 cron 执行状态。"

msgid "Analyzes installed modules and themes, detects unused extensions, and provides recommendations based on project type."
msgstr "分析已安装的模块和主题，检测未使用的扩展，并根据项目类型提供建议。"

msgid "Analyzes pending module and theme updates, including security updates."
msgstr "分析待处理的模块和主题更新，包括安全更新。"

msgid "Analyzes cache bins, configuration, efficiency, and cache-related best practices."
msgstr "分析缓存仓、配置、效率和缓存相关的最佳实践。"

msgid "Analyzes code complexity metrics (LOC, cyclomatic complexity, maintainability index) for custom modules and themes using phploc. Requires phploc binary installed on the server. Not recommended for production environments as it can be resource-intensive."
msgstr "使用 phploc 分析自定义模块和主题的代码复杂性指标（LOC、圈复杂度、可维护性指数）。需要在服务器上安装 phploc 二进制文件。不建议用于生产环境，因为它可能会占用资源。"

msgid "Detects duplicated code (copy-paste / clones) in custom modules and themes using jscpd. Requires jscpd (Node.js npm package) installed globally. Not recommended for production environments."
msgstr "使用 jscpd 检测自定义模块和主题中的重复代码（复制粘贴/克隆）。需要全局安装 jscpd（Node.js npm 包）。不建议用于生产环境。"

msgid "Scores this environment against the configuration values and installed modules it declares, and exposes the result as a block and in the Navigation bar."
msgstr "根据它声明的配置值和已安装的模块对该环境进行评分，并将结果作为区块公开在导航栏中。"

msgid "Analyzes database size, table sizes, and potentially problematic tables."
msgstr "分析数据库大小、表大小和潜在有问题的表。"

msgid "Analyzes entity fields, bundles, and view modes."
msgstr "分析实体字段、捆绑包和视图模式。"

msgid "Exposes /audit/health, protected by a secret, for uptime monitors and load balancers: 200 OK while the selected audits reach their minimum scores and the database, cron, files and cache checks pass, 503 FAIL otherwise. Enabling the module creates the endpoint."
msgstr "公开/audit/health，受秘密保护，用于正常运行时间监视器和负载平衡器：200 OK，当选定的审计达到最低分数并且数据库、cron、文件和缓存检查通过时，503 FAIL 否则。启用该模块会创建端点。"

msgid "Analyzes image display configuration including image styles, responsive styles, breakpoints, and field formatters."
msgstr "分析图像显示配置，包括图像样式、响应式样式、断点和字段格式化程序。"

msgid "Analyzes multilingual configuration and translation status."
msgstr "分析多语言配置和翻译状态。"

msgid "Analyzes performance configuration, cache settings, cache modules status, and detects cache issues in custom code."
msgstr "分析性能配置、缓存设置、缓存模块状态，并检测自定义代码中的缓存问题。"

msgid "Runs PHP CodeSniffer with Drupal coding standards. Requires phpcs binary installed on the server. Not recommended for production environments as it can be resource-intensive."
msgstr "使用 Drupal 编码标准运行 PHP CodeSniffer。需要在服务器上安装 phpcs 二进制文件。不建议用于生产环境，因为它可能会占用资源。"

msgid "Runs PHPStan static analysis on custom code. Requires phpstan binary installed on the server. Not recommended for production environments as it can be resource-intensive and may expose sensitive code paths."
msgstr "对自定义代码运行 PHPStan 静态分析。需要在服务器上安装 phpstan 二进制文件。不建议用于生产环境，因为它可能会占用大量资源，并且可能会暴露敏感代码路径。"

msgid "Analyzes the test structure of custom modules: counts test files per suite (Unit, Kernel, Functional, FunctionalJavascript) and flags modules without unit tests. Tests are not executed; run them in CI/CD instead."
msgstr "分析自定义模块的测试结构：计算每个套件的测试文件（单元、内核、功能、FunctionalJavascript）并标记没有单元测试的模块。不执行测试；相反，在 CI/CD 中运行它们。"

msgid "Audits Search API configuration including indexes and servers status."
msgstr "审核搜索 API 配置，包括索引和服务器状态。"

msgid "Performs security audits to detect configuration errors and potential vulnerabilities."
msgstr "执行安全审核以检测配置错误和潜在漏洞。"

msgid "Analyzes SEO configuration, modules, and image optimization."
msgstr "分析 SEO 配置、模块和图像优化。"

msgid "Analyzes Drupal system status including PHP, MySQL, and core versions."
msgstr "分析 Drupal 系统状态，包括 PHP、MySQL 和核心版本。"

msgid "Analyzes Twig templates for unused fields and best practices."
msgstr "分析 Twig 模板中未使用的字段和最佳实践。"

msgid "Analyzes URL aliases and redirects (loops, collisions, broken targets, route shadowing). Path Alias and Redirect modules are detected at runtime; only applicable groups are checked."
msgstr "分析 URL 别名和重定向（循环、冲突、损坏的目标、路由阴影）。运行时检测路径别名和重定向模块；仅检查适用的组。"

msgid "Analyzes Views displays, cache settings, and Search API usage."
msgstr "分析视图显示、缓存设置和搜索 API 使用情况。"

msgid "Analyzes database logging (watchdog) for errors, warnings, and performance issues."
msgstr "分析数据库日志记录（看门狗）中的错误、警告和性能问题。"

msgid "Audit"
msgstr "审计"

msgid "View audit reports and configure analyzers."
msgstr "查看审计报告并配置分析器。"

msgid "Config Checks Audit"
msgstr "配置检查审核"

msgid "Maintainability"
msgstr "可维护性"

msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "维护"

msgid "Complexity"
msgstr "复杂"

msgid "Best Practice"
msgstr "最佳实践"

msgid "Deprecation"
msgstr "弃用"

msgid "Reliability"
msgstr "可靠性"

msgid "Security Risk"
msgstr "安全风险"

msgid "Contrib"
msgstr "贡献"

msgid "With code"
msgstr "有代码"

msgid "Without code"
msgstr "无代码"

msgid "Module / Theme"
msgstr "模块/主题"

msgid "File Type"
msgstr "文件类型"

msgid "Code Snippet"
msgstr "代码片段"

msgid "Issue Type"
msgstr "问题类型"

msgid "@visible of @total"
msgstr "@visible 或 @total"

msgid "@total items"
msgstr "@total 项目"

msgid "Any value other than @value is accepted."
msgstr "接受除 @value 之外的任何值。"

msgid "not @value"
msgstr "不是@value"

msgid "Matches the expected value."
msgstr "与预期值相符。"

msgid "Matches the expected state."
msgstr "符合预期状态。"

msgid "Module: @module"
msgstr "模块：@module"

msgid "Must not be installed, but it is."
msgstr "一定不能安装，但确实如此。"

msgid "Configuration expectations"
msgstr "配置期望"

msgid "@passed of @total declared expectations match this environment, @failed differ and @missing point at values that do not exist here (worth half a point each)."
msgstr "@total 声明的期望的 @passed 与此环境匹配，@failed 不同，@missing 指向此处不存在的值（各值半分）。"

msgid "Verifies that configuration values and installed modules match the expectations declared for this environment."
msgstr "验证配置值和安装的模块是否符合为此环境声明的期望。"

msgid "Generated:"
msgstr "生成："

msgid "Expected"
msgstr "预期的"

msgid "Actual"
msgstr "实际的"

msgid "Declared expectations"
msgstr "宣称的期望"

msgid "Every expectation declared for this environment and its current state: green when the value matches, red when it exists with a different value, amber when the value does not exist here at all. A green row is worth one point, a red one none, and an amber one half, because an expectation aimed at something that does not exist is itself misconfigured."
msgstr "针对该环境及其当前状态声明的每个期望：当值匹配时为绿色，当存在不同值时为红色，当该值根本不存在时为琥珀色。绿色行值一分，红色行值一分，黄色行值二分之一，因为针对不存在的事物的期望本身就是错误配置的。"

msgid "Audit data is not being sent to DruScan"
