msgstr "@total 标记缓存视图的 @issues 使用通用实体列表标记（@frontend 前端、@admin 管理）- @percent% 加权"

msgid "Cache Tags"
msgstr "缓存标签"

msgid "No administration views are accessible by anonymous users"
msgstr "匿名用户无法访问任何管理视图"

msgid "Anonymous Access"
msgstr "匿名访问"

msgid "Views Audit"
msgstr "意见审核"

msgid "Last 24 hours"
msgstr "过去 24 小时"

msgid "@total entries · score @score/100"
msgstr "@total 条目 · 得分 @score/100"

msgid "Older entries"
msgstr "较旧的条目"

msgid "No log entries in this period"
msgstr "此期间没有日志条目"

msgid "Watchdog Audit"
msgstr "看门狗审计"

msgid "Successfully completed @count audits."
msgstr "成功完成 @count 审核。"

msgid "No issues"
msgstr "没有问题"

msgid "1 warning"
msgid_plural "@count warnings"
msgstr[0] "1 次警告"
msgstr[1] "@count 警告"

msgid "1 notice"
msgid_plural "@count notices"
msgstr[0] "1 条通知"
msgstr[1] "@count 通知"

msgid "No complexity hotspots detected. All functions are within acceptable complexity thresholds."
msgstr "未检测到复杂性热点。所有功能都在可接受的复杂性阈值内。"

msgid "No low-maintainability functions detected. All functions have an acceptable maintainability index."
msgstr "未检测到低可维护性功能。所有功能都有可接受的可维护性指数。"

msgid "No Drupal anti-patterns detected. Code follows best practices."
msgstr "未检测到 Drupal 反模式。代码遵循最佳实践。"

msgid "No analysis data available."
msgstr "没有可用的分析数据。"

msgid "Install the maintained phploc fork by Chris Gmyr. This is a drop-in replacement that supports PHP 8.x and Symfony Console 6+/7+."
msgstr "安装 Chris Gmyr 维护的 phploc 分支。这是一个支持 PHP 8.x 和 Symfony Console 6+/7+ 的直接替代品。"

msgid "Verify installation. You should see: \"phploc X.Y.Z by Chris Gmyr.\""
msgstr "验证安装。您应该看到：“phploc X.Y.Z by Chris Gmyr。”"

msgid "How to install phploc for code complexity analysis"
msgstr "如何安装phploc进行代码复杂度分析"

msgid "phploc is a lightweight tool that quickly measures the size and structure of PHP projects, including lines of code, cyclomatic complexity, and class/method statistics."
msgstr "phploc 是一个轻量级工具，可以快速测量 PHP 项目的大小和结构，包括代码行数、圈复杂度和类/方法统计信息。"

msgid "IMPORTANT: Do NOT install phploc/phploc (the original by Sebastian Bergmann). It is abandoned since 2023 and incompatible with Drupal 10/11. Use cmgmyr/phploc instead."
msgstr "重要提示：请勿安装 phploc/phploc（Sebastian Bergmann 原创）。它自 2023 年起被废弃，并且与 Drupal 10/11 不兼容。请改用 cmgmyr/phploc。"

msgid "Cyclomatic complexity and the Maintainability Index are computed natively (no external tool required); phploc only adds aggregate size/structure metrics."
msgstr "循环复杂度和可维护性指数是本地计算的（无需外部工具）； phploc 仅添加聚合大小/结构指标。"

msgid "The analysis focuses on custom modules and themes in modules/custom/ and themes/custom/ directories."
msgstr "分析重点是modules/custom/和themes/custom/目录中的自定义模块和主题。"

msgid "Documentation: <a href=\"@url\" target=\"_blank\">@url</a>"
msgstr "文档：<a href=\"@url\" target=\"_blank\">@url</a>"

msgid "No detailed metrics available. Run the analysis first."
msgstr "没有可用的详细指标。首先运行分析。"

msgid "No API usage data available. Run the analysis first."
msgstr "没有可用的 API 使用数据。首先运行分析。"

msgid "Complexity Hotspots"
msgstr "复杂性热点"

msgid "Functions and methods with high cyclomatic complexity that are difficult to test and maintain."
msgstr "圈复杂度高、难以测试和维护的函数和方法。"

msgid "Maintainability Index"
msgstr "可维护性指标"

msgid "Functions with a low maintainability index (computed natively from per-function Halstead volume, lines of code and cyclomatic complexity, no external tool required)."
msgstr "可维护性指数较低的函数（根据每个函数的 Halstead 体积、代码行数和圈复杂度本地计算，无需外部工具）。"

msgid "Drupal Anti-Patterns"
msgstr "Drupal 反模式"

msgid "Code patterns that violate Drupal best practices: service locators, deep arrays, hardcoded IDs, direct queries."
msgstr "违反 Drupal 最佳实践的代码模式：服务定位器、深度数组、硬编码 ID、直接查询。"

msgid "Metrics Overview"
msgstr "指标概述"

msgid "Summary of code complexity metrics from phploc analysis."
msgstr "phploc 分析中的代码复杂性指标摘要。"

msgid "Detailed Code Metrics"
msgstr "详细的代码指标"

msgid "Detailed breakdown of lines of code, classes, methods, and functions."
msgstr "代码行、类、方法和函数的详细细分。"

msgid "Drupal API Usage"
msgstr "Drupal API 使用"

msgid "Analysis of Drupal Core APIs used in custom code: hooks, preprocess functions, event subscribers, and global functions."
msgstr "自定义代码中使用的 Drupal Core API 分析：挂钩、预处理函数、事件订阅者和全局函数。"

msgid "These expectations describe what a correct configuration looks like on this environment. They are the single source for two things: the score of this audit, and the \"Audit: configuration checks\" summary block. Both read the same list, so the report and the block can never disagree."
msgstr "这些期望描述了此环境中正确的配置是什么样的。它们是两件事的单一来源：此审核的分数和“审核：配置检查”摘要区块。两者都阅读相同的列表，因此报告和区块永远不会不一致。"

msgid "Because the list is configuration, every project and every environment declares its own rules, for core, contrib or custom modules alike. For example: CSS and JS aggregation must be enabled in production; the Devel module must not be installed in production but must be installed on a development environment; a project specific custom module must stay enabled here."
msgstr "Because the list is configuration, every project and every environment declares its own rules, for core, contrib or custom modules alike.例如：生产中必须启用CSS和JS聚合； Devel 模块不得安装在生产环境中，而必须安装在开发环境中； a project specific custom module must stay enabled here."

msgid "And because it is a plain configuration object, it can be overridden per environment like any other: assign <code>@override</code> in <code>settings.php</code>, or ship a different version of that configuration from a Config Split. The checks then run against the overridden values."
msgstr "而且因为它是一个普通的配置对象，所以它可以像任何其他环境一样被每个环境覆盖：在 <code>settings.php</code> 中分配 <code>@override</code>，或者从配置拆分中发送该配置的不同版本。然后针对覆盖的值运行检查。"

msgid "Module recommendations for <strong>@categories</strong> are active because their audit submodules are enabled."
msgstr "<strong>@categories</strong> 的模块建议处于活动状态，因为其审核子模块已启用。"

msgid "recommended"
msgstr "受到推崇的"

msgid "Not installed:"
msgstr "未安装："

msgid "These entity types will be automatically mapped when their modules are installed."
msgstr "这些实体类型将在安装其模块时自动映射。"

msgid "Send audit data to DruScan"
msgstr "将审核数据发送至 DruScan"

msgid "Project API Key"
msgstr "项目 API 密钥"

msgid "The authentication API key for your DruScan project. You can enter the value here, but it is <strong>strongly recommended</strong> to store it in <code>settings.php</code> or <code>settings.local.php</code> instead, as each environment (local, staging, production) should have its own API key and connection credentials should not be stored in exported configuration."
msgstr "DruScan 项目的身份验证 API 密钥。您可以在此处输入值，但<strong>强烈建议</strong>将其存储在 <code>settings.php</code> 或 <code>settings.local.php</code> 中，因为每个环境（本地、临时、生产）都应有自己的 API 密钥，并且连接凭据不应存储在导出的配置中。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "例子："

msgid "Environment API Key"
msgstr "环境 API 密钥"

msgid "The authentication API key for your DruScan environment. You can enter the value here, but it is <strong>strongly recommended</strong> to store it in <code>settings.php</code> or <code>settings.local.php</code> instead, as each environment (local, staging, production) should have its own API key and connection credentials should not be stored in exported configuration."
msgstr "DruScan 环境的身份验证 API 密钥。您可以在此处输入值，但<strong>强烈建议</strong>将其存储在 <code>settings.php</code> 或 <code>settings.local.php</code> 中，因为每个环境（本地、临时、生产）都应有自己的 API 密钥，并且连接凭据不应存储在导出的配置中。"

msgid "Test Connection"
msgstr "测试连接"

msgid "DruScan Integration"
msgstr "DruScan 集成"

msgid "Mostly anonymous users (e.g., news sites, blogs)"
msgstr "大多数是匿名用户（例如新闻网站、博客）"

msgid "Mostly registered users (e.g., intranets, membership sites)"
msgstr "大多数注册用户（例如内联网、会员网站）"

msgid "Mixed anonymous and registered (e.g., forums, e-commerce)"
msgstr "混合匿名和注册（例如论坛、电子商务）"

msgid "Primary user type"
msgstr "主要用户类型"

msgid "Select the primary type of users visiting your site. This helps tailor recommendations for caching, performance, and security."
msgstr "选择访问您网站的主要用户类型。这有助于定制有关缓存、性能和安全性的建议。"

msgid "Directories to scan"
msgstr "要扫描的目录"

msgid "Enter one directory path per line, relative to the project root (e.g., web/modules/custom). These directories will be scanned by analyzers that perform code analysis (Performance, Twig, PHPStan, PHPCS, Rector, etc.). They must stay inside the project: paths with \"..\" and absolute paths outside it are not allowed."
msgstr "每行输入一个相对于项目根目录的目录路径（例如，web/modules/custom）。这些目录将由执行代码分析的分析器（Performance、Twig、PHPStan、PHPCS、Rector 等）扫描。它们必须保留在项目内部：不允许带有“..”的路径和项目外部的绝对路径。"

msgid "Exclude patterns"
msgstr "排除模式"

msgid "Enter one pattern per line. Files or directories matching these patterns will be excluded from scanning (e.g., *Test.php, tests/, node_modules/)."
msgstr "每行输入一个模式。匹配这些模式的文件或目录将从扫描中排除（例如，*Test.php、tests/、node_modules/）。"

msgid "Static rule overrides"
msgstr "静态规则覆盖"

msgid "Disable a code rule of the Security, Performance, Cache or Twig audit, or change its severity, for the whole site or for some paths. One override per line: <code>RULE_ID [PATH_PATTERN] SEVERITY</code>, where SEVERITY is error, warning, notice or disabled and PATH_PATTERN is matched against the file path relative to the project root (<code>*</code> also matches <code>/</code>). Rule IDs are the finding codes shown in the reports. When several lines match, the last one wins. Example: <code>CACHE_MAX_AGE_ZERO */src/Controller/Admin* notice</code>"
msgstr "禁用整个站点或某些路径的安全性、性能、缓存或 Twig 审核的代码规则，或更改其严重性。每行一个覆盖：<code>RULE_ID [PATH_PATTERN] SEVERITY</code>，其中 SEVERITY 是错误、警告、通知或禁用，PATH_PATTERN 与相对于项目根目录的文件路径匹配（<code>*</code> 也匹配 <code>/</code>）。规则 ID 是报告中显示的查找代码。当多行匹配时，最后一行获胜。示例：<code>CACHE_MAX_AGE_ZERO */src/Controller/Admin* 通知</code>"

msgid "Modules allowed to be enabled"
msgstr "允许启用的模块"

msgid "Development or risky modules that this site keeps enabled on purpose, one machine name per line (e.g. devel). They are still listed in the Modules and Performance audits, as acknowledged information, but no longer count as problems. To allow a module on development environments only, set this value in settings.php: <code>$config['audit.settings']['allowed_modules'] = \"devel\";</code>"
msgstr "该站点故意启用的开发或有风险的模块，每行一个机器名称（例如 devel）。它们仍然作为公认信息列在模块和性能审核中，但不再算作问题。要仅在开发环境中允许模块，请在 settings.php 中设置此值： <code>$config['audit.settings']['allowed_modules'] = \"devel\";</code>"

msgid "Accept configuration overridden only in this environment"
msgstr "仅在此环境中接受覆盖的配置"

msgid "For development environments that override configuration on purpose (for example DDEV sets the error level to verbose). Findings caused by such an override, such as visible error messages or disabled CSS/JS aggregation, are listed as acknowledged information when the stored configuration is production-safe; when the stored value fails too, they keep their severity. Enable it in the settings.php of that environment, never in exported configuration: <code>@code</code>"
msgstr "对于有意覆盖配置的开发环境（例如 DDEV 将错误级别设置为详细）。当存储的配置是生产安全的时，由此类覆盖引起的结果（例如可见的错误消息或禁用的 CSS/JS 聚合）将被列为已确认信息；当存储的值也失败时，它们会保持其严重性。在该环境的 settings.php 中启用它，而不是在导出的配置中启用它：<code>@code</code>"

msgid "Execution timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "执行超时（秒）"

msgid "Maximum time for external tools (PHPCS, PHPStan, phploc) to complete analysis. <strong>Recommended: 60 seconds.</strong> Increase for very large codebases. Also limited by PHP max_execution_time."
msgstr "外部工具（PHPCS、PHPStan、phploc）完成分析的最长时间。 <strong>建议：60 秒。</strong>对于非常大的代码库，增加时间。还受到 PHP max_execution_time 的限制。"

msgid "0 - Excluded"
msgstr "0 - 排除"

msgid "1 - Low"
msgstr "1 - 低"

msgid "2 - Below Average"
msgstr "2 - 低于平均水平"

msgid "3 - Average"
msgstr "3 - 平均"

msgid "4 - Above Average"
msgstr "4 - 高于平均水平"

msgid "5 - Critical"
msgstr "5 - 严重"

msgid "Project Score Multipliers"
msgstr "项目分数乘数"

msgid "These multipliers determine how each audit contributes to the <strong>overall Project Score</strong> displayed on the audit overview page. The Project Score is calculated as a weighted average: audits with higher multipliers have more influence on the final score. For example, if \"Updates\" has a multiplier of 5 (Critical) and \"Twig\" has a multiplier of 2 (Low), security updates will affect the Project Score 2.5 times more than Twig issues. Set a multiplier to 0 to completely exclude that audit from the Project Score calculation."
msgstr "这些乘数决定每次审核对审核概述页面上显示的 <strong> 总体项目得分 </strong> 的贡献。项目分数按加权平均值计算：乘数越高的审核对最终分数的影响越大。例如，如果“更新”的乘数为 5（严重），“Twig”的乘数为 2（低），则安全更新对项目得分的影响是 Twig 问题的 2.5 倍。将乘数设置为 0 以将该审核完全排除在项目分数计算之外。"

msgid "Ignore cache bin analysis"
msgstr "忽略缓存箱分析"

msgid "Skip analysis of cache bin inventory and backend assignments."
msgstr "跳过缓存仓库存和后端分配的分析。"

msgid "Ignore cache backend analysis"
msgstr "忽略缓存后端分析"

msgid "Skip the whole cache backend section: default backend, Redis/Memcache and page cache checks."
msgstr "跳过整个缓存后端部分：默认后端、Redis/Memcache 和页面缓存检查。"

msgid "Accept the database cache backend (no Redis/Memcache)"
msgstr "接受数据库缓存后端（无Redis/Memcache）"

msgid "For sites where database-only caching is intentional: the database backend and missing Redis/Memcache findings are listed as acknowledged information and do not affect the score. The page cache checks still run."
msgstr "对于有意仅进行数据库缓存的站点：数据库后端和缺失的 Redis/Memcache 结果被列为已确认信息，不会影响分数。页面缓存检查仍在运行。"

msgid "Ignore cache tag usage analysis"
msgstr "忽略缓存标签使用分析"

msgid "Skip analysis of cache tag usage patterns in custom code."
msgstr "跳过自定义代码中缓存标记使用模式的分析。"

msgid "Ignore cache tag invalidation analysis"
msgstr "忽略缓存标签失效分析"

msgid "Skip snapshot-based analysis of cache tag invalidation frequency from the cachetags table. When enabled, a snapshot is saved every 12 hours to calculate deltas."
msgstr "从缓存标签表中跳过基于快照的缓存标签失效频率分析。启用后，每 12 小时保存一次快照以计算增量。"

msgid "Paths to analyze and exclude patterns are configured in the <a href=\":url\">main audit settings</a> (scan_directories and exclude_patterns)."
msgstr "分析和排除模式的路径在<a href=\":url\">主审核设置</a>中配置（scan_directories 和 except_patterns）。"

msgid "Include test files"
msgstr "包含测试文件"

msgid "Include test files in analysis. Not recommended - tests have different complexity patterns."
msgstr "在分析中包括测试文件。不推荐 - 测试具有不同的复杂性模式。"

msgid "Analysis Scope"
msgstr "分析范围"

msgid "CCN warning threshold"
msgstr "CCN警告阈值"

msgid "Functions with cyclomatic complexity above this value will generate warnings. <strong>Recommended: 10</strong>"
msgstr "圈复杂度高于此值的函数将生成警告。 <strong>推荐：10</strong>"

msgid "CCN error threshold"
msgstr "CCN 错误阈值"

msgid "Functions with cyclomatic complexity above this value will generate errors. <strong>Recommended: 20</strong>"
msgstr "圈复杂度高于该值的函数将产生错误。 <strong>推荐：20</strong>"

msgid "Maintainability index warning threshold"
msgstr "可维护性指标预警阈值"

msgid "Functions with a maintainability index below this value will generate warnings. The index is on a 0-100 scale (higher is better) and combines the Halstead volume, lines of code and cyclomatic complexity of each function. <strong>Recommended: 40</strong>"
msgstr "可维护性指数低于此值的函数将生成警告。该指数的范围是 0-100（越高越好），并结合了 Halstead 体积、代码行数和每个函数的圈复杂度。 <strong>推荐：40</strong>"

msgid "Maintainability index error threshold"
msgstr "可维护性指标误差阈值"

msgid "Functions with a maintainability index below this value will generate errors. Same 0-100 scale as the warning threshold (Halstead volume, lines of code and cyclomatic complexity). <strong>Recommended: 20</strong>"
msgstr "可维护性指数低于该值的函数将产生错误。与警告阈值相同的 0-100 范围（霍尔斯特德体积、代码行数和圈复杂度）。 <strong>推荐：20</strong>"

msgid "Deep array threshold"
msgstr "深阵列阈值"

msgid "Arrays nested deeper than this level will be flagged. Recommended: 5 (Drupal render arrays commonly use 3-4 levels, so 5 avoids false positives)."
msgstr "嵌套深度超过此级别的数组将被标记。推荐：5（Drupal 渲染数组通常使用 3-4 个级别，因此 5 可以避免误报）。"

msgid "Complexity Thresholds"
msgstr "复杂性阈值"

msgid "Detect service locators"
msgstr "检测服务定位器"

msgid "Flag usage of \\Drupal::service() and similar static calls. Use dependency injection instead."
msgstr "标记 \\Drupal::service() 和类似静态调用的使用。请改用依赖注入。"

msgid "Allow service locators in procedural files"
msgstr "允许程序文件中的服务定位器"

msgid "When enabled, \\Drupal:: calls in .module, .install, .theme, .inc, .profile, .deploy.php, and .post_update.php files will not be flagged. These files often cannot use dependency injection."
msgstr "启用后，\\Drupal:: .module、.install、.theme、.inc、.profile、.deploy.php 和 .post_update.php 文件中的调用将不会被标记。这些文件通常无法使用依赖注入。"

msgid "Detect deep array nesting"
msgstr "检测深度数组嵌套"

msgid "Flag arrays with excessive nesting levels."
msgstr "标记嵌套级别过多的数组。"

msgid "Detect hardcoded entity IDs"
msgstr "检测硬编码实体 ID"

msgid "Flag hardcoded numeric IDs in entity load calls."
msgstr "标记实体加载调用中的硬编码数字 ID。"

msgid "Detect direct database queries"
msgstr "检测直接数据库查询"

msgid "Flag usage of deprecated db_query() and similar functions."
msgstr "标记已弃用的 db_query() 和类似函数的使用情况。"

msgid "Detect dynamic low-level render keys"
msgstr "检测动态低级渲染关键点"

msgid "Flag dynamic values assigned to #markup or #children. Use #theme or #type with a template instead."
msgstr "标记分配给#markup 或#children 的动态值。而是使用 #theme 或 #type 与模板。"

msgid "Detect global variables"
msgstr "检测全局变量"

msgid "Flag usage of the global keyword. Inject the needed service or value instead."
msgstr "标记 global 关键字的使用。相反，注入所需的服务或价值。"

msgid "Detect error suppression"
msgstr "检测错误抑制"

msgid "Flag function calls silenced with the @ operator (trigger_error() is allowed)."
msgstr "使用@运算符标记函数调用静音（允许trigger_error()）。"

msgid "Anti-Pattern Detection"
msgstr "反模式检测"

msgid "Maximum hotspots to display"
msgstr "显示的最大热点数"

msgid "Limit the number of complexity hotspots shown. <strong>Recommended: 20</strong>"
msgstr "限制显示的复杂性热点的数量。 <strong>推荐：20</strong>"

msgid "Execution timeout is configured globally in the <a href=\":url\">main audit settings</a>."
msgstr "执行超时在 <a href=\":url\"> 主审核设置 </a> 中全局配置。"

msgid "One expectation per line, in the format <code>config.object:key = expected value</code>. Use <code>!=</code> instead of <code>=</code> when any other value is acceptable, for instance <code>system.performance:cache.page.max_age != 0</code> to require that page caching is on whatever its lifetime. Values are compared as text: use <code>true</code> / <code>false</code> for booleans. Values of keys that look like secrets (passwords, tokens, API keys, salts), or of mappings that contain one, are compared but shown as (hidden) in the report. Lines starting with # are comments."
msgstr "每行一个期望，格式为 <code>config.object:key = Expected value</code>。当任何其他值都可接受时，请使用 <code>!=</code> 而不是 <code>=</code>，例如 <code>system.performance:cache.page.max_age != 0</code> 要求页面缓存无论其生命周期如何。值作为文本进行比较：使用 <code>true</code> / <code>false</code> 作为布尔值。比较看起来像秘密的密钥值（密码、令牌、API 密钥、盐）或包含秘密的映射的值，但在报告中显示为（隐藏）。以 # 开头的行是注释。"

msgid "Modules that must be installed"
msgstr "必须安装的模块"

msgid "One module machine name per line."
msgstr "每行一个模块机器名称。"

msgid "Modules that must not be installed"
msgstr "不得安装的模块"

msgid "One module machine name per line. Development modules belong here."
msgstr "每行一个模块机器名称。开发模块属于这里。"

msgid "Maximum hours without cron execution"
msgstr "不执行 cron 的最大小时数"

msgid "If cron has not run in this many hours, an error will be shown. Set to 0 to disable this check."
msgstr "如果 cron 在这么多小时内没有运行，将会显示错误。设置为 0 可禁用此检查。"

msgid "Queue items warning threshold"
msgstr "队列项目警告阈值"

msgid "If a queue has more than this many pending items, a warning will be shown. Set to 0 to disable this check."
msgstr "如果队列中的待处理项目多于此数量，则会显示警告。设置为 0 可禁用此检查。"

msgid "Table size threshold (MB)"
msgstr "表大小阈值 (MB)"

msgid "Tables exceeding this size will be flagged as warnings. Recommended: 50-100 MB (small sites), 100-500 MB (medium), 500-2000 MB (large)."
msgstr "超过此大小的表将被标记为警告。建议：50-100 MB（小型站点）、100-500 MB（中型）、500-2000 MB（大型）。"

msgid "Total database size threshold (MB)"
msgstr "数据库总大小阈值 (MB)"

msgid "Total database size exceeding this value will be flagged. Recommended: 500-1000 MB (small), 1000-5000 MB (medium), 5000-50000 MB (large)."
msgstr "超过此值的数据库总大小将被标记。建议：500-1000 MB（小型）、1000-5000 MB（中型）、5000-50000 MB（大型）。"

msgid "Ignore cache backend warnings (no Redis/Memcache)"
msgstr "忽略缓存后端警告（无 Redis/Memcache）"

msgid "When enabled, the audit will not penalize the score for missing external cache backends (Redis or Memcache). Use this for sites where database-only caching is intentional and acceptable. The Cache Audit has its own setting for its Redis/Memcache warnings."
msgstr "启用后，审核不会因缺少外部缓存后端（Redis 或 Memcache）而惩罚分数。对于有意且可以接受仅数据库缓存的站点，请使用此选项。缓存审核有其自己的 Redis/Memcache 警告设置。"

msgid "Ignore database logging (dblog) warnings"
msgstr "忽略数据库日志记录 (dblog) 警告"

msgid "When enabled, the audit will not penalize the score for using database logging without syslog. Use this for sites where database logging is intentionally kept active."
msgstr "启用后，审核不会惩罚使用不带 syslog 的数据库日志记录的分数。将其用于有意保持数据库日志记录处于活动状态的站点。"

msgid "Minimum duplicated lines"
msgstr "最少重复行数"

msgid "Minimum number of consecutive lines to consider as a clone. Lower values find more clones but increase false positives."
msgstr "视为克隆的最小连续行数。较低的值会发现更多克隆，但会增加误报。"

msgid "Minimum duplicated tokens"
msgstr "最小重复令牌数"

msgid "Minimum number of tokens (code units) in a clone block. Token-based matching is more accurate than line-based."
msgstr "克隆区块中令牌（代码单元）的最小数量。基于标记的匹配比基于行的匹配更准确。"

msgid "PHP (.php, .module, .install, .theme, .inc, .profile)"
msgstr "PHP（.php、.module、.install、.theme、.inc、.profile）"

msgid "Twig templates (.twig)"
msgstr "树枝模板 (.twig)"

msgid "JavaScript (.js)"
msgstr "JavaScript (.js)"

msgid "CSS (.css)"
msgstr "CSS (.css)"

msgid "File Formats"
msgstr "文件格式"

msgid "Maximum clones to display"
msgstr "显示的最大克隆数"

msgid "Limits the number of clone pairs shown in the report. Does not affect score calculation."
msgstr "限制报告中显示的克隆对的数量。不影响分数计算。"

msgid "Execution timeout is configured in the <a href=\":url\">main audit settings</a> (execution_timeout). Default is @default seconds — increase for large codebases."
msgstr "执行超时在 <a href=\":url\"> 主审核设置 </a> (execution_timeout) 中配置。默认值为 @default 秒 — 对于大型代码库会增加。"

msgid "Empty bundle threshold"
msgstr "空包阈值"

msgid "Minimum entities required for a bundle to not be considered empty."
msgstr "捆绑包不被视为空所需的最少实体。"

msgid "Bundles allowed to be empty"
msgstr "捆绑包允许为空"

msgid "Bundles that are legitimately empty on this site, such as transactional or user-generated content (orders, profiles, comments), one per line as entity_type:bundle, or entity_type:* for all bundles of an entity type. They are listed as acknowledged information and do not affect the score."
msgstr "此站点上合法为空的捆绑包，例如事务或用户生成的内容（订单、个人资料、评论），每行一个实体类型:bundle，或实体类型的所有捆绑包的entity_type:*。它们被列为公认信息，不会影响分数。"

msgid "Node revision threshold"
msgstr "节点修订阈值"

msgid "Flag nodes with more revisions than this."
msgstr "标记比这更多修订的节点。"

msgid "Paragraph revision threshold"
msgstr "段落修改阈值"

msgid "Revision tables size threshold (MB)"
msgstr "修订表大小阈值 (MB)"

msgid "Flag if revision tables exceed this size."
msgstr "如果修订表超过此大小，则进行标记。"

msgid "Maximum fields per bundle"
msgstr "每包最大字段数"

msgid "Maximum recommended fields per bundle. Guidelines: Simple sites: 15-20 | Medium sites: 25-35 | Complex sites: 40-50"
msgstr "每个包的最大推荐字段。指南：简单网站：15-20 |中型网站：25-35 |复杂站点：40-50"

msgid "Maximum view modes per bundle"
msgstr "每个捆绑包的最大视图模式"

msgid "Maximum active view modes per bundle. Guidelines: Simple sites: 2-3 | Medium sites: 4-6 | Component-based: 8-12"
msgstr "每个捆绑包的最大活动视图模式。指南：简单网站：2-3 |中等站点：4-6 |基于组件：8-12"

msgid "Maximum form modes per bundle"
msgstr "每个捆绑包的最大形式模式"

msgid "Maximum active form modes per bundle. Most sites only need 1-2."
msgstr "每个捆绑包的最大活动形式模式。大多数站点只需要 1-2 个。"

msgid "Fields allowed to be hidden"
msgstr "允许隐藏的字段"

msgid "Fields that are hidden in every view mode or form mode on purpose, because their values are read in preprocess functions or templates, rendered through Views, or kept as data, one per line as entity_type:bundle:field_name. Use * as the bundle for all bundles of an entity type (for example paragraph:*:field_anchor). They are listed as acknowledged information and do not affect the score."
msgstr "故意隐藏在每种视图模式或表单模式中的字段，因为它们的值在预处理函数或模板中读取，通过视图呈现，或保存为数据，每行一个作为entity_type:bundle:field_name。使用 * 作为实体类型的所有捆绑包的捆绑包（例如段落：*:field_anchor）。它们被列为公认信息，不会影响分数。"

msgid "Minimum translation percentage"
msgstr "最低翻译百分比"

msgid "Minimum required interface translation coverage for each language whose interface is translated (every non-English language, and English only when English translation is enabled). Recommended: 80% minimum for production, 100% ideal. Languages below this threshold will be flagged. Full translation coverage is easily achievable today using AI-powered automated translation tools."
msgstr "界面翻译的每种语言所需的最低界面翻译覆盖率（每种非英语语言，仅当启用英语翻译时才为英语）。建议：生产最低 80%，100% 理想。低于此阈值的语言将被标记。如今，使用人工智能驱动的自动翻译工具可以轻松实现完整的翻译覆盖。"

msgid "Analyze multilingual SEO configuration"
msgstr "分析多语言 SEO 配置"

msgid "When enabled, analyzes SEO-related configurations for multilingual sites. Disable this if SEO is not a priority for your site."
msgstr "启用后，分析多语言网站的 SEO 相关配置。如果 SEO 不是您网站的优先事项，请禁用此选项。"

msgid "Require responsive images"
msgstr "需要响应式图片"

msgid "Uncheck for projects that deliberately use plain image styles: the missing Responsive Image module and image fields without responsive images are then not reported. Image fields without any style are still reported."
msgstr "取消选中故意使用纯图像样式的项目：不会报告缺少的响应式图像模块和没有响应式图像的图像字段。仍然报告没有任何样式的图像字段。"

msgid "Maximum recommended menu depth"
msgstr "建议的最大菜单深度"

msgid "Menus with items deeper than this will be flagged. Top-level links are at depth 1, as in the Drupal menu settings."
msgstr "包含比这更深的项目的菜单将被标记。顶级链接的深度为 1，如 Drupal 菜单设置中所示。"

msgid "Excluded menus"
msgstr "排除菜单"

msgid "Menu machine names left out of the audit, one per line. The Administration menu (admin) is generated by modules such as Admin Toolbar and Commerce; its depth is not an information architecture decision of the site."
msgstr "菜单机器名称未经过审核，每行一个。管理菜单（admin）由Admin Toolbar、Commerce等模块生成；它的深度不是网站的信息架构决定的。"

msgid "No server-level cache services available (shared hosting, local or test environment)"
msgstr "没有可用的服务器级缓存服务（共享托管、本地或测试环境）"

msgid "Check this when the environment cannot run server-level cache services, such as shared hosting or a local or test environment. This will skip recommendations for advanced caching services (Memcache, Redis, Varnish) that require server-level installation."
msgstr "当环境无法运行服务器级缓存服务（例如共享托管或本地或测试环境）时，请选中此项。这将跳过需要服务器级安装的高级缓存服务（Memcache、Redis、Varnish）的建议。"

msgid "Ignored module recommendations"
msgstr "忽略的模块建议"

msgid "Machine names of recommended modules this site does not need, one per line (for example responsive_image). They are listed as acknowledged information and do not affect the score. Metatag, Schema.org Metatag, Pathauto, Redirect and Simple XML Sitemap also follow the matching \"ignore\" settings of the SEO audit, and Responsive Image the \"Require responsive images\" setting of the Images audit."
msgstr "该站点不需要的推荐模块的机器名称，每行一个（例如responsive_image）。它们被列为公认信息，不会影响分数。 Metatag、Schema.org Metatag、Pathauto、重定向和简单 XML 站点地图也遵循 SEO 审核的匹配“忽略”设置，响应式图像遵循图像审核的“需要响应式图像”设置。"

msgid "Ignore UI modules warnings"
msgstr "忽略 UI 模块警告"

msgid "By default, administration UI modules (views_ui, field_ui, webform_ui, etc.) generate warnings because they are not needed in production. Check this to ignore these warnings if your editors need these modules to manage content."
msgstr "默认情况下，管理 UI 模块（views_ui、field_ui、webform_ui 等）会生成警告，因为生产中不需要它们。如果您的编辑需要这些模块来管理内容，请选中此选项以忽略这些警告。"

msgid "Minimum page cache lifetime (seconds)"
msgstr "最小页面缓存生命周期（秒）"

msgid "Minimum recommended value for page cache duration. Pages cached for less time will trigger warnings. Guidelines: High-traffic/static sites: 24 hours (86400) | Medium sites: 6 hours (21600) | Dynamic sites: 1 hour (3600) | Real-time content: 15 min (900)"
msgstr "页面缓存持续时间的最小建议值。缓存时间较短的页面将触发警告。指南：高流量/静态站点：24 小时 (86400) |中型网站：6 小时 (21600) |动态站点：1 小时 (3600) |实时内容：15 分钟 (900)"

msgid "Ignore BigPipe Sessionless warnings"
msgstr "忽略 BigPipe 无会话警告"

msgid "When enabled, the audit will not penalize the score for missing the BigPipe Sessionless module (big_pipe_sessionless). Use this for sites where BigPipe Sessionless is intentionally not installed."
msgstr "启用后，审核不会因缺少 BigPipe Sessionless 模块 (big_pipe_sessionless) 而扣分。将其用于故意未安装 BigPipe Sessionless 的站点。"

msgid "File extensions to analyze"
msgstr "要分析的文件扩展名"

msgid "Comma-separated list of file extensions."
msgstr "以逗号分隔的文件扩展名列表。"

msgid "Recommended:"
msgstr "受到推崇的："

msgid "Includes all Drupal-specific extensions: PHP files, module files, install files, theme files, and info.yml. Markdown (.md) files are excluded to avoid false positives from code snippets in fenced blocks."
msgstr "包括所有特定于 Drupal 的扩展：PHP 文件、模块文件、安装文件、主题文件和 info.yml。排除 Markdown (.md) 文件以避免受隔离区块中的代码片段误报。"

msgid "1 - All issues (strictest)"
msgstr "1 - 所有问题（最严格）"

msgid "2 - Almost all"
msgstr "2 - 几乎全部"

msgid "3 - Minor issues and above"
msgstr "3 - 小问题及以上"

msgid "4 - Moderate issues and above"
msgstr "4 - 中等及以上问题"

msgid "5 - Balanced (recommended)"
msgstr "5 - 平衡（推荐）"

msgid "6 - Notable issues and above"
msgstr "6 - 值得注意的问题及以上"

msgid "7 - Important issues only"
msgstr "7 - 仅重要问题"

msgid "8 - Serious issues only"
msgstr "8 - 仅限严重问题"

msgid "9 - Critical issues only"
msgstr "9 - 仅关键问题"

msgid "10 - Most critical only"
msgstr "10 - 仅最关键"

msgid "Minimum severity level"
msgstr "最低严重级别"

msgid "Only report issues with this severity or higher. Lower values show more issues."
msgstr "仅报告此严重性或更高严重性的问题。较低的值表明更多问题。"

msgid "5 for balanced analysis. Use 1 for strict (all issues), 8+ for critical only."
msgstr "5 平衡分析。使用 1 表示严格（所有问题），8+ 仅表示严重。"

msgid "Ignore warnings (only show errors)"
msgstr "忽略警告（仅显示错误）"

msgid "When enabled, only coding standards errors will be reported. Warnings will be ignored."
msgstr "启用后，仅报告编码标准错误。警告将被忽略。"

msgid "Keep unchecked to see all issues. Enable only to focus on critical errors first in legacy codebases."
msgstr "保持未选中状态以查看所有问题。只允许首先关注遗留代码库中的关键错误。"

msgid "Exclude specific rules"
msgstr "排除特定规则"

msgid "Select rules to exclude from analysis. Useful for legacy code or specific project requirements."
msgstr "选择要从分析中排除的规则。对于遗留代码或特定项目要求很有用。"

msgid "Keep all enabled for new projects. For legacy migrations, temporarily exclude commenting rules."
msgstr "为新项目保持所有启用状态。对于遗留迁移，暂时排除注释规则。"

msgid "Parallel processes"
msgstr "并行进程"

msgid "Number of parallel processes for analysis."
msgstr "用于分析的并行进程数。"

msgid "4-10 depending on server CPU cores. Higher values speed up analysis on large codebases."
msgstr "4-10，具体取决于服务器 CPU 内核。较高的值可以加快大型代码库的分析速度。"

msgid "Enable caching"
msgstr "启用缓存"

msgid "Cache analysis results between runs. Significantly speeds up repeated analysis when only few files change."
msgstr "缓存运行之间的分析结果。当只有少数文件发生变化时，可显着加快重复分析的速度。"

msgid "Maximum violations to display"
msgstr "显示的最大违规次数"

msgid "Limits violations shown in results."
msgstr "限制结果中显示的违规行为。"

msgid "2000. Set to 0 for unlimited (may slow down the interface with many violations)."
msgstr "2000。设置为 0 表示无限制（可能会因许多违规而减慢接口速度）。"

msgid "Report width (characters)"
msgstr "报告宽度（字符）"

msgid "Maximum width for code snippets and messages."
msgstr "代码片段和消息的最大宽度。"

msgid "120 characters."
msgstr "120 个字符。"

msgid "Show sniff codes in results"
msgstr "在结果中显示嗅探代码"

msgid "Display the sniff identifier (e.g., Drupal.Commenting.DocComment) with each violation. Useful for understanding which rule was violated and for exclusion configuration."
msgstr "显示每个违规的嗅探标识符（例如 Drupal.Commenting.DocComment）。对于了解违反了哪个规则以及排除配置很有用。"

msgid "The analyzer auto-detects <code>phpcs</code> and <code>phpcbf</code> from <code>composer.json</code> (<code>config.bin-dir</code>) and the usual <code>vendor/bin/</code> and <code>bin/</code> locations. To use other executables, such as wrapper scripts, set their absolute paths in <code>settings.php</code> with <code>$settings['audit_phpcs_binary_path']</code> and <code>$settings['audit_phpcbf_binary_path']</code>. They cannot be set from this form, so that a configuration change cannot make the server run another program."
msgstr "分析器会从 <code>composer.json</code> (<code>config.bin-dir</code>) 以及常用的 <code>vendor/bin/</code> 和 <code>bin/</code> 位置自动检测 <code>phpcs</code> 和 <code>phpcbf</code>。要使用其他可执行文件（例如包装器脚本），请使用 <code>$settings['audit_phpcs_binary_path']</code> 和 <code>$settings['audit_phpcbf_binary_path']</code> 在 <code>settings.php</code> 中设置其绝对路径。它们不能从此形式设置，因此配置更改不能使服务器运行另一个程序。"

msgid "Paths set in settings.php"
msgstr "在settings.php中设置的路径"

msgid "Binary location"
msgstr "二进制位置"

msgid "Analysis level"
msgstr "分析级别"

msgid "PHPStan strictness level (0-10). <strong>Recommended: Level 5</strong> for most Drupal projects. Higher levels detect more issues but may report false positives. Start with level 5 and increase gradually as you fix errors."
msgstr "PHPStan 严格级别（0-10）。 <strong> 推荐：对于大多数 Drupal 项目，级别 5</strong>。级别越高，可以检测到更多问题，但可能会报告误报。从第 5 级开始，并在修复错误时逐渐增加。"

msgid "256 MB"
msgstr "256MB"

msgid "512 MB (@recommended)"
msgstr "512 MB (@recommended)"

msgid "1 GB"
msgstr "1GB"

msgid "2 GB"
msgstr "2GB"

msgid "Maximum memory PHPStan can use during analysis. Increase this if you get \"out of memory\" errors. <strong>Recommended: 512M</strong> for most projects, 1G for large codebases."
msgstr "PHPStan 在分析过程中可以使用的最大内存。如果出现“内存不足”错误，请增加此值。 <strong> 推荐：对于大多数项目为 512M</strong>，对于大型代码库为 1G。"

msgid "Maximum errors to display"
msgstr "显示的最大错误"

msgid "Limit the number of errors shown in the detailed results. Set a lower value for faster page loading if you have many errors."
msgstr "限制详细结果中显示的错误数量。如果有很多错误，请设置较低的值以加快页面加载速度。"

msgid "Skip deprecation checks"
msgstr "跳过弃用检查"

msgid "Check this to <strong>ignore</strong> deprecated code detection. <em>Not recommended</em> - deprecation checks help prepare your code for Drupal 11."
msgstr "将此检查到 <strong>ignore</strong> 已弃用的代码检测。 <em>不推荐</em> - 弃用检查有助于为 Drupal 11 准备代码。"

msgid "Skip PHPDoc type inference"
msgstr "跳过 PHPDoc 类型推断"

msgid "Check this to <strong>ignore</strong> @var, @param, and @return annotations. <em>Not recommended</em> - Drupal APIs rely heavily on PHPDoc for type information."
msgstr "将此检查到 <strong>ignore</strong> @var、@param 和 @return 注释。 <em>不推荐</em> - Drupal API 严重依赖 PHPDoc 来获取类型信息。"

msgid "Skip entity type mapping"
msgstr "跳过实体类型映射"

msgid "Check this to <strong>disable</strong> Drupal entity type mapping. <em>Not recommended</em> - entity mapping reduces false positives when working with entities."
msgstr "将此检查为 <strong>disable</strong> Drupal 实体类型映射。 <em>不推荐</em> - 实体映射可减少使用实体时的误报。"

msgid "Ignore Options"
msgstr "忽略选项"

msgid "By default, all recommended analysis features are enabled. Check the options below to <strong>disable</strong> specific features."
msgstr "默认情况下，启用所有推荐的分析功能。检查以下选项以 <strong>disable</strong> 特定功能。"

msgid "Active Entity Type Mappings"
msgstr "活动实体类型映射"

msgid "Custom entity mappings"
msgstr "自定义实体映射"

msgid "Add mappings for custom entity types not listed above. Format: one mapping per line as <code>entity_type_id: Full\\Class\\Name</code>."
msgstr "添加上面未列出的自定义实体类型的映射。格式：每行一个映射为 <code>entity_type_id: Full\\Class\\Name</code>。"

msgid "Entity Type Mapping (Auto-detected)"
msgstr "实体类型映射（自动检测）"

msgid "Entity type mappings are automatically detected based on installed modules. PHPStan will use these mappings to better understand your Drupal code."
msgstr "根据安装的模块自动检测实体类型映射。 PHPStan 将使用这些映射来更好地理解您的 Drupal 代码。"

msgid "Use the PHPStan configuration of each module and theme"
msgstr "使用PHPStan各模块和主题的配置"

msgid "Modules and themes that ship a phpstan.neon or phpstan.neon.dist (as drupal.org GitLab CI uses) are analyzed with it: its level, excludes, ignored errors and baseline. The rest of the code uses the settings of this form."
msgstr "使用 phpstan.neon 或 phpstan.neon.dist（如 drupal.org GitLab CI 使用）来分析模块和主题：其级别、排除、忽略的错误和基线。其余代码使用此表单的设置。"

msgid "Report unmatched ignored errors"
msgstr "报告不匹配的忽略错误"

msgid "When enabled, PHPStan will report if any ignored error patterns no longer match any errors. Useful to keep your ignored errors list clean."
msgstr "启用后，PHPStan 将报告是否有任何忽略的错误模式不再与任何错误匹配。有助于保持忽略的错误列表干净。"

msgid "Error patterns to ignore"
msgstr "要忽略的错误模式"

msgid "Patterns of errors to ignore (one per line). Use regular expressions."
msgstr "要忽略的错误模式（每行一个）。使用正则表达式。"

msgid "This is useful for known false positives or errors you plan to fix later."
msgstr "这对于您计划稍后修复的已知误报或错误非常有用。"

msgid "Paths to exclude are configured globally in the <a href=\":url\">main audit settings</a> (exclude patterns). PHPStan uses the same exclude patterns as all other analyzers."
msgstr "要排除的路径在 <a href=\":url\"> 主审核设置 </a>（排除模式）中全局配置。 PHPStan 使用与所有其他分析器相同的排除模式。"

msgid "Modules to exclude"
msgstr "要排除的模块"

msgid "One module name per line. Excluded modules will not be scanned for tests and will not affect the score. Useful for simple helper modules, themes, or generated code that does not require unit testing."
msgstr "每行一个模块名称。排除的模块不会被扫描进行测试，也不会影响分数。对于不需要单元测试的简单帮助器模块、主题或生成的代码很有用。"

msgid "Trusted roles"
msgstr "值得信赖的角色"

msgid "Select roles that should be considered trusted (administrators). These roles will not be checked for dangerous permissions. Roles marked as \"Administrator role\" in Drupal are pre-selected by default."
msgstr "选择应被视为受信任的角色（管理员）。不会检查这些角色的危险权限。默认情况下，Drupal 中标记为“管理员角色”的角色是预先选择的。"

msgid "Ignore Simple XML Sitemap module check"
msgstr "忽略简单 XML Sitemap 模块检查"

msgid "When enabled, the missing Simple XML Sitemap module will not generate errors or affect the score. Use this for sites that use an alternative sitemap solution or do not need XML sitemaps."
msgstr "启用后，缺少的简单 XML 站点地图模块不会生成错误或影响分数。对于使用替代站点地图解决方案或不需要 XML 站点地图的站点，请使用此选项。"

msgid "Ignore sitemap reference in robots.txt"
msgstr "忽略 robots.txt 中的站点地图引用"

msgid "When enabled, a missing Sitemap directive in robots.txt will not generate warnings or affect the score."
msgstr "启用后，robots.txt 中缺少的 Sitemap 指令不会生成警告或影响分数。"

msgid "Ignore Metatag module check"
msgstr "忽略元标记模块检查"

msgid "When enabled, the missing Metatag module will not generate errors or affect the score. Use this for sites where Metatag is intentionally not installed."
msgstr "启用后，缺少的 Metatag 模块不会生成错误或影响分数。将其用于故意未安装 Metatag 的站点。"

msgid "Ignore Redirect module check"
msgstr "忽略重定向模块检查"

msgid "When enabled, the missing Redirect module will not generate errors or affect the score. Use this for sites that do not need to manage URL redirects."
msgstr "启用后，缺少的重定向模块不会生成错误或影响分数。将其用于不需要管理 URL 重定向的站点。"

msgid "Ignore Pathauto (module and pattern checks)"
msgstr "忽略 Pathauto（模块和模式检查）"

msgid "When enabled, a missing Pathauto module and missing Pathauto patterns will not generate errors or warnings or affect the score for any entity type."
msgstr "启用后，缺失的 Pathauto 模块和缺失的 Pathauto 模式不会生成错误或警告，也不会影响任何实体类型的分数。"

msgid "Ignore Pathauto checks for Content (nodes)"
msgstr "忽略 Pathauto 检查内容（节点）"

msgid "When enabled, missing Pathauto patterns for content types will not affect the score."
msgstr "启用后，缺少内容类型的 Pathauto 模式不会影响分数。"

msgid "Ignore Pathauto checks for Taxonomy terms"
msgstr "忽略 Pathauto 检查分类术语"

msgid "When enabled, missing Pathauto patterns for taxonomy vocabularies will not affect the score."
msgstr "启用后，缺少分类词汇表的 Pathauto 模式不会影响分数。"

msgid "Ignore Pathauto checks for Users"
msgstr "忽略 Pathauto 对用户的检查"

msgid "When enabled, missing Pathauto patterns for user entities will not affect the score."
msgstr "启用后，用户实体缺少 Pathauto 模式不会影响分数。"

msgid "Ignore Pathauto checks for Media"
msgstr "忽略 Pathauto 对媒体的检查"

msgid "When enabled, missing Pathauto patterns for media entities will not affect the score."
msgstr "启用后，媒体实体缺少 Pathauto 模式不会影响分数。"

msgid "Ignore Pathauto by entity type"
msgstr "按实体类型忽略 Pathauto"

msgid "Select specific entity types to exclude from Pathauto pattern checks. Only applies when the global ignore above is disabled."
msgstr "选择要从 Pathauto 模式检查中排除的特定实体类型。仅当禁用上述全局忽略时才适用。"

msgid "Ignore cache bubbling analysis"
msgstr "忽略缓存冒泡分析"

msgid "Skip detection of {{ content }} usage and cache metadata bubbling issues."
msgstr "跳过对 {{ content }} 使用情况和缓存元数据冒泡问题的检测。"

msgid "Ignore anti-patterns analysis"
msgstr "忽略反模式分析"

msgid "Skip detection of performance anti-patterns like drupal_entity(), database queries, etc."
msgstr "跳过性能反模式的检测，如 drupal_entity()、数据库查询等。"

msgid "Ignore field synchronization analysis"
msgstr "忽略场同步分析"

msgid "Skip detection of fields configured in view modes but not used in templates, and vice versa."
msgstr "跳过在视图模式中配置但未在模板中使用的字段的检测，反之亦然。"

msgid "Ignore theme suggestions analysis"
msgstr "忽略主题建议分析"

msgid "Skip listing of theme hook suggestions registered from custom modules and themes."
msgstr "跳过从自定义模块和主题注册的主题挂钩建议的列表。"

msgid "Ignore preprocess anti-patterns analysis"
msgstr "忽略预处理反模式分析"

msgid "Skip detection of drupal_render() and other anti-patterns in preprocess hooks."
msgstr "跳过预处理挂钩中 drupal_render() 和其他反模式的检测。"

msgid "Ignore external libraries analysis"
msgstr "忽略外部库分析"

msgid "Skip detection of external CSS/JS libraries in *.libraries.yml files (CDN, unpkg, etc.)."
msgstr "跳过 *.libraries.yml 文件中外部 CSS/JS 库的检测（CDN、unpkg 等）。"

msgid "Ignore regular updates in scoring"
msgstr "忽略评分的定期更新"

msgid "Only penalize the score for security updates. Regular (non-security) updates will still be reported but won't affect the audit score. Useful for stable projects focused on security maintenance only."
msgstr "仅惩罚安全更新的分数。仍会报告定期（非安全）更新，但不会影响审核分数。对于仅专注于安全维护的稳定项目很有用。"

msgid "Relationships warning threshold"
msgstr "关系警告阈值"

msgid "Number of relationships in a view display above which a performance warning is shown. Views with many relationships can be slow."
msgstr "视图中显示的关系数，其上方显示性能警告。具有许多关系的视图可能会很慢。"

msgid "Exclude disabled views"
msgstr "排除禁用的视图"

msgid "When checked, disabled (archived) views are ignored entirely: they do not affect the score and are not listed. Uncheck to audit them as well; disabled views are then flagged as such in the listings."
msgstr "选中后，禁用（存档）视图将被完全忽略：它们不会影响分数并且不会列出。取消选中也可以对其进行审核；然后，禁用的视图会在列表中进行标记。"

msgid "Views excluded from cache audit"
msgstr "从缓存审核中排除的视图"

msgid "View machine names to exclude from cache-related warnings and scoring (one per line). These views intentionally have no cache configured by design and should not penalize the audit score. Examples: <code>watchdog</code> (real-time logs), <code>redirect_404</code> (404 tracking)."
msgstr "查看要从缓存相关警告和评分中排除的计算机名称（每行一个）。这些视图有意没有按设计配置缓存，因此不应影响审核分数。示例：<code>watchdog</code>（实时日志）、<code>redirect_404</code>（404 跟踪）。"

msgid "Views excluded from anonymous access audit"
msgstr "从匿名访问审核中排除的视图"

msgid "View machine names to exclude from the anonymous access warnings and scoring (one per line), for views whose access is intended or enforced by other means than the view access settings. Example: <code>media_library</code> (its widget routes have their own access check)."
msgstr "对于通过视图访问设置之外的其他方式打算或强制访问的视图，查看要从匿名访问警告和评分（每行一个）中排除的计算机名称。示例：<code>media_library</code>（其小部件路由有自己的访问检查）。"

msgid "Ignored log entries"
msgstr "忽略的日志条目"

msgid "Text fragments, one per line. Log entries whose message or message variables contain one of them are left out of the counts, the score and the listings. Use it for known entries that are not defects of the site, such as <code>Attempting to re-run cron while it is already running</code> (Automated Cron overlapping a running cron) or <code>eval()'d code</code> (errors typed in drush php:eval). The SQL wildcards % and _ are allowed."
msgstr "文本片段，每行一个。消息或消息变量包含其中之一的日志条目将被排除在计数、分数和列表之外。将其用于非站点缺陷的已知条目，例如<code>尝试在运行时重新运行 cron</code>（自动 Cron 与正在运行的 cron 重叠）或<code>eval()'d 代码</code>（在 drush php:eval 中键入的错误）​​。允许使用 SQL 通配符 % 和 _。"

msgid "Audit Submodules Settings"
msgstr "审计子模块设置"

msgid "Settings for each audit submodule. Adjust parameters and enable or disable specific checks."
msgstr "每个审计子模块的设置。调整参数并启用或禁用特定检查。"

msgid "For uptime monitors and load balancers: the endpoint answers <code>200 OK</code> while every enabled check passes and <code>503 FAIL</code> otherwise. It is never cached and only runs checks that cost next to nothing, so it can be polled often."
msgstr "对于正常运行时间监视器和负载平衡器：当每个启用的检查通过时，端点回答 <code>200 OK</code>，否则回答 <code>503 FAIL</code>。它永远不会被缓存，只运行几乎不需要任何成本的检查，因此可以经常轮询它。"

msgid "Endpoint URL"
msgstr "端点 URL"

msgid "Reflects the saved settings. Without the right secret the endpoint answers 404."
msgstr "反映已保存的设置。如果没有正确的秘密，端点将回答 404。"

msgid "Secret"
msgstr "秘密"

msgid "Requests must pass it as <code>?secret=</code>: the endpoint is never public, because its answer tells which checks fail. At least 16 letters, digits, hyphens or underscores."
msgstr "请求必须将其作为 <code>?secret=</code> 传递：端点永远不会公开，因为它的答案会告诉哪些检查失败。至少 16 个字母、数字、连字符或下划线。"

msgid "Minimum score of the Config Checks Audit"
msgstr "配置检查审核的最低分数"

msgid "The check fails when the score of the config checks is lower. 100 fails on any failing or unverifiable check. Leave it empty to leave the audit out."
msgstr "当配置检查的分数较低时，检查失败。 100 因任何失败或无法验证的检查而失败。将其留空以忽略审核。"

msgid "Check that the database answers"
msgstr "检查数据库是否有答案"

msgid "A page can be served from a cache backend such as Redis without the database, so a successful request alone does not prove it works."
msgstr "页面可以在没有数据库的情况下从缓存后端（例如 Redis）提供服务，因此仅成功的请求并不能证明它有效。"

msgid "Maximum hours since the last cron run"
msgstr "自上次 cron 运行以来的最大小时数"

msgid "Leave it empty to leave cron out."
msgstr "将其留空以将 cron 排除在外。"

msgid "Check that the files directories are writable"
msgstr "检查文件目录是否可写"

msgid "The public files directory, and the private one when it is configured."
msgstr "公共文件目录，以及配置后的私有目录。"

msgid "Check that the default cache backend works"
msgstr "检查默认缓存后端是否正常工作"

msgid "Writes a small entry to the default cache bin and reads it back, which detects an unreachable Redis or Memcache server."
msgstr "将一个小条目写入默认缓存箱并将其读回，这会检测到无法访问的 Redis 或 Memcache 服务器。"

msgid "Show the time the answer was generated"
msgstr "显示答案的生成时间"

msgid "Adds the generation time on a second line. If it does not change between requests, a CDN or proxy in front of the site is caching the answer."
msgstr "在第二行添加生成时间。如果它在请求之间没有改变，则站点前面的 CDN 或代理正在缓存答案。"

msgid "Show the result of every check"
msgstr "显示每项检查的结果"

msgid "Adds one line per check with OK or FAIL and a short detail, such as the score of an audit against its minimum, to find out what fails. It never says which setting or module is wrong."
msgstr "在每个检查中添加一行“OK”或“FAIL”以及一个简短的详细信息（例如针对最低审核分数），以找出失败的原因。它永远不会说哪个设置或模块是错误的。"

msgid "Health check endpoint"
msgstr "健康检查端点"

msgid "Connection successful! DruScan API accepted the test data and it is now today's canonical snapshot."
msgstr "连接成功！ DruScan API 接受了测试数据，现在它是今天的规范快照。"

msgid "The secret must be at least 16 letters, digits, hyphens or underscores."
msgstr "密码必须至少包含 16 个字母、数字、连字符或下划线。"

msgid "A key is saved. Leave empty to keep it."
msgstr "已保存密钥。留空以保留它。"

msgid "@m min"
msgstr "@m 分钟"

msgid "@h h @m min"
msgstr "@h 小时 @m 分钟"

msgid "Comparing against snapshot from @age ago. @delta invalidations since then. Snapshot renews in @remaining."
msgstr "与 @age 之前的快照进行比较。自此@delta失效。 @remaining 中的快照更新。"

msgid "Installation Required"
msgstr "需要安装"

msgid "PHPStan is not installed. Follow the steps below to install it."
msgstr "PHPStan 未安装。请按照以下步骤进行安装。"

msgid "1. Install All Recommended Packages"
msgstr "1.安装所有推荐的软件包"

msgid "Install PHPStan with all recommended Drupal extensions in one command:"
msgstr "通过一个命令安装 PHPStan 以及所有推荐的 Drupal 扩展："

msgid "Package Details"
msgstr "套餐详情"

msgid "2. Reload This Page"
msgstr "2. 重新加载此页面"

msgid "After installation, reload this page to run the analysis. All configuration options (analysis level, entity mappings, ignored errors, etc.) can be configured from the <a href=\":settings_url\">Audit settings page</a>."
msgstr "安装后，重新加载此页面以运行分析。所有配置选项（分析级别、实体映射、忽略的错误等）都可以从 <a href=\":settings_url\">Audit 设置页面</a> 进行配置。"

msgid "Shadowed route"
msgstr "阴影路线"

msgid "Pointing to"
msgstr "指向"

msgid "Findings"
msgstr "发现"

msgid "Alias route shadowing"
msgstr "别名路由阴影"

msgid "@desc Weighted at @w% in the analyzer total."
msgstr "@desc 在分析仪总数中的权重为 @w%。"

msgid "Alias paths that collide with a static Drupal route (e.g. an alias on /admin or /user/login). The router resolves the route first, so the alias becomes unreachable and the configured target is effectively orphaned."
msgstr "与静态 Drupal 路由冲突的别名路径（例如 /admin 或 /user/login 上的别名）。路由器首先解析路由，因此别名变得无法访问，并且配置的目标实际上被孤立。"

msgid "Cycles in the redirect graph of up to @n nodes: direct self-redirects (A → A), 2-node loops (A → B → A) and longer cycles. Any cycle traps the browser in an infinite redirect and breaks the affected URL."
msgstr "最多 @n 节点的重定向图中的循环：直接自重定向 (A → A)、2 节点循环 (A → B → A) 和更长的循环。任何循环都会使浏览器陷入无限重定向并破坏受影响的 URL。"

msgid "Redirect broken destinations"
msgstr "重定向损坏的目的地"

msgid "Enabled redirects whose destination cannot be resolved: empty URI, malformed entity reference, target entity that has been deleted, route name that no longer exists, or internal path that matches no Drupal route or alias. Visiting these URLs returns a 404."
msgstr "已启用的重定向，其目标无法解析：空 URI、格式错误的实体引用、已删除的目标实体、不再存在的路由名称或与 Drupal 路由或别名不匹配的内部路径。访问这些 URL 将返回 404。"

msgid "Redirect duplicate sources"
msgstr "重定向重复源"

msgid "A single source path mapped by more than one enabled redirect row. Drupal will use whichever row wins the lookup, leaving the others as silent dead config that is hard to audit and easy to break inadvertently when editing one of them."
msgstr "由多个启用的重定向行映射的单个源路径。 Drupal 将使用赢得查找的行，将其他行保留为静默的死配置，很难审核，并且在编辑其中一个配置时很容易无意中破坏。"

msgid "Two situations are reported here: the same alias mapped to several system paths (navigation roulette — the same URL serves different content depending on which row wins) and the same system path with several alternative aliases (content reachable from multiple URLs, which dilutes SEO and confuses link sharing)."
msgstr "这里报告了两种情况：相同的别名映射到多个系统路径（导航轮盘赌 - 相同的 URL 根据获胜的行提供不同的内容）和具有多个替代别名的相同系统路径（可从多个 URL 访问内容，这会削弱 SEO 并混淆链接共享）。"

msgid "Alias broken targets"
msgstr "为损坏的目标指定别名"

msgid "Aliases whose system path points to an entity that no longer exists (stale aliases left behind after the original node, term or user was deleted). Unpublished entities are intentionally NOT flagged: an alias may legitimately stay attached to an unpublished entity."
msgstr "系统路径指向不再存在的实体的别名（原始节点、术语或用户被删除后留下的过时别名）。未发布的实体故意不被标记：别名可以合法地保持附加到未发布的实体。"

msgid "Alias formatting issues"
msgstr "别名格式问题"

msgid "Aliases with structural problems: empty, missing the leading slash, containing consecutive slashes (//) or exceeding a reasonable length. These typically indicate Pathauto patterns with empty tokens or malformed aliases entered manually."
msgstr "存在结构问题的别名：空、缺少前导斜杠、包含连续斜杠 (//) 或超过合理长度。这些通常表示带有空标记或手动输入的格式错误的别名的 Pathauto 模式。"

msgid "Alias / redirect conflicts"
msgstr "别名/重定向冲突"

msgid "Paths that exist both as a redirect source and as a path alias in overlapping languages (the same language, or either one language-neutral). The alias wins and the redirect never fires; this hides bugs because deleting the wrong one looks harmless until the surviving rule is changed. A redirect to the same target as the alias is only reported as a notice and does not lower the score."
msgstr "在重叠语言（相同语言或一种中立语言）中既作为重定向源又作为路径别名存在的路径。别名获胜并且重定向永远不会触发；这隐藏了错误，因为删除错误的规则看起来是无害的，直到现存规则被更改为止。重定向到与别名相同的目标只会报告为通知，不会降低分数。"

msgid "Combined view of all URL checks with totals and per-check scores."
msgstr "所有 URL 检查的综合视图以及总计和每次检查分数。"

msgid "No redirect loops detected."
msgstr "未检测到重定向循环。"

msgid "No broken redirect destinations detected."
msgstr "未检测到损坏的重定向目标。"

msgid "No duplicate redirect sources detected."
msgstr "未检测到重复的重定向源。"

msgid "No alias duplicates detected."
msgstr "未检测到别名重复。"

msgid "No aliases pointing to deleted entities."
msgstr "没有别名指向已删除的实体。"

msgid "No alias formatting issues detected."
msgstr "未检测到别名格式问题。"

msgid "No paths exist as both a redirect source and a path alias."
msgstr "不存在同时作为重定向源和路径别名的路径。"

msgid "Detected modules: redirect=@r, path_alias=@a."
msgstr "检测到的模块：redirect=@r、path_alias=@a。"

msgid "Analyzed @r redirects and @a aliases."
msgstr "分析了 @r 重定向和 @a 别名。"

msgid "No cache backend issues detected."
msgstr "未检测到缓存后端问题。"

msgid "No issues found."
msgstr "没有发现问题。"

msgid "No cache bin issues detected."
msgstr "未检测到缓存箱问题。"

msgid "No cache tag issues detected."
msgstr "未检测到缓存标记问题。"

msgid "Cache Bin"
msgstr "缓存仓"

msgid "Traffic"
msgstr "交通"

msgid "Needs fast backend"
msgstr "需要快速的后端"

msgid "Default Backend"
msgstr "默认后端"

msgid "Consider Redis or Memcache"
msgstr "考虑 Redis 或 Memcache"

msgid "Fast Backend Module"
msgstr "快速后端模块"

msgid "Install Redis or Memcache"
msgstr "安装 Redis 或 Memcache"

msgid "Page Cache Max-Age"
msgstr "页面缓存最大期限"

msgid "@count unique tags, @total total invalidations."
msgstr "@count 唯一标签，@total 全部失效。"

msgid "Comparison period:"
msgstr "比较期："

msgid "Activity:"
msgstr "活动："

msgid "@delta invalidations (@freq/hour)"
msgstr "@delta 失效（@freq/小时）"

msgid "Hover over column headers for detailed explanations. Tags with entity IDs (node:42, user:1) are excluded to keep the table manageable."
msgstr "将鼠标悬停在列标题上可获取详细说明。具有实体 ID（节点：42、用户：1）的标签被排除，以保持表的可管理性。"

msgid "Invalidations by tag type"
msgstr "按标签类型失效"

msgid "Groups tags by category to identify which area of the site generates the most cache clearing activity."
msgstr "按类别对标签进行分组，以确定站点的哪个区域产生最多的缓存清除活动。"

msgid "Classification of the cache tag: Configuration, Entity list, Routing, etc."
msgstr "缓存标签的分类：配置、实体列表、路由等。"

msgid "Number of distinct cache tags in this category."
msgstr "此类别中不同缓存标签的数量。"

msgid "Sum of all invalidations since the last drush cr (cache rebuild). Higher values indicate more cache clearing activity."
msgstr "自上次 drush cr（缓存重建）以来所有失效的总和。值越高表示缓存清除活动越多。"

msgid "Where the tag data was read from: Redis, Database, or Database (stale) for residual data from an inactive backend."
msgstr "标签数据的读取位置：Redis、数据库或来自不活动后端的残留数据的数据库（陈旧）。"

msgid "Tag type"
msgstr "标签类型"

msgid "Tag count"
msgstr "标签计数"

msgid "Total inv."
msgstr "总投资额"

msgid "Invalidations that occurred since the reference snapshot."
msgstr "自参考快照以来发生的失效。"

msgid "Since snapshot"
msgstr "自快照以来"

msgid "Cache tag detail (@sort)"
msgstr "缓存标签详细信息 (@sort)"

msgid "sorted by recent activity"
msgstr "按最近活动排序"

msgid "Each row is one cache tag. Tags that invalidate frequently force Drupal to rebuild cached pages more often, reducing performance."
msgstr "每一行都是一个缓存标签。频繁失效的标签会迫使 Drupal 更频繁地重建缓存页面，从而降低性能。"

msgid "The cache tag identifier as used by Drupal. Entity-specific tags (node:42, user:1) are excluded."
msgstr "Drupal 使用的缓存标记标识符。排除特定于实体的标签（节点：42，用户：1）。"

msgid "Category: Configuration, Entity list, Routing, Module/custom, etc."
msgstr "类别：配置、实体列表、路由、模块/自定义等。"

msgid "Total invalidations since the last full cache rebuild (drush cr). This counter never resets on its own."
msgstr "自上次完全缓存重建 (drush cr) 以来的失效总数。该计数器永远不会自行重置。"

msgid "Backend where this tag data was read from. \"Database (stale)\" means the tag exists in MySQL but the active backend is Redis or Memcache — the data is likely outdated."
msgstr "读取此标签数据的后端。 “数据库（过时）”意味着标签存在于 MySQL 中，但活动后端是 Redis 或 Memcache — 数据可能已过时。"

msgid "Invalidations since the reference snapshot. Compares the current value against the stored copy."
msgstr "自参考快照以来失效。将当前值与存储的副本进行比较。"

msgid "Average invalidations per hour during the comparison period. Values above 10/h deserve attention; above 100/h indicate a problem."
