msgid "Package Manager is a framework for updating Drupal core and installing contributed modules and themes via Composer. It has no user interface, but it provides an API for creating a temporary copy of the current site, making changes to the copy, and then syncing those changes back into the live site."
msgstr "Package Manager 是一个用于更新 Drupal 核心并通过 Composer 安装贡献的模块和主题的框架。它没有用户界面，但提供了一个 API，用于创建当前站点的临时副本、对副本进行更改，然后将这些更改同步回实时站点。"

msgid "Package Manager dispatches events before and after various operations, and external code can integrate with it by subscribing to those events. For more information, see <code>package_manager.api.php</code>."
msgstr "包管理器在各种操作之前和之后调度事件，外部代码可以通过订阅这些事件来与其集成。有关更多信息，请参阅<code>package_manager.api.php</code>。"

msgid "Modules cannot be uninstalled while Package Manager is applying staged changes to the active code base."
msgstr "当包管理器正在对活动代码库应用分阶段更改时，无法卸载模块。"

msgid "Enable form description toggle"
msgstr "启用表单描述切换"

msgid "Drupal multisite is not supported by Package Manager."
msgstr "包管理器不支持 Drupal 多站点。"

msgid "Cannot update because the following project version is not in the list of installable releases."
msgid_plural "Cannot update because the following project versions are not in the list of installable releases."
msgstr[0] "无法更新，因为以下项目版本不在可安装版本列表中。"
msgstr[1] "无法更新，因为以下项目版本不在可安装版本列表中。"

msgid "Xdebug is enabled, which may have a negative performance impact on Package Manager and any modules that use it."
msgstr "Xdebug 已启用，这可能会对程序包管理器和使用它的任何模块产生负面性能影响。"

msgid "@title <span class=\"page-title__language\">(@language translation)</span>"
msgstr "@title <span class=\"page-title__language\">(@language翻译)</span>"

msgid "Allowed entity types"
msgstr "允许的实体类型"

msgid "Layout density"
msgstr "布局密度"

msgid "Changes the layout density for tables in the admin interface."
msgstr "更改管理界面中表格的布局密度。"

msgid "The <code>update_fetch_with_http_fallback</code> setting must be disabled."
msgstr "必须禁用 <code>update_fetch_with_http_fallback</code> 设置。"

msgid "The Drupal application's codebase must be writable in order to use Automatic Updates. This includes Drupal core, modules, themes and the Composer dependencies in the <code>vendor</code> directory. This makes Automatic Updates incompatible with some hosting platforms."
msgstr "Drupal 应用程序的代码库必须可写才能使用自动更新。这包括 <code>vendor</code> 目录中的 Drupal 核心、模块、主题和 Composer 依赖项。这使得自动更新与某些托管平台不兼容。"

msgid "Because Package Manager modifies the current site's code base, it is intentionally limited in certain ways to prevent unexpected changes to the live site:"
msgstr "由于包管理器会修改当前站点的代码库，因此有意在某些方面进行限制，以防止对实时站点进行意外更改："

msgid "It does not support Drupal multi-site installations."
msgstr "它不支持 Drupal 多站点安装。"

msgid "It does not automatically perform version control operations, e.g., with Git. Site administrators are responsible for committing updates."
msgstr "它不会自动执行版本控制操作，例如使用 Git。站点管理员负责提交更新。"

msgid "It can only maintain one copy of the site at any given time. If a copy of the site already exists, another one cannot be created until the existing copy is destroyed."
msgstr "它在任何给定时间只能维护网站的一份副本。如果该站点的副本已存在，则在销毁现有副本之前无法创建另一个站点。"

msgid "It associates the temporary copy of the site with the user or session that originally created it, and only that user or session can make changes to it."
msgstr "它将站点的临时副本与最初创建它的用户或会话相关联，并且只有该用户或会话可以对其进行更改。"

msgid "It does not allow modules to be uninstalled while syncing changes into live site."
msgstr "它不允许在将更改同步到实时站点时卸载模块。"

msgid "The new package @package will be installed in the directory @path, which already exists but is not managed by Composer."
msgstr "新软件包 @package 将安装在目录 @path 中，该目录已存在但不受 Composer 管理。"

msgid "@message See <a href=\":package-manager-help\">the help page</a> for information on how to resolve the problem."
msgstr "@message 有关如何解决问题的信息，请参阅 <a href=\":package-manager-help\"> 帮助页面 </a>。"

msgid "Staged changes failed to apply, and the site is in an indeterminate state. It is strongly recommended to restore the code and database from a backup."
msgstr "分阶段更改无法应用，站点处于不确定状态。强烈建议从备份中恢复代码和数据库。"

msgid "Post-apply tasks are running in the same request during which staged changes were applied to the active code base. This can result in unpredictable behavior."
msgstr "应用后任务在同一请求中运行，在此期间将分阶段更改应用于活动代码库。这可能会导致不可预测的行为。"

msgid "Package Manager is not supported by your environment."
msgstr "您的环境不支持包管理器。"

msgid "API module providing functionality to stage package installs and updates with Composer."
msgstr "API 模块提供使用 Composer 暂存包安装和更新的功能。"

msgid "There is not enough disk space to create a stage directory."
msgstr "没有足够的磁盘空间来创建阶段目录。"

msgid "The stage directory has @stage_count instances of @stage_info_file as compared to @active_count in the active directory. This likely indicates that a duplicate extension was installed."
msgstr "与活动目录中的 @active_count 相比，阶段目录具有 @stage_info_file 的 @stage_count 实例。这可能表明安装了重复的扩展。"

msgid "The stage directory has @stage_count instances of @stage_info_file. This likely indicates that a duplicate extension was installed."
msgstr "阶段目录包含 @stage_info_file 的 @stage_count 实例。这可能表明安装了重复的扩展。"

msgid "The stage root directory \"@dir\" is not writable."
msgstr "阶段根目录“@dir”不可写。"

msgid "It only allows supported Composer plugins. If you have any, see <a href=\"#package-manager-faq-unsupported-composer-plugin\">What if it says I have unsupported Composer plugins in my codebase?</a>."
msgstr "它只允许支持的 Composer 插件。如果有的话，请参阅 <a href=\"#package-manager-faq-unsupported-composer-plugin\"> 如果它说我的代码库中有不受支持的 Composer 插件怎么办？</a>。"

msgid "What if it says I have unsupported Composer plugins in my codebase?"
msgstr "如果它说我的代码库中有不受支持的 Composer 插件怎么办？"

msgid "It is possible to <em>trust</em> additional Composer plugins, but this requires significant expertise: understanding the code of that Composer plugin, what the effects on the file system are and how it affects the Package Manager module. Some Composer plugins could result in a broken site!"
msgstr "<em>trust</em> 可以使用其他 Composer 插件，但这需要大量的专业知识：了解 Composer 插件的代码、对文件系统的影响以及它如何影响包管理器模块。某些 Composer 插件可能会导致网站损坏！"

msgid "What if it says <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> cannot be installed/removed?"
msgstr "如果提示无法安装/删除<code>cweagans/composer-patches</code>怎么办？"

msgid "To install it:"
msgstr "要安装它："

msgid "To remove it:"
msgstr "要删除它："

