msgid "The following core software modules and mechanisms can improve your site's performance:"
msgstr "以下核心软件模块和机制可以提高站点的性能："

msgid "The following administrative interface components are provided by the core software and its modules (some contributed modules offer additional functionality):"
msgstr "以下管理界面组件由核心软件及其模块提供（一些贡献的模块提供附加功能）："

msgid "The following core software modules provide web services:"
msgstr "以下核心软件模块提供Web服务："

msgid "Provides a way for web services to be authenticated using HTTP Basic authentication against site user accounts."
msgstr "提供一种使用 HTTP 基本身份验证针对站点用户帐户对 Web 服务进行身份验证的方法。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>@extend_link</em>. Verify that the Search, Help, and Block modules are installed (or install them if they are not already installed)."
msgstr "在 <em>Manage</em> 管理菜单中，导航到 <em>@extend_link</em>。验证搜索、帮助和阻止模块是否已安装（如果尚未安装，则安装它们）。"

msgid "What is a help topic?"
msgstr "什么是帮助主题？"

msgid "A help topic describes a concept, or steps to accomplish a task, related to a feature provided by one or more modules or themes. If the core Search module is enabled, these topics are also searchable."
msgstr "帮助主题描述与一个或多个模块或主题提供的功能相关的概念或完成任务的步骤。如果启用了核心搜索模块，则也可以搜索这些主题。"

msgid "Where are help topics listed?"
msgstr "帮助主题在哪里列出？"

msgid "The top-level help topics are listed at @help_link. Links to other topics, including non-top-level help topics, can be found under the \"Related\" heading when viewing a topic page."
msgstr "@help_link 列出了顶级帮助主题。查看主题页面时，可以在“相关”标题下找到其他主题（包括非顶级帮助主题）的链接。"

msgid "How are help topics provided?"
msgstr "如何提供帮助主题？"

msgid "Modules and themes can provide help topics as Twig-file-based plugins in a project sub-directory called <em>help_topics</em>; plugin metadata is provided in YAML front matter within each Twig file. Plugin-based help topics provided by modules and themes will automatically be updated when a module or theme is updated. Use the plugins in <em>core/modules/help/help_topics</em> as a guide when writing and formatting a help topic plugin for your theme or module."
msgstr "模块和主题可以在名为 <em>help_topics</em> 的项目子目录中以基于 Twig 文件的插件形式提供帮助主题；插件元数据在每个 Twig 文件中的 YAML 前面内容中提供。当模块或主题更新时，模块和主题提供的基于插件的帮助主题将自动更新。在为您的主题或模块编写和格式化帮助主题插件时，请使用 core/modules/help/help_topics 中的插件作为指南。"

msgid "How are help topics translated?"
msgstr "帮助主题是如何翻译的？"

msgid "The title and body text of help topics provided by contributed modules and themes are translatable using @translate_link (provided by Interface Translation module). Topics provided by custom modules and themes are also translatable if they have been viewed at least once in a non-English language, which triggers putting their translatable text into the translation database."
msgstr "贡献的模块和主题提供的帮助主题的标题和正文可以使用 @translate_link（由界面翻译模块提供）进行翻译。如果自定义模块和主题提供的主题至少以非英语语言查看过一次，那么它们也是可翻译的，这会触发将其可翻译文本放入翻译数据库。"

msgid "How can users search for help topics?"
msgstr "用户如何搜索帮助主题？"

msgid "To enable users to search help, including help topics, you will need to install the core Search module, configure a search page, and add a search block to the Help page or another administrative page. (A search page is provided automatically, and if you use the core Claro administrative theme, a help search block is shown on the main Help page.) Then users with search permissions, and permission to view help, will be able to search help. See the related topic, @help_search_topic, for step-by-step instructions."
msgstr "要使用户能够搜索帮助（包括帮助主题），您需要安装核心搜索模块，配置搜索页面，并将搜索区块添加到帮助页面或其他管理页面。 （系统会自动提供搜索页面，如果您使用核心 Claro 管理主题，则帮助主页面上会显示帮助搜索区块。）然后，具有搜索权限和查看帮助权限的用户将能够搜索帮助。有关分步说明，请参阅相关主题 @help_search_topic。"

msgid "Help Topics Standards"
msgstr "帮助主题 标准"

msgid "There are currently @total items selected. The maximum number of items for the field is @max. Remove @count item from the selection."
msgid_plural "There are currently @total items selected. The maximum number of items for the field is @max. Remove @count items from the selection."
