msgid "CKEditor 5 has to be installed and configured separately for individual text formats from the <a href=\":formats\">Text formats and editors page</a> because the filter settings for each text format can be different. For more information, see the <a href=\":text_editor\">Text Editor help page</a> and <a href=\":filter\">Filter help page</a>."
msgstr "必须针对 <a href=\":formats\"> 文本格式和编辑器页面 </a> 中的各个文本格式单独安装和配置 CKEditor 5，因为每种文本格式的过滤器设置可能不同。有关更多信息，请参阅<a href=\":text_editor\">文本编辑器帮助页面</a>和<a href=\":filter\">过滤器帮助页面</a>。"

msgid "Comment functionality can be enabled for any entity sub-type (for example, a <a href=\":content-type\">content type</a>) by adding a <em>Comments</em> field on its <em>Manage fields page</em>. Adding or removing commenting for an entity through the user interface requires the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI</a> module to be installed, even though the commenting functionality works without it. For more information on fields and entities, see the <a href=\":field\">Field module help page</a>."
msgstr "通过在<em>管理字段页面</em>上添加<em>评论</em>字段，可以为任何实体子类型（例如<a href=\":content-type\">内容类型</a>）启用评论功能。通过用户界面添加或删除实体的注释需要安装 <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI</a> 模块，即使注释功能在没有它的情况下也能工作。有关字段和实体的更多信息，请参阅<a href=\":field\">字段模块帮助页面</a>。"

msgid "Commenting settings can be configured by editing the <em>Comments</em> field on the <em>Manage fields page</em> of an entity type if the <em>Field UI module</em> is installed. Configuration includes the label of the comments field, the number of comments to be displayed, and whether they are shown in threaded list. Commenting can be configured as: <em>Open</em> to allow new comments, <em>Closed</em> to view existing comments, but prevent new comments, or <em>Hidden</em> to hide existing comments and prevent new comments. Changing this configuration for an entity type will not change existing entity items."
msgstr "如果安装了<em>字段 UI 模块</em>，则可以通过编辑实体类型的<em>管理字段页面</em>上的<em>注释</em>字段来配置注释设置。配置包括评论字段的标签、要显示的评论数量以及是否在线索列表中显示。评论可以配置为：<em>打开</em>以允许新评论，<em>关闭</em>以查看现有评论，但阻止新评论，或<em>隐藏</em>以隐藏现有评论并阻止新评论。更改实体类型的此配置不会更改现有实体项。"

msgid "The Field module provides the infrastructure for fields; the field types, formatters, and widgets are provided by Drupal core or additional modules. Some of the modules are required; the optional modules can be installed from the <a href=\":modules\">Extend administration page</a>. Additional fields, formatters, and widgets may be provided by contributed modules, which you can find in the <a href=\":contrib\">contributed module section of Drupal.org</a>."
msgstr "Field模块提供了field的基础设施；字段类型、格式化程序和小部件由 Drupal 核心或附加模块提供。有些模块是必需的；可选模块可以从 <a href=\":modules\">Extend 管理页面</a> 安装。其他字段、格式化程序和小部件可能由贡献模块提供，您可以在 Drupal.org</a> 的 <a href=\":contrib\"> 贡献模块部分中找到这些模块。"

msgid "Here is a list of the currently installed field, formatter, and widget modules:"
msgstr "以下是当前安装的字段、格式化程序和小部件模块的列表："

msgid "The Field UI module provides an administrative user interface (UI) for managing and displaying fields. Fields can be attached to most content entity sub-types. Different field types, widgets, and formatters are provided by the modules installed on your site, and managed by the Field module. For background information and terminology related to fields and entities, see the <a href=\":field\">Field module help page</a>. For more information about the Field UI, see the <a href=\":field_ui_docs\">online documentation for the Field UI module</a>."
msgstr "字段 UI 模块提供用于管理和显示字段的管理用户界面 (UI)。字段可以附加到大多数内容实体子类型。不同的字段类型、小部件和格式化程序由站点上安装的模块提供，并由字段模块管理。有关与字段和实体相关的背景信息和术语，请参阅<a href=\":field\">Field 模块帮助页面</a>。有关 Field UI 的更多信息，请参阅 Field UI 模块</a> 的 <a href=\":field_ui_docs\"> 在线文档。"

msgid "There are two reports available that list the fields defined on your site. The <a href=\":entity-list\" title=\"Entities field list report\">Entities</a> report lists all your fields, showing the field machine names, types, and the entity types or sub-types they are used on (each sub-type links to the Manage fields page). If the <a href=\":views\">Views</a> and <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI</a> modules are installed, the <a href=\":views-list\" title=\"Used in views field list report\">Used in views</a> report lists each field that is used in a view, with a link to edit that view."
msgstr "有两个可用的报告列出了您站点上定义的字段。 <a href=\":entity-list\" title=\"Entities field list report\">Entities</a> 报告列出了所有字段，显示字段计算机名称、类型以及它们所使用的实体类型或子类型（每个子类型链接到“管理字段”页面）。如果安装了 <a href=\":views\">Views</a> 和 <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI</a> 模块，则视图中的 <a href=\":views-list\" title=\"Used in views field list report\">Used</a> 报告会列出视图中使用的每个字段，以及用于编辑该视图的链接。"

msgid "You can create and edit text formats on the <a href=\":formats\">Text formats page</a> (if the Text Editor module is installed, this page is named Text formats and editors). One text format is included by default: Plain text (which removes all HTML tags). Additional text formats may be created during installation. You can create a text format by clicking \"<a href=\":add_format\">Add text format</a>\"."
msgstr "您可以在 <a href=\":formats\"> 文本格式页面 </a> 上创建和编辑文本格式（如果安装了文本编辑器模块，则此页面名为文本格式和编辑器）。默认情况下包含一种文本格式：纯文本（删除所有 HTML 标签）。在安装过程中可能会创建其他文本格式。您可以通过单击“<a href=\":add_format\">添加文本格式</a>”来创建文本格式。"

msgid "Help topics provided by modules and themes are also part of the Help module. If the core Search module is installed, these topics are searchable. For more information, see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation, Help Topic Standards</a>."
msgstr "模块和主题提供的帮助主题也是帮助模块的一部分。如果安装了核心搜索模块，则可以搜索这些主题。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\":online\"> 在线文档帮助主题 Standards</a>。"

msgid "A few of the settings for image fields are defined once when you create the field and cannot be changed later; these include the choice of public or private file storage and the number of images that can be stored in the field. The rest of the settings can be edited later; these settings include the field label, help text, allowed file extensions, image dimensions restrictions, and the subdirectory in the public or private file storage where the images will be stored. The editable settings can also have different values for different entity sub-types; for instance, if your image field is used on both Page and Article content types, you can store the files in a different subdirectory for the two content types."
msgstr "图像字段的一些设置在创建字段时定义一次，以后无法更改；其中包括公共或私人文件存储的选择以及可以在现场存储的图像数量。其余设置可以稍后编辑；这些设置包括字段标签、帮助文本、允许的文件扩展名、图像尺寸限制以及公共或私有文件存储中将存储图像的子目录。对于不同的实体子类型，可编辑设置还可以具有不同的值；例如，如果您的图像字段同时用于页面和文章内容类型，您可以将文件存储在这两种内容类型的不同子目录中。"

msgid "You can also configure a minimum and/or maximum dimensions for uploaded images. Images that are too small will be rejected. Images that are to large will be resized. During the resizing the <a href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchangeable_image_file_format\">EXIF data</a> in the image will be lost."
msgstr "您还可以配置上传图像的最小和/或最大尺寸。太小的图像将被拒绝。太大的图像将被调整大小。在调整大小期间，图像中的 <a href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchangeable_image_file_format\">EXIF 数据 </a> 将丢失。"

msgid "The Language module allows you to configure the languages used on your site, and provides information for the <a href=\":content\">Content Translation</a>, <a href=\":interface\">Interface Translation</a>, and <a href=\":configuration\">Configuration Translation</a> modules, if they are installed. For more information, see the <a href=\":doc_url\">online documentation for the Language module</a>."
msgstr "语言模块允许您配置网站上使用的语言，并提供<a href=\":content\">内容翻译</a>、<a href=\":interface\">界面翻译</a>和<a href=\":configuration\">配置翻译</a>模块（如果已安装）的信息。有关详细信息，请参阅<a href=\":doc_url\">语言模块的在线文档</a>。"

msgid "You can add languages on the <a href=\":language_list\">Languages</a> page by selecting <em>Add language</em> and choosing a language from the drop-down menu. This language is then displayed in the languages list, where it can be configured further. If the <a href=\":interface\">Interface translation module</a> is installed, and the <em>translation server</em> is set as a translation source, then the interface translation for this language is automatically downloaded as well."
msgstr "您可以通过选择“<em>添加语言</em>”并从下拉菜单中选择一种语言，在“<a href=\":language_list\">Languages</a>”页面上添加语言。然后，该语言将显示在语言列表中，您可以在其中进一步配置。如果安装了<a href=\":interface\">界面翻译模块</a>，并将<em>翻译服务器</em>设置为翻译源，则也会自动下载该语言的界面翻译。"

msgid "If the Block module is installed, then you can add a language switcher block on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout</a> page to allow users to switch between languages."
msgstr "如果安装了Block模块，那么您可以在<a href=\":blocks\">Block布局</a>页面上添加语言切换器区块，以允许用户在语言之间切换。"

msgid "If the Block module is installed, then the Language module allows you to set the visibility of a block based on selected languages on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout</a> page."
msgstr "如果安装了区块模块，则语言模块允许您根据 <a href=\":blocks\">Block 布局 </a> 页面上选定的语言设置区块的可见性。"

msgid "Translation files with translated interface text are imported automatically when languages are added on the <a href=\":languages\">Languages</a> page, or when modules or themes are installed. On the <a href=\":locale-settings\">Interface translation settings</a> page, the <em>Translation source</em> can be restricted to local files only, or to include the <a href=\":server\">Drupal translation server</a>. Although modules and themes may not be fully translated in all languages, new translations become available frequently. You can specify whether and how often to check for translation file updates and whether to overwrite existing translations on the <a href=\":locale-settings\">Interface translation settings</a> page. You can also manually import a translation file on the <a href=\":import\">Interface translation import</a> page."
msgstr "当在 <a href=\":languages\">Languages</a> 页面上添加语言或安装模块或主题时，会自动导入带有翻译界面文本的翻译文件。在<a href=\":locale-settings\">接口翻译设置</a>页面上，<em>翻译源</em>可以仅限于本地文件，或者包括<a href=\":server\">Drupal翻译服务器</a>。尽管模块和主题可能无法完全翻译成所有语言，但经常会出现新的翻译。您可以在<a href=\":locale-settings\">接口翻译设置</a>页面上指定是否以及检查翻译文件更新的频率以及是否覆盖现有翻译。您还可以在<a href=\":import\">接口翻译导入</a>页面手动导入翻译文件。"

msgid "Translation files are automatically downloaded and imported when <a title=\"Languages\" href=\":language\">languages</a> are added, or when modules or themes are installed."
msgstr "添加 <a title=\"Languages\" href=\":language\">languages</a> 或安装模块或主题时，会自动下载并导入翻译文件。"

msgid "For more information, see the <a href=\":drupal-org-help\">online documentation for the Custom Menu Links module</a>. If you install the Menu UI module, it provides an interface for managing menus and menu links."
msgstr "有关详细信息，请参阅自定义菜单链接模块</a> 的 <a href=\":drupal-org-help\"> 在线文档。如果安装Menu UI模块，它会提供一个用于管理菜单和菜单链接的界面。"

msgid "If you have the Block module installed, then each menu that you create is rendered in a block that you enable and position on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>. In some <a href=\":themes\">themes</a>, the main menu and possibly the secondary menu will be output automatically; you may be able to disable this behavior on the <a href=\":themes\">theme's settings page</a>."
msgstr "如果您安装了区块模块，则您创建的每个菜单都会呈现在您启用并放置在 <a href=\":blocks\"> 区块布局页面 </a> 上的区块中。在某些<a href=\":themes\">themes</a>中，会自动输出主菜单和可能的二级菜单；您可以在 <a href=\":themes\"> 主题的设置页面 </a> 上禁用此行为。"

msgid "You need to install all modules on this site that are installed on the previous site. For example, if you have used the Book module on the previous site then you must install the Book module on this site for that data to be available on this site."
msgstr "您需要在此站点上安装先前站点上安装的所有模块。例如，如果您在之前的站点上使用过 Book 模块，则必须在此站点上安装 Book 模块，才能使该数据在此站点上可用。"

msgid "The RESTful Web Services module provides a framework for exposing REST resources on your site. It provides support for content entity types such as the main site content, comments, content blocks, taxonomy terms, and user accounts, etc. (see the <a href=\":field\">Field module help page</a> for more information about entities). REST support for content items of the Node module is installed by default, and support for other types of content entities can be enabled. Other modules may add support for other types of REST resources. For more information, see the <a href=\":rest\">online documentation for the RESTful Web Services module</a>."
msgstr "RESTful Web 服务模块提供了一个用于在站点上公开 REST 资源的框架。它提供对内容实体类型的支持，例如主站点内容、评论、内容区块、分类术语和用户帐户等（有关实体的更多信息，请参阅<a href=\":field\">字段模块帮助页面</a>）。默认情况下安装对 Node 模块内容项的 REST 支持，并且可以启用对其他类型内容实体的支持。其他模块可能会添加对其他类型的 REST 资源的支持。有关详细信息，请参阅<a href=\":rest\">RESTful Web 服务模块的在线文档</a>。"

msgid "Modules providing search page plugins generally ensure that content-related actions on your site (creating, editing, or deleting content and comments) automatically cause affected content items to be marked for indexing or reindexing at the next cron run. When content is marked for reindexing, the previous content remains in the index until cron runs, at which time it is replaced by the new content. However, there are some actions related to the structure of your site that do not cause affected content to be marked for reindexing. Examples of structure-related actions that affect content include deleting or editing taxonomy terms, installing or uninstalling modules that add text to content (such as Taxonomy, Comment, and field-providing modules), and modifying the fields or display parameters of your content types. If you take one of these actions and you want to ensure that the search index is updated to reflect your changed site structure, you can mark all content for reindexing by clicking the \"Re-index site\" button on the <a href=\":search-settings\">Search pages page</a>. If you have a lot of content on your site, it may take several cron runs for the content to be reindexed."
msgstr "提供搜索页面插件的模块通常可确保站点上与内容相关的操作（创建、编辑或删除内容和评论）自动导致受影响的内容项在下一次 cron 运行时被标记为索引或重新索引。当内容被标记为重新索引时，以前的内容将保留在索引中，直到 cron 运行，此时它会被新内容替换。但是，有一些与站点结构相关的操作不会导致受影响的内容被标记为重新索引。影响内容的结构相关操作的示例包括删除或编辑分类术语、安装或卸载向内容添加文本的模块（例如分类、注释和提供字段的模块）以及修改内容类型的字段或显示参数。如果您采取其中一项操作，并且希望确保更新搜索索引以反映更改后的网站结构，则可以通过单击 <a href=\":search-settings\"> 搜索页面 page</a> 上的“重新索引网站”按钮来标记要重新索引的所有内容。如果您的网站上有大量内容，可能需要运行几次 cron 才能对内容重新建立索引。"

msgid "The Search module includes a block, which can be enabled and configured on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>, if you have the Block module installed; the default block title is Search, and it is the Search form block in the Forms category, if you wish to add another instance. The block is available to users with the <a href=\":search_permission\">Use search</a> permission, and it performs a search using the configured default search page."
msgstr "搜索模块包含一个区块，如果您安装了区块模块，则可以在 <a href=\":blocks\"> 区块布局页面 </a> 上启用和配置该区块；默认区块标题是“搜索”，如果您想添加另一个实例，则它是“表单”类别中的“搜索”表单区块。具有 <a href=\":search_permission\">Use search</a> 权限的用户可以使用该区块，并使用配置的默认搜索页面执行搜索。"

msgid "The installed version of at least one of your modules or themes has been revoked and is no longer available for download. Upgrading or uninstalling is strongly recommended!"
msgstr "您的至少一个模块或主题的已安装版本已被撤销，并且不再可供下载。强烈建议升级或卸载！"

msgid "The installed version of at least one of your modules or themes is no longer supported. Upgrading or uninstalling is strongly recommended. See the project homepage for more details."
msgstr "不再支持至少一个模块或主题的已安装版本。强烈建议升级或卸载。请参阅项目主页了解更多详细信息。"

msgid "<em>Roles</em> are used to group and classify users; each user can be assigned one or more roles. Typically there are two pre-defined roles: <em>Anonymous user</em> (users that are not logged in), and <em>Authenticated user</em> (users that are registered and logged in). Depending on how your site was set up, an <em>Administrator</em> role may also be available: users with this role will automatically be assigned any new permissions whenever a module is installed. You can create additional roles on the <a href=\":roles\">Roles administration page</a>."
msgstr "<em>角色</em>用于对用户进行分组和分类；每个用户可以被分配一个或多个角色。通常有两个预定义的角色：<em>匿名用户</em>（未登录的用户）和<em>经过身份验证的用户</em>（注册并登录的用户）。根据站点的设置方式，管理员角色也可能可用：每当安装模块时，具有此角色的用户将自动分配任何新权限。您可以在<a href=\":roles\">角色管理页面</a>上创建其他角色。"

msgid "The <a href=\":accounts\">Account settings page</a> allows you to manage settings for the displayed name of the Anonymous user role, personal contact forms, user registration settings, and account cancellation settings. On this page you can also manage settings for account personalization, and adapt the text for the email messages that users receive when they register or request a password recovery. You may also set which role is automatically assigned new permissions whenever a module is installed (the Administrator role)."
msgstr "<a href=\":accounts\"> 帐户设置页面</a> 允许您管理匿名用户角色的显示名称、个人联系表单、用户注册设置和帐户取消设置的设置。在此页面上，您还可以管理帐户个性化设置，并调整用户注册或请求恢复密码时收到的电子邮件的文本。您还可以设置每当安装模块时自动分配新权限的角色（管理员角色）。"

msgid "In order to create and modify your own views using the administration and configuration user interface, you will need to install either the Views UI module in core or a contributed module that provides a user interface for Views. See the <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI module help page</a> for more information."
msgstr "为了使用管理和配置用户界面创建和修改您自己的视图，您需要安装核心中的视图 UI 模块或为视图提供用户界面的贡献模块。有关更多信息，请参阅 <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI 模块帮助页面</a>。"

