msgstr "该文件使用 %detected 编码。必须使用 %encoding 编码"

msgid "Enable text format"
msgstr "启用文本格式"

msgid "Any content saved with the %format text format will not be displayed on the site until it is resaved with an enabled text format."
msgstr "使用 %format 文本格式保存的任何内容在使用启用的文本格式重新保存之前都不会显示在网站上。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to enable the text format %format?"
msgstr "您确定要启用文本格式 %format 吗？"

msgid "This will make the %format format available."
msgstr "这将使 %format 格式可用。"

msgid "Enabled text format %format."
msgstr "启用文本格式 %format。"

msgid "The new site is missing modules corresponding to the old site's modules. Unless they are installed prior to the upgrade, configuration and/or content needed by them will not be available on your new site. <a href=\":review\">Read the checklist</a> to help decide what to do."
msgstr "新站点缺少与旧站点模块相对应的模块。除非在升级之前安装它们，否则它们所需的配置和/或内容将在您的新站点上不可用。 <a href=\":review\">阅读清单</a>以帮助决定要做什么。"

msgid "Link block"
msgstr "链接区块"

msgid "Icon CSS Class"
msgstr "图标 CSS 类"

msgid "The file %file could not be copied to the permanent destination. Contact the site administrator if the problem persists."
msgstr "无法将文件 %file 复制到永久目标。如果问题仍然存在，请联系站点管理员。"

msgid "Icon CSS class"
msgstr "图标 CSS 类"

msgid "The machine-readable name must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, underscores and hyphens."
msgstr "机器可读的名称必须仅包含小写字母、数字、下划线和连字符。"

msgid "Package Manager is available for early testing. To install the module set the value of 'testing_package_manager' to TRUE in your settings.php file."
msgstr "包管理器可用于早期测试。要安装该模块，请在 settings.php 文件中将“testing_package_manager”的值设置为 TRUE。"

msgid "Failed Package Manager update detected"
msgstr "检测到包管理器更新失败"

msgid "Package Manager requires a Composer executable whose version satisfies <code>@version</code>, and PHP must have permission to run it."
msgstr "包管理器需要一个版本满足<code>@version</code>的Composer可执行文件，并且PHP必须有运行它的权限。"

msgid "Some modules have database updates pending. You should run the <a href=\":update\">database update script</a> immediately."
msgstr "某些模块的数据库更新尚未完成。您应该立即运行<a href=\":update\">数据库更新脚本</a>。"

msgid "Display \"@display\" needs a selected \"Search fields\" value to work properly. See the settings for the \"Entity Reference list\" format."
msgstr "显示“@display”需要选择“搜索字段”值才能正常工作。请参阅“实体引用列表”格式的设置。"

msgid "Reference type \"@type\""
msgstr "参考类型“@type”"

msgid "For performance and UX reasons, the maximum count of selectable entities for the \"Select list\" selection type is limited to @count. If more is expected, select \"Autocomplete\" instead."
msgstr "出于性能和用户体验方面的原因，“选择列表”选择类型的可选实体的最大数量限制为 @count。如果需要更多，请选择“自动完成”。"

msgid "The Workflows module provides an API and an interface to create workflows with transitions between different states (for example publication or user status). These have to be provided by other modules such as the <a href=\":moderation\">Content Moderation module</a>. For more information, see the <a href=\":workflow\">online documentation for the Workflows module</a>."
msgstr "工作流模块提供 API 和接口来创建具有不同状态（例如发布或用户状态）之间转换的工作流。这些必须由其他模块提供，例如<a href=\":moderation\">内容审核模块</a>。有关详细信息，请参阅<a href=\":workflow\">工作流模块的在线文档</a>。"

msgid "The Workflows module provides an API and an interface to create workflows with transitions between different states (for example publication or user status). These have to be provided by other modules such as the Content Moderation module. For more information, see the <a href=\":workflow\">online documentation for the Workflows module</a>."
msgstr "工作流模块提供 API 和接口来创建具有不同状态（例如发布或用户状态）之间转换的工作流。这些必须由其他模块（例如内容审核模块）提供。有关详细信息，请参阅<a href=\":workflow\">工作流模块的在线文档</a>。"

msgid "Adding workflows"
msgstr "添加工作流"

msgid "You can <em>only</em> add workflows on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>, after you have installed a module that leverages the API such as the <a href=\":moderation\">Content Moderation module</a>."
msgstr "在安装利用 API 的模块（例如 <a href=\":moderation\"> 内容审核模块 </a>）后，您可以在 <em>only</em> 在 <a href=\":workflows\"> 工作流页面 </a> 上添加工作流。"

msgid "You can <em>only</em> add workflows on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>, after you have installed a module that leverages the API such as the Content Moderation module."
msgstr "安装利用 API 的模块（例如内容审核模块）后，您可以在 <a href=\":workflows\"> 工作流页面</a> 上添加工作流 <em>only</em>。"

msgid "Adding states"
msgstr "添加状态"

msgid "A workflow requires at least two states. States can be added when you add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>."
msgstr "一个工作流至少需要两个状态。当您在 <a href=\":workflows\"> 工作流页面 </a> 上添加或编辑工作流时，可以添加状态。"

msgid "Adding transitions"
msgstr "添加过渡"

msgid "A transition defines in which state an item can be save as next. It has one destination state, but can have several states <em>from</em> which the transition can be applied. Transitions can be added when you add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>."
msgstr "转换定义了项目可以保存为下一个的状态。它具有一个目标状态，但可以具有可应用转换的多个状态 <em>from</em>。当您在 <a href=\":workflows\"> 工作流页面 </a> 上添加或编辑工作流时，可以添加转换。"

msgid "Depending on the installed workflow type, additional configuration can be available in the edit form of a workflow."
msgstr "根据安装的工作流类型，可以在工作流的编辑表单中使用其他配置。"

msgid "The Workspaces UI module provides an interface for managing workspaces for the <a href=\":workspaces_module\">Workspaces module</a>. For more information, see the <a href=\":workspaces\">online documentation for the Workspaces UI module</a>."
msgstr "工作区 UI 模块提供用于管理 <a href=\":workspaces_module\"> 工作区模块 </a> 工作区的界面。有关详细信息，请参阅工作区 UI 模块</a> 的 <a href=\":workspaces\"> 在线文档。"

msgid "Conflicting user emails"
