msgid "Some user accounts have email addresses that differ only by case. For example, one account might have alice@example.com and another might have Alice@Example.com. See <a href=\":url\">Conflicting User Emails</a> for more information."
msgstr "某些用户帐户的电子邮件地址仅大小写不同。例如，一个帐户可能具有 alice@example.com，另一个帐户可能具有 Alice@Example.com。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\":url\"> 冲突的用户电子邮件</a>。"

