msgid "A custom string for deeplinking to an Android mobile app. Should be in the format 'package_name/host_path', e.g. 'com.example.android/example/hello-screen'. The 'android-app://' prefix will be included automatically."
msgstr "用于深度链接到 Android 移动应用程序的自定义字符串。应采用“package_name/host_path”格式，例如'com.example.android/example/hello-screen'。将自动包含“android-app://”前缀。"

msgid "This informs iOS devices to display a banner to a specific app. If used, it must provide the 'app-id' value, the 'affiliate-data' and 'app-argument' values are optional."
msgstr "这会通知 iOS 设备向特定应用程序显示横幅。如果使用，它必须提供“app-id”值，“affiliate-data”和“app-argument”值是可选的。"

msgid "If set to 'yes', the application will run in full-screen mode; the default behavior is to use Safari to display web content."
msgstr "如果设置为“yes”，应用程序将以全屏模式运行；默认行为是使用 Safari 显示网页内容。"

msgid "Requires the 'Web app capable' meta tag to be set to 'yes'. May be set to 'default', 'black', or 'black-translucent'."
msgstr "需要将“支持 Web 应用程序”元标记设置为“是”。可以设置为“默认”、“黑色”或“黑色半透明”。"

msgid "Apple Web App Title"
msgstr "Apple Web 应用程序标题"

msgid "A legacy meta tag for older versions of Internet Explorer on Windows, use the value 'on' to enable it; this tag is ignored by all other browsers."
msgstr "Windows 上旧版本 Internet Explorer 的旧元标记，使用值“on”来启用它；所有其他浏览器都会忽略此标记。"

msgid "If set to 'telephone=no' the page will not be checked for phone numbers, which would be presented."
msgstr "如果设置为“telephone=no”，则不会检查页面中显示的电话号码。"

msgid "Some older mobile browsers will expect this meta tag to be set to 'true' to indicate that the site has been designed with mobile browsers in mind."
msgstr "一些较旧的移动浏览器会期望此元标记设置为“true”，以表明该网站在设计时考虑了移动浏览器。"

msgid "Using the value 'width' tells certain mobile Internet Explorer browsers to display as-is, without being resized. Alternatively a numerical width may be used to indicate the desired page width the page should be rendered in: '240' is the suggested default, '176' for older browsers or '480' for newer devices with high DPI screens."
msgstr "使用值“width”告诉某些移动 Internet Explorer 浏览器按原样显示，而不调整大小。或者，可以使用数字宽度来指示页面应呈现的所需页面宽度：“240”是建议的默认值，“176”用于较旧的浏览器，“480”用于具有高 DPI 屏幕的较新设备。"

msgid "Allows tasks to be defined on child domains of the fully qualified domain name associated with the pinned site. Should be either 'true' or 'false'."
msgstr "允许在与固定站点关联的完全限定域名的子域上定义任务。应该是“真”或“假”。"

msgid "Should contain the full URL to a <a href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Browser configuration schema</a> file that further controls tile customizations."
msgstr "应包含进一步控制磁贴自定义的 <a href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Browser 配置 schema</a> 文件的完整 URL。"

msgid "A semi-colon -separated string containing 'polling-uri=' (required), 'polling-uri2=', 'polling-uri3=', 'polling-uri4=' and 'polling-uri5=' to indicate the URLs for notifications. May also contain a 'frequency=' value to specify how often (in minutes) the URLs will be polled; limited to 30, 60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default). May also contain the value 'cycle=' to control the notifications cycle."
msgstr "以分号分隔的字符串，包含“polling-uri=”（必需）、“polling-uri2=”、“polling-uri3=”、“polling-uri4=”和“polling-uri5=”，用于指示通知的 URL。还可能包含“Frequency=”值来指定轮询 URL 的频率（以分钟为单位）；限制为 30、60、360、720 或 1440（默认）。还可能包含值“cycle=”来控制通知周期。"

msgid "A semi-colon -separated string defining the 'jump' list task. Should contain the 'name=' value to specify the task's name, the 'action-uri=' value to set the URL to load when the jump list is clicked, the 'icon-uri=' value to set the URL to an icon file to be displayed, and 'window-type=' set to either 'tab' (default), 'self' or 'window' to control how the link opens in the browser."
msgstr "定义“跳转”列表任务的分号分隔字符串。应包含用于指定任务名称的“name=”值，用于设置单击跳转列表时要加载的 URL 的“action-uri=”值，用于设置要显示的图标文件的 URL 的“icon-uri=”值，以及设置为“tab”（默认）、“self”或“window”以控制链接在浏览器中打开方式的“window-type=”值。"

msgid "A semi-colon -separated value that controls the dimensions of the initial window. Should contain the values 'width=' and 'height=' to control the width and height respectively."
msgstr "控制初始窗口尺寸的分号分隔值。应包含值“width=”和“height=”来分别控制宽度和高度。"

msgid "Metatag: Open Graph Products"
msgstr "元标签：开放图谱产品"

msgid "This module allows a site to automatically provide structured metadata, aka \"meta tags\", about the site and individual pages."
msgstr "该模块允许站点自动提供有关站点和各个页面的结构化元数据，也称为“元标记”。"

msgid "In the context of search engine optimization, providing an extensive set of meta tags may help improve the site's and pages' rankings, thus may aid with achieving a more prominent display of the content within search engine results. They can also be used to tailor how content is displayed when shared on social networks. For additional information, see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for Metatag</a>."
msgstr "在搜索引擎优化的背景下，提供广泛的元标签集可以帮助提高网站和页面的排名，从而可以帮助在搜索引擎结果中实现内容的更突出的显示。它们还可以用于定制在社交网络上共享内容时的显示方式。有关其他信息，请参阅 Metatag</a> 的 <a href=\":online\">online 文档。"

msgid "The module uses <a href=\":tokens\">\"tokens\"</a> to automatically fill in values for different meta tags. Specific values may also be filled in."
msgstr "该模块使用<a href=\":tokens\">“令牌”</a>自动填充不同元标记的值。也可填写具体数值。"

msgid "The best way of using Metatag is as follows:"
msgstr "使用Metatag的最佳方式如下："

msgid "Customize the <a href=\":defaults\">global defaults</a>, fill in the specific values and tokens that every page should have."
msgstr "自定义<a href=\":defaults\">全局默认值</a>，填写每个页面应该有的具体值和标记。"

msgid "Override each of the <a href=\":defaults\">other defaults</a>, fill in specific values and tokens that each item should have by default. This allows e.g. for all nodes to have different values than taxonomy terms."
msgstr "覆盖每个 <a href=\":defaults\">other 默认值</a>，填写每个项目默认应具有的特定值和标记。这允许例如让所有节点具有与分类术语不同的值。"

msgid "<a href=\":add\">Add more default configurations</a> as necessary for different entity types and entity bundles, e.g. for different content types or different vocabularies."
msgstr "<a href=\":add\"> 根据不同实体类型和实体包的需要添加更多默认配置</a>，例如针对不同的内容类型或不同的词汇。"

msgid "To override the meta tags for individual entities, e.g. for individual nodes, add the \"Metatag\" field via the field settings for that entity or bundle type."
msgstr "覆盖单个实体的元标记，例如对于单个节点，通过该实体或捆绑包类型的字段设置添加“元标签”字段。"

