msgstr "已弃用的模块，请勿使用。将在 3.0.0 中删除。"

msgid "Separator used with multiple values"
msgstr "与多个值一起使用的分隔符"

msgid "Controls the separator used when a meta tag allows multiple values. Multiple characters can be used together, it does not have to be one single character long. Defaults to \":default\"."
msgstr "控制元标记允许多个值时使用的分隔符。多个字符可以一起使用，不必是一个字符长。默认为“:default”。"

msgid "Computed meta tags"
msgstr "计算元标签"

msgid "This will be truncated to a maximum of %max characters after any tokens are processed."
msgstr "处理任何标记后，这将被截断为最多 %max 个字符。"

msgid "Because of how tokens are processed in meta tags, use of the Maxlength module may not provide an accurate representation of the actual current length of each meta tag, so it may cause more problem than it is worth."
msgstr "由于元标记中标记的处理方式，使用 Maxlength 模块可能无法准确表示每个元标记的实际当前长度，因此可能会导致更多问题。"

msgid "End of the word trimming"
msgstr "词尾修剪"

msgid "This module provides support to define and manage custom meta tags."
msgstr "该模块提供定义和管理自定义元标记的支持。"

msgid "The module provides the option to create different <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">\"Custom Tags\"</a> to use for different purposes."
msgstr "该模块提供了创建不同 <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">“自定义标签”</a> 以用于不同目的的选项。"

msgid "The best way of using Metatag: Custom Tags is as follows:"
msgstr "使用Metatag：自定义标签的最佳方式如下："

msgid "Create the <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Custom Tag\"</a>, fill in the specific values that every page should have."
msgstr "创建<a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">“自定义标签”</a>，填写每个页面应该有的具体值。"

msgid "Configure Custom tags below."
msgstr "配置下面的自定义标签。"

msgid "Metatag: Custom Tags"
msgstr "元标签：自定义标签"

msgid "Add Custom tag"
msgstr "添加自定义标签"

msgid "Configure Custom tags."
msgstr "配置自定义标签。"

msgid "Administer Custom tags"
msgstr "管理自定义标签"

msgid "Control the main settings pages and modify custom tags."
msgstr "控制主要设置页面并修改自定义标签。"

msgid "Delete Custom tag"
msgstr "删除自定义标签"

msgid "Specify the name of the custom tag."
msgstr "指定自定义标签的名称。"

msgid "Specify the description of the Custom tag."
msgstr "指定自定义标签的描述。"

msgid "Select the HTML element of the Custom tag."
msgstr "选择自定义标记的 HTML 元素。"

msgid "Value attribute"
msgstr "值属性"

msgid "Created %label Custom tag."
msgstr "创建 %label 自定义标签。"

msgid "Updated %label Custom tag."
msgstr "更新了 %label 自定义标签。"

msgid "Edit Custom tag @label"
msgstr "编辑自定义标签@label"

msgid "These custom tags are designed to use the custom purpose on the website."
msgstr "这些自定义标签旨在用于网站上的自定义目的。"

msgid "Trimming options"
msgstr "修剪选项"

msgid "A list of characters to trim at the end of all metatags. Provide a single string without any separators, e.g. \"|,.\" (instead of \"| , .\"). Note that spaces, tabs, new lines, carriage returns and vertical tabs (\" \\n\\r\\t\\v\") will be trimmed automatically and do not need to be listed in this field. The trimming is applied at the very end after the tag is trimmed for length, and after the trimming option was executed."
msgstr "在所有元标记末尾要修剪的字符列表。提供不带任何分隔符的单个字符串，例如“|，”。 （而不是“|，.”）。请注意，空格、制表符、换行符、回车符和垂直制表符（“\\n\\r\\t\\v”）将被自动修剪，不需要在此字段中列出。在修剪标签长度并执行修剪选项后，在最后应用修剪。"

msgid "Configuration instance"
msgstr "配置实例"

msgid "Meta tag configuration, stored as either a serialized array or a JSON-encoded string."
msgstr "元标记配置，存储为序列化数组或 JSON 编码字符串。"

msgid "Expected an array but got null or other type for group: @group_name"
msgstr "需要一个数组，但组为 null 或其他类型：@group_name"

msgid "Optional suffix to add"
msgstr "添加可选后缀"

msgid "Element of the HTML tag. e.g. meta, link, etc."
msgstr "HTML 标签的元素。例如元、链接等"

msgid "The name of the html value attribute. e.g. content, href, charset, etc."
msgstr "html 值属性的名称。例如内容、href、字符集等"

msgid "Enter a unique identifier for this custom tag. This identifier can contain lowercase letters, numbers and underscores. This is only used internally, it is not used in the actual HTML output."
msgstr "输入此自定义标签的唯一标识符。该标识符可以包含小写字母、数字和下划线。这仅在内部使用，在实际的 HTML 输出中不使用。"

msgid "Select the Value attribute of the Custom tag. This determines which HTML attribute will contain the user-provided content."
msgstr "选择自定义标记的值属性。这决定了哪个 HTML 属性将包含用户提供的内容。"

msgid "Define the HTML attributes for this custom meta tag. The first attribute serves as the primary identifier and is required. Additional attributes are optional and provide fixed values for all instances of this tag."
msgstr "定义此自定义元标记的 HTML 属性。第一个属性用作主要标识符并且是必需的。其他属性是可选的，并为此标记的所有实例提供固定值。"

msgid "Primary attribute (Required)"
msgstr "主要属性（必填）"

msgid "Additional attribute @num"
msgstr "附加属性 @num"

msgid "This attribute identifies the meta tag and is required."
msgstr "该属性标识元标记并且是必需的。"

msgid "This attribute provides a fixed value for all instances of this tag."
msgstr "该属性为此标记的所有实例提供固定值。"

msgid "Common values: name, property, rel, http-equiv, itemprop."
msgstr "常用值：名称、属性、rel、http-equiv、itemprop。"

msgid "Additional attribute name (e.g., type, sizes)."
msgstr "附加属性名称（例如类型、尺寸）。"

msgid "For new tags, defaults to the machine name. For existing tags, this identifies the specific meta tag."
msgstr "对于新标签，默认为计算机名称。对于现有标签，这标识了特定的元标签。"

msgid "Fixed value for this attribute."
msgstr "该属性的固定值。"

msgid "\n        <h4>Common Examples:</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>Basic meta tag:</strong><br>\n            Primary attribute: name = \"description\"<br>\n            Result: &lt;meta name=\"description\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n          <li><strong>Open Graph tag:</strong><br>\n            Primary attribute: property = \"og:title\"<br>\n            Result: &lt;meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n          <li><strong>Twitter Card:</strong><br>\n            Primary attribute: name = \"twitter:card\"<br>\n            Result: &lt;meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n          <li><strong>Link with type:</strong><br>\n            Primary attribute: rel = \"icon\"<br>\n            Additional attribute: type = \"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n            Result: &lt;link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n        </ul>\n      "
msgstr "<h4>常见示例：</h4><ul><li><strong>基本元标记：</strong><br>主要属性：name=\"description\"<br>结果：&lt;meta name=\"description\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li><li><strong>Open Graph：</strong><br>主要属性：property=\"og:title\"<br>结果：&lt;meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li><li><strong>Twitter 卡片：</strong><br>主要属性：name=\"twitter:card\"<br>结果：&lt;meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li><li><strong>带类型的链接：</strong><br>主要属性：rel=\"icon\"<br>附加属性：type=\"image/svg+xml\"<br>结果：&lt;link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li></ul>"

