msgstr "视频发布日期。需要采用 <a href=\":url\">ISO 8601</a> 格式。"

msgid "The persons's first name."
msgstr "此人的名字。"

msgid "The URL of an image which should represent the content. Should be a minimum of 600px wide, though 1080px is recommended, with square images giving the best results. Supports PNG, JPEG and GIF formats (no SVG!). Should not be used if og:image:url is used. Note: if multiple images are added many services (e.g. Facebook) will default to the largest image, not specifically the first one."
msgstr "应代表内容的图像的 URL。宽度至少应为 600 像素，但建议使用 1080 像素，方形图像可提供最佳效果。支持 PNG、JPEG 和 GIF 格式（不支持 SVG！）。如果使用 og:image:url，则不应使用。注意：如果添加多个图像，许多服务（例如 Facebook）将默认使用最大的图像，而不是第一个图像。"

msgid "An alternative version of og:image and has exactly the same requirements; only one needs to be used."
msgstr "og:image 的替代版本具有完全相同的要求；只需要使用一个。"

msgid "The MIME type of image referenced above. Should be either 'image/gif' for a GIF image, 'image/jpeg' for a JPG/JPEG image, or 'image/png' for a PNG image. Note: there should be one value for each image, and having more than there are images may cause problems."
msgstr "上面引用的图像的 MIME 类型。对于 GIF 图像，应为“image/gif”；对于 JPG/JPEG 图像，应为“image/jpeg”；对于 PNG 图像，应为“image/png”。注意：每个图像应该有一个值，超过图像数量可能会导致问题。"

msgid "The locale these tags are marked up in. Must be in the format language_TERRITORY. Default is 'en_US'."
msgstr "这些标签标记所在的区域设置。必须采用 language_TERRITORY 格式。默认为“en_US”。"

msgid "A pseudonym/alias of this person."
msgstr "此人的笔名/别名。"

