msgid "Notes:<ul><li>No other fields are required for a Summary card.</li><li>Media player card requires the 'title', 'description', 'media player URL', 'media player width', 'media player height' and 'image' fields.</li><li>Summary Card with Large Image card requires the 'Summary' field and the 'image' field.</li><li>App Card requires the 'iPhone app ID' field, the 'iPad app ID' field and the 'Google Play app ID' field.</li></ul>"
msgstr "注意：<ul><li> 摘要卡不需要其他字段。</li><li> 媒体播放器卡需要“标题”、“描述”、“媒体播放器 URL”、“媒体播放器宽度”、“媒体播放器高度”和“图像”字段。</li><li> 带大图像卡的摘要卡需要“摘要”字段和“图像”字段。</li><li> 应用程序卡需要“iPhone 应用程序” ID”字段、“iPad 应用程序 ID”字段和“Google Play 应用程序 ID”字段。</li></ul>"

msgid "Geo-spatial information in 'latitude; longitude' format, e.g. '50.167958; -97.133185'; <a href=\":url\" aria-label=\"see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate system\">see Wikipedia for details</a>."
msgstr "“纬度”中的地理空间信息；经度' 格式，例如'50.167958； -97.133185'; <a href=\":url\" aria-label=\"see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate system\"> 有关详细信息，请参阅维基百科</a>。"

