msgstr "通过提供带有 rel=\"prev\" 链接的 URL，用于分页内容。"

msgid "Indicate to search engines and other page scrapers whether or not links should be followed. See <a href=\":url\">the W3C specifications</a> for further details. Note: this serves the same purpose as the HTTP header by the same name."
msgstr "向搜索引擎和其他页面抓取工具指示是否应遵循链接。有关更多详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\":url\"> W3C 规范</a>。注意：这与同名的 HTTP 标头具有相同的用途。"

msgid "Tell search engines when to index the page again. Very few search engines support this tag; it is more useful to use an <a href=\":url\">XML Sitemap</a> file."
msgstr "告诉搜索引擎何时再次索引该页面。很少有搜索引擎支持这个标签；使用 <a href=\":url\">XML Sitemap</a> 文件更有用。"

msgid "Sets a cookie on the visitor's browser. Can be in either NAME=VALUE format, or a more verbose format including the path and expiration date. See <a href=\":url\">MDN documentation on Set-Cookie</a> for full details on the syntax. No longer supported in modern browsers."
msgstr "在访问者的浏览器上设置 cookie。可以采用 NAME=VALUE 格式，也可以采用更详细的格式（包括路径和到期日期）。有关语法的完整详细信息，请参阅 Set-Cookie</a> 上的 <a href=\":url\">MDN 文档。现代浏览器不再支持。"

msgid "Defines the author of a page."
msgstr "定义页面的作者。"

msgid "Used to rate content for audience appropriateness. This tag has little known influence on search engine rankings, but can be used by browsers, browser extensions, and apps. The most common options are general, mature, restricted, 14 years, safe for kids. If you follow the <a href=\":docs\">RTA Documentation</a> you should enter RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA."
msgstr "用于对内容的受众适宜性进行评级。此标签对搜索引擎排名的影响鲜为人知，但可以由浏览器、浏览器扩展和应用程序使用。最常见的选项是一般、成熟、受限、14 岁、对儿童安全。如果您遵循 <a href=\":docs\">RTA 文档</a>，则应输入 RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA。"

msgid "This meta tag communicates with Google. There are currently two directives supported: 'nositelinkssearchbox' to not to show the sitelinks search box, and 'notranslate' to ask Google not to offer a translation of the page. Both options may be added, just separate them with a comma. See <a href=\":url\">meta tags that Google understands</a> for further details."
msgstr "此元标记与 Google 进行通信。目前支持两个指令：“nositelinkssearchbox”不显示附加链接搜索框，“notranslate”要求 Google 不提供页面翻译。两个选项都可以添加，只需用逗号分隔即可。有关更多详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\":url\">Google 可以理解的元标记</a>。"

msgid "Control when the browser's internal cache of the current page should expire. The date must to be an <a href=\":url\">RFC-1123</a>-compliant date string that is represented in Greenwich Mean Time (GMT), e.g. 'Thu, 01 Sep 2016 00:12:56 GMT'. Set to '0' to stop the page being cached entirely."
msgstr "控制当前页面的浏览器内部缓存何时到期。日期必须是符合 <a href=\":url\">RFC-1123</a> 的日期字符串，以格林威治标准时间 (GMT) 表示，例如“2016 年 9 月 1 日星期四 00:12:56 GMT”。设置为“0”可完全停止缓存页面。"

